 Lightsail com Node.js","Lightsail e React"],"ru":["как подключиться к Lightsail","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","Lightsail альтернатива","настроить Lightsail","руководства по установке Lightsail","оптимизировать рабочий процесс с Lightsail","Lightsail vs AWS","использовать Lightsail с Node.js","Lightsail и React"],"ar":["كيفية الاتصال بخدمة Lightsail","أدوات ذكية للطورين","بديل Lightsail","تكوين Lightsail","دلائل تركيب Lightsail","تحسين تدفق العمل مع Lightsail","Lightsail مقابل AWS","استخدام Lightsail مع Node.js","Lightsail و React"]}},"owner":"ozahirnyi","repo":"movie_finder","repoPath":"ozahirnyi/movie_finder","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.845Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"connect-to-lightsail-instance","description":"How to SSH to the Movie Finder Lightsail instance. Use when the user asks to connect to the instance, check deploy logs, or run commands on the production server.","bodyPreview":"# Connect to Lightsail instance\n\n## Connection details\n\n| What   | Value |\n|--------|--------|\n| **Key** | `LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem` (in project root; may be gitignored) |\n| **User** | `ec2-user` |\n| **Host** | `3.75.113.52` (update if instance IP changed) |\n\nKey path in workspace: `o:\\projects\\movie_finder\\LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem` (Windows) or `o:/projects/movie_finder/LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem` (Git Bash).\n\n## Commands\n\n**Interactive SSH (open a shell on th","body":"# Connect to Lightsail instance\n\n## Connection details\n\n| What   | Value |\n|--------|--------|\n| **Key** | `LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem` (in project root; may be gitignored) |\n| **User** | `ec2-user` |\n| **Host** | `3.75.113.52` (update if instance IP changed) |\n\nKey path in workspace: `o:\\projects\\movie_finder\\LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem` (Windows) or `o:/projects/movie_finder/LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem` (Git Bash).\n\n## Commands\n\n**Interactive SSH (open a shell on the instance):**\n```bash\nssh -i \"o:\\projects\\movie_finder\\LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem\" -o StrictHostKeyChecking=accept-new ec2-user@3.75.113.52\n```\n\n**Run a single command on the instance (no interactive shell):**\n```bash\nssh -i \"o:\\projects\\movie_finder\\LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem\" -o StrictHostKeyChecking=accept-new ec2-user@3.75.113.52 \"COMMAND_HERE\"\n```\n\n**Examples:**\n- **Backend only (512 MB: Grafana off)** — app on 8000, nginx on host uses 80/443 and proxies to 8000:  \n  `\"cd /home/ec2-user/movie_finder && docker-compose -f docker-compose.lightsail.yml up -d\"`  \n  Without nginx (app directly on 80):  \n  `\"cd /home/ec2-user/movie_finder && docker-compose -f docker-compose.lightsail.yml -f docker-compose.lightsail-direct.yml up -d\"`\n- Start backend + Grafana (when instance has ≥1 GB RAM):  \n  `\"cd /home/ec2-user/movie_finder && docker-compose -f docker-compose.lightsail.yml -f docker-compose.monitoring.yml up -d\"`\n- **Stop monitoring** (free RAM) — запускай **першим після ребуту**, щоб Grafana не піднялась:  \n  `\"cd /home/ec2-user/movie_finder && docker-compose -f docker-compose.lightsail.yml -f docker-compose.monitoring.yml down 2>/dev/null; docker-compose -f docker-compose.lightsail.yml up -d\"`\n- CodeDeploy agent log (last 250 lines):  \n  `\"sudo tail -250 /var/log/aws/codedeploy-agent/codedeploy-agent.log\"`\n- Docker containers (backend only):  \n  `\"cd /home/ec2-user/movie_finder && docker-compose -f docker-compose.lightsail.yml ps\"`\n- **Error logs (for debugging)** — logs are kept by Docker until rotation; recent errors are still there. Agent can run this when you report an error:  \n  `\"cd /home/ec2-user/movie_finder && docker-compose -f docker-compose.lightsail.yml logs --tail=300 web 2>&1 | grep -iE ''error|exception|traceback|500|failed''\"`  \n  Full last 200 lines:  \n  `\"cd /home/ec2-user/movie_finder && docker-compose -f docker-compose.lightsail.yml logs --tail=200 web\"`\n\n## Script\n\nTo fetch deploy logs without typing the full SSH command:\n```bash\n./scripts/deploy/fetch-deploy-logs.sh \"o:/projects/movie_finder/LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem\" 3.75.113.52\n```\n\n## Manual deploy (use while CI is broken)\n\n**Deploy via CI is currently not working. Always update production yourself** after pushing changes that should go to prod.\n\n**On 512 MB instance run backend only (no Grafana).** Grafana eats RAM, so **always stop it first**, then do pull/rebuild.\n\n**Order of operations (important):**\n\n0. **Спочатку вимкнути Grafana** (звільнити пам’ять), потім уже pull/build:\n   `\"cd /home/ec2-user/movie_finder && docker-compose -f docker-compose.lightsail.yml -f docker-compose.monitoring.yml down 2>/dev/null; docker-compose -f docker-compose.lightsail.yml up -d\"`\n   (Якщо моніторинг не був запущений — підніме backend на 8000; nginx на 80/443.)\n1. **Pull latest code:**\n   `\"cd /home/ec2-user/movie_finder && git fetch origin main && git reset --hard origin/main\"`\n2. **Rebuild app image (if code changed):**\n   `\"cd /home/ec2-user/movie_finder && docker-compose -f docker-compose.lightsail.yml build web\"`\n   (Uses cache: only changed layers rebuild. Use `build --no-cache web` only when dependencies or Dockerfile changed.)\n3. **Migrations + static (if needed):**\n   `\"cd /home/ec2-user/movie_finder && docker-compose -f docker-compose.lightsail.yml run --rm web poetry run python manage.py migrate --noinput && docker-compose -f docker-compose.lightsail.yml run --rm web poetry run python manage.py collectstatic --noinput\"`\n4. **Restart backend only** (app on 8000, nginx на 80):\n   `\"cd /home/ec2-user/movie_finder && docker-compose -f docker-compose.lightsail.yml up -d\"`\n\n**Після ребуту інстансу:** спочатку крок 0 (щоб Grafana/observability не піднімались і не забивали пам’ять), потім 1–4. Не запускай `docker-compose.monitoring.yml` на 512 MB — інстанс зависає.\n\n**Логи:** при роботі тільки `docker-compose.lightsail.yml` (web + db) усі stdout/stderr контейнера `web` пишуться в Docker (драйвер json-file). Перегляд: `docker-compose -f docker-compose.lightsail.yml logs --tail=200 web` або з grep по error (див. Error logs вище). Ротація логів за замовчуванням — логи зберігаються, поки не перезапустиш контейнер або не спрацює ротація.\n\nIf you upgrade to ≥1 GB RAM and want Grafana again, use `-f docker-compose.monitoring.yml` in step 4 and start with both compose files.\n\n## Error logs when something breaks\n\nWhen you report an error (e.g. 500, crash), the agent can try to SSH and run the **Error logs** command above to fetch recent error/exception lines from the `web` container. Docker keeps container stdout/stderr in a log file (json-file driver) until it’s rotated or the container is removed, so **recent errors usually stay available** for at least the last restarts / last tens of MB of logs. They don’t disappear instantly; only when the log is rotated or the container is recreated and the old log is discarded.\n\n## Notes\n\n- If the instance IP changes (e.g. after rebuild), update the host in this skill and in `TROUBLESHOOTING_CODEDEPLOY.md`.\n- The key file is in `.gitignore` (`*.pem`); it must exist locally in the project or another path you pass to `ssh -i`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:47:59.186Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents needing secure SSH connections to Lightsail instances.","zh":"非常适合需要安全SSH连接到Lightsail实例的Cloud Agent。","ja":"Lightsailインスタンスへの安全なSSH接続を必要とするCloud Agentに最適です。","ko":"Lightsail 인스턴스에 대한 보안 SSH 연결이 필요한 Cloud Agent에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes en la nube que necesitan conexiones SSH seguras a instancias de Lightsail.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud nécessitant des connexions SSH sécurisées aux instances Lightsail.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agents, die sichere SSH-Verbindungen zu Lightsail-Instanzen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Nuvem que necessitam de conexões SSH seguras com instâncias do Lightsail.","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, требующих безопасных подключений SSH к экземплярам Lightsail.","ar":"مثالي لعميل السحابة الذي يحتاج إلى اتصالات SSH آمنة مع مثيلات Lightsail."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to establish interactive SSH connections to Lightsail instances using private keys like LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem, facilitating remote shell access and command execution over protocols like SSH.","zh":"赋予代理建立与Lightsail实例的交互式SSH连接的能力，使用诸如LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem的私钥，方便通过SSH协议进行远程shell访问和命令执行。","ja":"LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pemのようなプライベートキーを使用して、LightsailインスタンスへのインタラクティブなSSH接続をエージェントに確立できるようにし、SSHプロトコルを介したリモートシェルアクセスとコマンド実行を容易にします。","ko":"LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem과 같은 개인 키를 사용하여 Lightsail 인스턴스에 대한 상호 작용 SSH 연결을 에이전트에 설정할 수 있도록 하여 SSH 프로토콜을 통해 원격 셸 액세스 및 명령 실행을 쉽게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes establecer conexiones SSH interactivas con instancias de Lightsail utilizando claves privadas como LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem, lo que facilita el acceso a la shell remota y la ejecución de comandos a través de protocolos como SSH.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''établir des connexions SSH interactives avec des instances Lightsail en utilisant des clés privées comme LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem, ce qui facilite l''accès à la shell distante et l''exécution de commandes via des protocoles comme SSH.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, interaktive SSH-Verbindungen zu Lightsail-Instanzen mit privaten Schlüsseln wie LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem herzustellen, was den Fernzugriff auf die Shell und die Ausführung von Befehlen über Protokolle wie SSH erleichtert.","pt":"Permite que os agentes estabeleçam conexões SSH interativas com instâncias do Lightsail usando chaves privadas como LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem, facilitando o acesso à shell remota e a execução de comandos sobre protocolos como SSH.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность устанавливать интерактивные подключения SSH к экземплярам Lightsail с помощью закрытых ключей, таких как LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem, что облегчает удаленный доступ к командной строке и выполнение команд по протоколам, таким как SSH.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء اتصالات SSH تفاعلية مع مثيلات Lightsail باستخدام مفاتيح خاصة مثل LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem، مما يسهل الوصول إلى Shell عن بعد وتشغيل الأوامر عبر بروتوكولات مثل SSH."},"useCases":{"en":["Establishing secure connections to Lightsail instances","Executing remote commands on Lightsail instances","Debugging Lightsail instance configurations"],"zh":["建立Lightsail实例的安全连接","在Lightsail实例上执行远程命令","调试Lightsail实例配置"],"ja":["Lightsailインスタンスへの安全な接続の確立","Lightsailインスタンスでのリモートコマンドの実行","Lightsailインスタンスの設定のデバッグ"],"ko":["Lightsail 인스턴스에 대한 보안 연결 설정","Lightsail 인스턴스에서 원격 명령 실행","Lightsail 인스턴스 구성 디버깅"],"es":["Establecer conexiones seguras a instancias de Lightsail","Ejecutar comandos remotos en instancias de Lightsail","Depurar configuraciones de instancias de Lightsail"],"fr":["Établir des connexions sécurisées aux instances Lightsail","Exécuter des commandes à distance sur des instances Lightsail","Déboguer les configurations d''instances Lightsail"],"de":["Sichere Verbindungen zu Lightsail-Instanzen herstellen","Remote-Befehle auf Lightsail-Instanzen ausführen","Konfigurationen von Lightsail-Instanzen debuggen"],"pt":["Estabelecer conexões seguras com instâncias do Lightsail","Executar comandos remotos em instâncias do Lightsail","Depurar configurações de instâncias do Lightsail"],"ru":["Установка безопасных подключений к экземплярам Lightsail","Выполнение удаленных команд на экземплярах Lightsail","Отладка конфигураций экземпляров Lightsail"],"ar":["إنشاء اتصالات آمنة مع مثيلات Lightsail","تشغيل أوامر عن بعد على مثيلات Lightsail","تصحيح أخطاء تكوين مثيلات Lightsail"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Lightsail instance IP and private key file like LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem","Limited to Lightsail instances","Dependent on SSH protocol compatibility"],"zh":["需要Lightsail实例IP和私钥文件，如LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem","仅限Lightsail实例","依赖SSH协议兼容性"],"ja":["LightsailインスタンスのIPとプライベートキー ファイル（LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pemなど）が必要","Lightsailインスタンスのみ","SSHプロトコルの互換性に依存"],"ko":["Lightsail 인스턴스 IP 및 개인 키 파일(LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem 등) 필요","Lightsail 인스턴스만 해당","SSH 프로토콜 호환성에 종속"],"es":["Requiere la dirección IP de la instancia de Lightsail y el archivo de clave privada como LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem","Limitado a instancias de Lightsail","Dependiente de la compatibilidad del protocolo SSH"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adresse IP de l''instance Lightsail et le fichier de clé privée comme LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem","Limité aux instances Lightsail","Dépendant de la compatibilité du protocole SSH"],"de":["Benötigt die IP-Adresse der Lightsail-Instanz und die private Schlüsseldatei wie LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem","Begrenzt auf Lightsail-Instanzen","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität des SSH-Protokolls"],"pt":["Requer o endereço IP da instância do Lightsail e o arquivo de chave privada como LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem","Limitado a instâncias do Lightsail","Dependente da compatibilidade do protocolo SSH"],"ru":["Требует IP-адреса экземпляра Lightsail и файла закрытого ключа, такого как LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem","Ограничен экземплярами Lightsail","Зависит от совместимости протокола SSH"],"ar":["يتطلب عنوان IP لمثيل Lightsail وملف مفتاح خاص مثل LightsailDefaultKey-eu-central-1.pem","محدود بمثيلات Lightsail","يعتمد على توافق بروتوكول SSH"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"df71d903e6f2f59a6c5273a1b717ecc4802f8f800cd62ee4c6a1e83041388d73","qualityScore":31}');
