["Lenguaje de descripción de interfaz de usuario basado en Golang","Permite crear interfaces de usuario personalizadas para Flutter","Integración con el framework Duit","Facilidad de uso y aprendizaje","Permite la creación de interfaces de usuario complejas"],"fr":["Langage de description d''interface utilisateur basé sur Golang","Permet de créer des interfaces utilisateur personnalisées pour Flutter","Intégration avec le framework Duit","Facilité d''utilisation et d''apprentissage","Permet de créer des interfaces utilisateur complexes"],"de":["Benutzeroberflächen-DSL auf Basis von Golang","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen für Flutter","Integration mit dem Duit-Framework","Einfachheit bei der Verwendung und dem Lernen","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von komplexen Benutzeroberflächen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de UIs personalizadas para Flutter","Uso de linguagem de domínio específico em Golang","Integração com o Duit Framework","Criação de interfaces de usuário flexíveis e escaláveis","Suporte à personalização de layouts e designs"],"ru":["Разработка индивидуальных UI для Flutter","Использование языка домénного específico на Golang","Интеграция с Duit Framework","Создание гибких и масштабируемых интерфейсов пользователя","Поддержка настройки макетов и дизайнов"],"ar":["تطوير واجهات مستخدم مخصصة ل Flutter","استخدام لغة مجال معينة في Golang","التكامل مع Duit Framework","إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مرنة وقابلة للتوسيع","دعم تخصيص تخطيطات والتصاميم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Duit Maintainer","Golang DSL","驱动UI","Flutter应用开发","Duit Framework","如何使用Duit Maintainer","Duit Maintainer教程","Duit Maintainer安装","Duit Maintainer设置指南"],"ja":["Duit Maintainer","Golang DSL","driven UI","Flutterアプリの開発","Duit Framework","Duit Maintainerの使い方","Duit Maintainerのチュートリアル","Duit Maintainerのインストール","Duit Maintainerの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Duit Maintainer","Golang DSL","드라이븐 UI","Flutter 애플리케이션 개발","Duit Framework","Duit Maintainer 사용법","Duit Maintainer 튜토리얼","Duit Maintainer 설치","Duit Maintainer 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial","duit-maintainer","Golang","Flutter","interfaces de usuario personalizadas","cómo usar duit-maintainer","duit-maintainer vs otros frameworks","instalación de duit-maintainer"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle","duit-maintainer","Golang","Flutter","interfaces utilisateur personnalisées","comment utiliser duit-maintainer","duit-maintainer vs autres frameworks","installation de duit-maintainer"],"de":["KI-Tools","duit-maintainer","Golang","Flutter","benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächen","duit-maintainer-Anleitung","duit-maintainer vs andere Frameworks","duit-maintainer-Installation"],"pt":["como usar duit-maintainer","o que é duit-maintainer","duit-maintainer vs outras ferramentas","instalar duit-maintainer","guias de configuração duit-maintainer","desenvolvimento de UIs personalizadas","Golang para desenvolvedores","Duit Framework tutorial"],"ru":["как использовать duit-maintainer","что такое duit-maintainer","duit-maintainer vs другие инструменты","установить duit-maintainer","руководства по настройке duit-maintainer","разработка индивидуальных UI","Golang для разработчиков","Duit Framework уроки"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام duit-maintainer","ما هو duit-maintainer","duit-maintainer مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت duit-maintainer","دليل إعداد duit-maintainer","تطوير واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","Golang ل المطورين","دروس Duit Framework"]}},"owner":"Duit-Foundation","repo":"duit_go","repoPath":"Duit-Foundation/duit_go","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.882Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"duit-maintainer","description":"Implements new Flutter widgets following Duit project patterns, conducts code reviews, writes tests, and enforces coding conventions. Use when implementing new widget functionality, reviewing Flutter widget code, or maintaining the Duit library.","bodyPreview":"# Duit Maintainer\n\n## Quick Start\n\nWhen implementing a new Flutter widget for the Duit library, follow this workflow:\n\n1. Create attributes structure in `pkg/duit_attributes/`\n2. Add widget type to `pkg/duit_core/element_type.go`\n3. Add widget function in `pkg/duit_widget/`\n4. Run code generation: `make gogen`\n5. Write tests if required\n\n## Widget Implementation Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Create Attributes Structure\n\nCreate a new file in `pkg/duit_attributes/` named `{widget_name}_attributes.go`:\n\n``","body":"# Duit Maintainer\n\n## Quick Start\n\nWhen implementing a new Flutter widget for the Duit library, follow this workflow:\n\n1. Create attributes structure in `pkg/duit_attributes/`\n2. Add widget type to `pkg/duit_core/element_type.go`\n3. Add widget function in `pkg/duit_widget/`\n4. Run code generation: `make gogen`\n5. Write tests if required\n\n## Widget Implementation Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Create Attributes Structure\n\nCreate a new file in `pkg/duit_attributes/` named `{widget_name}_attributes.go`:\n\n```go\npackage duit_attributes\n\nimport (\n    \"errors\"\n    \"github.com/Duit-Foundation/duit_go/v4/pkg/duit_utils\"\n)\n\n// WidgetNameAttributes defines attributes for WidgetName widget.\n// See: https://api.flutter.dev/flutter/widgets/WidgetName-class.html\ntype WidgetNameAttributes struct {\n    *ValueReferenceHolder `gen:\"wrap\"`\n    *ThemeConsumer        `gen:\"wrap\"`\n    Property1             duit_utils.Tristate[bool] `json:\"property1,omitempty\"`\n    Property2             string                     `json:\"property2,omitempty\"`\n}\n\n// NewWidgetNameAttributes creates a new WidgetNameAttributes instance.\nfunc NewWidgetNameAttributes() *WidgetNameAttributes {\n    return &WidgetNameAttributes{}\n}\n\n// SetProperty1 sets the property1 and returns WidgetNameAttributes for method chaining.\nfunc (r *WidgetNameAttributes) SetProperty1(property1 bool) *WidgetNameAttributes {\n    r.Property1 = duit_utils.BoolValue(property1)\n    return r\n}\n\n// SetProperty2 sets the property2 and returns WidgetNameAttributes for method chaining.\nfunc (r *WidgetNameAttributes) SetProperty2(property2 string) *WidgetNameAttributes {\n    r.Property2 = property2\n    return r\n}\n\n//bindgen:exclude\nfunc (r *WidgetNameAttributes) Validate() error {\n    if err := r.ValueReferenceHolder.Validate(); err != nil {\n        return err\n    }\n\n    if err := r.ThemeConsumer.Validate(); err != nil {\n        return err\n    }\n\n    if r.Property1 == nil {\n        return errors.New(\"property1 is required\")\n    }\n\n    return nil\n}\n```\n\n**Rules:**\n\n- Use `*ValueReferenceHolder` with `gen:\"wrap\"` tag\n- Use `*ThemeConsumer` with `gen:\"wrap\"` tag\n- Use `duit_utils.Tristate[T]` for optional boolean properties\n- Add `json:\"propertyName,omitempty\"` tag for all fields\n- Method receiver must be named `r`\n- Add `//bindgen:exclude` comment to `Validate()` method\n- Documentation must be in English\n\n### Step 2: Add Widget Type\n\nAdd a constant to `pkg/duit_core/element_type.go`:\n\n```go\nconst (\n    // ... existing types\n    WidgetName DuitElementType = \"WidgetName\"\n)\n```\n\nFollow naming convention: Use PascalCase with no spaces or underscores.\n\n### Step 3: Add Widget Function\n\nCreate a new file in `pkg/duit_widget/` named `{widget_name}.go`:\n\n```go\npackage duit_widget\n\nimport (\n    \"github.com/Duit-Foundation/duit_go/v4/pkg/duit_attributes\"\n    \"github.com/Duit-Foundation/duit_go/v4/pkg/duit_core\"\n)\n\n/*\nExample:\n    WidgetName(\n        duit_attributes.NewWidgetNameAttributes().\n            SetProperty1(true).\n            SetProperty2(\"value\"),\n        \"id\",\n        false,\n        nil,\n    )\n*/\nfunc WidgetName(attributes *duit_attributes.WidgetNameAttributes, id string, controlled bool, child *duit_core.DuitElementModel) *duit_core.DuitElementModel {\n    checkAttributes(attributes)\n    return new(duit_core.DuitElementModel).CreateElement(duit_core.WidgetName, id, \"\", attributes, nil, controlled, 1, nil, child)\n}\n```\n\n**Function signature patterns:**\n\n- **Single child**: `func WidgetName(attributes *Attrs, id string, controlled bool, child *DuitElementModel) *DuitElementModel`\n- **Multiple children**: `func WidgetName(attributes *Attrs, id string, controlled bool, children []*DuitElementModel) *DuitElementModel`\n- **Optional child**: `func WidgetName(attributes *Attrs, id string, child *DuitElementModel) *DuitElementModel`\n\n**CreateElement parameters:**\n\n1. Widget type constant\n2. ID string\n3. Tag string (empty for most widgets)\n4. Attributes\n5. Commands (nil for most widgets)\n6. Controlled boolean\n7. Children count (use 2 for widgets with optional child like Visibility)\n8. Nil (reserved)\n9. Children (variadic)\n\n**Rules:**\n\n- Always call `checkAttributes(attributes)` to validate\n- Use `new(DuitElementModel).CreateElement(...)`\n- Add example usage in comment\n\n### Step 4: Run Code Generation\n\n```bash\nmake gogen\n```\n\nThis generates embedded struct delegates and other boilerplate code.\n\n### Step 5: Write Tests\n\nOnly write tests when explicitly required. When required, create `{widget_name}_attributes_test.go` in `pkg/duit_attributes/`:\n\n```go\npackage duit_attributes_test\n\nimport (\n    \"testing\"\n\n    \"github.com/Duit-Foundation/duit_go/v4/pkg/duit_attributes\"\n)\n\nfunc TestWidgetNameAttributes_Validate_ValidAttributes(t *testing.T) {\n    attrs := &duit_attributes.WidgetNameAttributes{\n        Property1: duit_utils.BoolValue(true),\n    }\n\n    err := attrs.Validate()\n    if err != nil {\n        t.Fatal(\"expected no error for valid attributes, got:\", err)\n    }\n}\n\nfunc TestWidgetNameAttributes_Validate_MissingRequiredProperty(t *testing.T) {\n    attrs := &duit_attributes.WidgetNameAttributes{\n        Property1: nil, // missing required property\n    }\n\n    err := attrs.Validate()\n    if err == nil {\n        t.Fatal(\"expected error for missing required property\")\n    }\n}\n\nfunc TestWidgetNameAttributes_SetProperty1(t *testing.T) {\n    attrs := duit_attributes.NewWidgetNameAttributes()\n    property1 := true\n\n    result := attrs.SetProperty1(property1)\n\n    if *attrs.Property1 != property1 {\n        t.Fatalf(\"expected Property1 to be %v, got: %v\", property1, attrs.Property1)\n    }\n\n    if result != attrs {\n        t.Fatal(\"expected SetProperty1 to return same instance for method chaining\")\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Testing rules:**\n\n- Test filename: `{target_file}_test.go`\n- Only test properties explicitly used in structure''s methods\n- Always test `Tristate[T]` properties for JSON serialization\n- Never check error text, only check if error exists\n- Never cover embedded fields or embedded structs\n- Test setter methods return same instance for chaining\n\n## Code Review Checklist\n\nWhen reviewing widget implementations, check:\n\n- [ ] Receiver name is `r` for all structure methods\n- [ ] Documentation is in English\n- [ ] Method chaining returns same instance (`return r`)\n- [ ] Required properties validated in `Validate()` method\n- [ ] `Validate()` has `//bindgen:exclude` comment\n- [ ] `checkAttributes()` called in widget function\n- [ ] Widget type follows naming convention (PascalCase)\n- [ ] Attributes use appropriate types (`Tristate[T]` for optionals)\n- [ ] JSON tags use `omitempty` suffix\n- [ ] Example usage comment present in widget file\n- [ ] Nil checks for potentially nil receivers before method calls\n\n## Coding Conventions\n\n### Style Rules\n\nFrom `pkg/.cursor/rules/style.mdc`:\n\n1. Method receiver name must always be \"r\"\n2. Documentation must be in English\n3. Explicit nil checks for potentially nil receivers\n\n### Testing Rules\n\nFrom `pkg/.cursor/rules/testing.mdc`:\n\n1. Never cover embedded fields or embedded structs with tests\n2. Always add tests for `Tristate[T]` properties (JSON serialization)\n3. Test filename: `{target_file}_test.go`\n4. Only test properties explicitly used in structure''s methods\n5. Never check error text, only check if error exists\n\n### Flutter Documentation Reference\n\nAlways reference official Flutter documentation in attributes structure:\n\n```go\n// See: https://api.flutter.dev/flutter/widgets/WidgetName-class.html\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Required Properties\n\n```go\nif r.RequiredProperty == nil {\n    return errors.New(\"requiredProperty is required\")\n}\n```\n\n### Optional Properties (Tristate)\n\n```go\ntype WidgetAttributes struct {\n    OptionalProperty duit_utils.Tristate[bool] `json:\"optionalProperty,omitempty\"`\n}\n\n// SetOptionalProperty sets the optional property.\nfunc (r *WidgetAttributes) SetOptionalProperty(optional bool) *WidgetAttributes {\n    r.OptionalProperty = duit_utils.BoolValue(optional)\n    return r\n}\n```\n\n### String Properties\n\n```go\ntype WidgetAttributes struct {\n    TextProperty string `json:\"textProperty,omitempty\"`\n}\n\n// SetTextProperty sets the text property.\nfunc (r *WidgetAttributes) SetTextProperty(text string) *WidgetAttributes {\n    r.TextProperty = text\n    return r\n}\n```\n\n### Nil-Safe Method Calls\n\n```go\nfunc SomeFunction(widget *DuitElementModel) {\n    if widget == nil {\n        return\n    }\n    widget.SomeMethod()\n}\n```\n\n## Makefile Commands\n\n```bash\n# Generate code\nmake gogen\n\n# Run tests\nmake test\n\n# Run vet\nmake vet\n```\n\nAlways run `make gogen` after adding new widgets.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Code generation fails\n\n- Check that `gen:\"wrap\"` tags are present for embedded structs\n- Verify attribute struct has no syntax errors\n- Ensure all referenced types are imported\n\n### Tests fail\n\n- Check that required properties are set in test\n- Verify Tristate properties are tested for JSON serialization\n- Ensure error checks don''t compare error text\n\n### Widget not recognized\n\n- Verify type is added to `element_type.go`\n- Check type name matches exactly in widget function\n- Run `make gogen` to regenerate delegates\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:53:56.713Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for AI Agents specializing in Flutter UI code generation and Duit framework maintenance.","zh":"适用于专门从事Flutter UI代码生成和Duit框架维护的AI代理。","ja":"Flutter UIコード生成およびDuitフレームワークのメンテナンスを専門とするAIエージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"Flutter UI 코드 생성 및 Duit 프레임워크 유지 관리를 전문으로 하는 AI 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de IA que se especializan en la generación de código de interfaz de usuario de Flutter y el mantenimiento del framework Duit.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents d''IA spécialisés dans la génération de code d''interface utilisateur Flutter et la maintenance du framework Duit.","de":"Wesentlich für KI-Agents, die auf die Generierung von Flutter-Benutzeroberflächen-Code und die Wartung des Duit-Frameworks spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de IA especializados em geração de código de interface do usuário Flutter e manutenção do framework Duit.","ru":"Необходимо для ИИ-агентов, специализирующихся на генерации кода интерфейса пользователя Flutter и поддержке фреймворка Duit.","ar":"ضروري للوكلاء الذكية المتخصصة في توليد واجهة المستخدم Flutter واستدامة إطار Duit."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to systematically extend the Duit Framework by generating Golang DSL code for Flutter widgets. It provides structured workflows for attribute creation, widget registration, and automated code generation using makefile commands.","zh":"使代理能够系统地通过生成用于Flutter小部件的Golang DSL代码来扩展Duit框架。它为属性创建、小部件注册和使用makefile命令进行自动代码生成提供了结构化的工作流程。","ja":"エージェントがGolang DSLコードを生成してDuitフレームワークを体系的に拡張できるようにします。属性の作成、ウィジェットの登録、およびmakefileコマンドを使用した自動コード生成のための構造化されたワークフローを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Golang DSL 코드를 생성하여 Duit 프레임워크를 체계적으로 확장할 수 있도록 합니다. 속성 생성, 위젯 등록 및 makefile 명령을 사용한 자동 코드 생성을 위한 구조화된 워크플로를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ampliar sistemáticamente el framework Duit generando código DSL de Golang para widgets de Flutter. Proporciona flujos de trabajo estructurados para la creación de atributos, el registro de widgets y la generación de código automatizada utilizando comandos de makefile.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''étendre systématiquement le framework Duit en générant du code DSL Golang pour les widgets Flutter. Il fournit des flux de travail structurés pour la création d''attributs, l''enregistrement de widgets et la génération de code automatisée à l''aide de commandes makefile.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, das Duit-Framework systematisch durch die Generierung von Golang-DSL-Code für Flutter-Widgets zu erweitern. Es bietet strukturierte Workflows für die Erstellung von Attributen, die Registrierung von Widgets und die automatisierte Codegenerierung mit makefile-Befehlen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes estendam sistematicamente o Framework Duit gerando código DSL Golang para widgets Flutter. Fornece fluxos de trabalho estruturados para criação de atributos, registro de widgets e geração automática de código usando comandos makefile.","ru":"Позволяет агентам систематически расширять фреймворк Duit, генерируя код DSL Golang для виджетов Flutter. Он обеспечивает структурированные рабочие процессы для создания атрибутов, регистрации виджетов и автоматической генерации кода с помощью команд makefile.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من خلاله تعميم إطار Duit بشكل منهجي عن طريق توليد代码 DSL Golang لعناصر واجهة المستخدم Flutter. كما يوفر سير عمل منظم لإنشاء الهياكل، وتسجيل العناصر، وتوليد الكود تلقائيًا باستخدام أوامر makefile."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Flutter widget code generation for Duit Framework","Implementing new widget attribute structures in pkg/duit_attributes/","Running code generation workflows with make gogen command"],"zh":["为Duit框架自动生成Flutter小部件代码","在pkg/duit_attributes/中实现新的小部件属性结构","使用make gogen命令运行代码生成工作流"],"ja":["Duitフレームワーク用のFlutterウィジェットコードを自動生成する","pkg/duit_attributes/に新しいウィジェット属性構造を実装する","make gogenコマンドを使用してコード生成ワークフローを実行する"],"ko":["Duit 프레임워크를 위한 Flutter 위젯 코드 자동 생성","pkg/duit_attributes/에 새로운 위젯 속성 구조 구현","make gogen 명령을 사용하여 코드 생성 워크플ロー 실행"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de código de widgets de Flutter para el framework Duit","Implementación de nuevas estructuras de atributos de widgets en pkg/duit_attributes/","Ejecución de flujos de trabajo de generación de código con el comando make gogen"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de code de widgets Flutter pour le framework Duit","Mise en œuvre de nouvelles structures d''attributs de widgets dans pkg/duit_attributes/","Exécution de flux de travail de génération de code avec la commande make gogen"],"de":["Automatisierung der Generierung von Flutter-Widget-Code für das Duit-Framework","Implementierung neuer Widget-Attribut-Strukturen in pkg/duit_attributes/","Ausführung von Code-Generierungs-Workflows mit dem Befehl make gogen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de código de widgets Flutter para o Framework Duit","Implementar novas estruturas de atributos de widgets em pkg/duit_attributes/","Executar fluxos de trabalho de geração de código com o comando make gogen"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию кода виджетов Flutter для фреймворка Duit","Реализовать новые структуры атрибутов виджетов в pkg/duit_attributes/","Запускать рабочие процессы генерации кода с помощью команды make gogen"],"ar":["أتمتة توليد رمز العناصر في واجهة المستخدم Flutter لصالح إطار Duit","تطبيق هياكل سمة جديدة للعناصر في pkg/duit_attributes/","تشغيل سير عمل توليد الكود باستخدام أمر make gogen"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Golang development environment","Dependent on Duit Framework architecture","Needs manual widget type registration in element_type.go"],"zh":["需要Golang开发环境","依赖于Duit框架架构","需要在element_type.go中手动注册小部件类型"],"ja":["Golang開発環境が必要","Duitフレームワークのアーキテクチャに依存している","element_type.goにウィジェットタイプを手動で登録する必要がある"],"ko":["Golang 개발 환경 필요","Duit 프레임워크 아키텍처에 의존","element_type.go에 위젯 유형을 수동으로 등록해야 함"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de desarrollo de Golang","Dependiente de la arquitectura del framework Duit","Necesita registro manual de tipos de widgets en element_type.go"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de développement Golang","Dépendant de l''architecture du framework Duit","Nécessite un enregistrement manuel des types de widgets dans element_type.go"],"de":["Benötigt eine Golang-Entwicklungsumgebung","Abhängig von der Architektur des Duit-Frameworks","Benötigt manuelle Registrierung von Widget-Typen in element_type.go"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de desenvolvimento Golang","Dependente da arquitetura do Framework Duit","Necessita de registro manual do tipo de widget em element_type.go"],"ru":["Требует среды разработки Golang","Зависит от архитектуры фреймворка Duit","Требует ручной регистрации типа виджета в element_type.go"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تطوير Golang","يعتمد على هندسة إطار Duit","يحتاج إلى تسجيل يدوي لنوع العنصر في element_type.go"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4f45f85c80ccaf6e1aef72d967985a9612d49b7ee5395138b29f1ae6412324a9","qualityScore":31}');
