Creación y gestión de partidas de manera eficiente","Integración con herramientas de AI para una experiencia de juego mejorada","Interfaz de usuario intuitiva y personalizable","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas y dispositivos"],"fr":["Gestion de campagnes RPG basées sur des nœuds","Création et gestion de parties de manière efficace","Intégration avec des outils d''IA pour une expérience de jeu améliorée","Interface utilisateur intuitive et personnalisable","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes et appareils"],"de":["Verwaltung von RPG-Kampagnen basierend auf Knoten","Erstellung und Verwaltung von Partien auf effiziente Weise","Integration mit AI-Tools für eine verbesserte Spielereinrichtung","Benutzeroberfläche intuitiv und anpassbar","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen und Geräten"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de campanhas RPG baseado em nós","Organização eficaz de personagens e histórias","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento de jogos","Suporte a múltiplos jogadores","Interface de usuário intuitiva"],"ru":["Управление кампаниями RPG на основе узлов","Эффективная организация персонажей и историй","Интеграция с инструментами разработки игр","Поддержка нескольких игроков","Интуитивный интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["ادارة حملات رول بلاينج بناءً على عقدة","تنظيم فعّال للشخصيات والقصص","تكامل مع أدوات تطوير الألعاب","دعم لعدة لاعبين","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Cytoscape","什么是Cytoscape","Cytoscape替代品","Cytoscape与其他RPG_campaign管理器的比较","Cytoscape安装","Cytoscape设置指南","RPG_campaign管理工具","AI工具用于RPG_campaign"],"ja":["Cytoscapeの使い方","Cytoscapeとは","Cytoscapeの代替","Cytoscapeと他のRPGキャンペーンマネージャーの比較","Cytoscapeのインストール","Cytoscapeの設定ガイド","RPGキャンペーン管理ツール","AIエージェントを使用したRPGキャンペーン"],"ko":["Cytoscape 사용법","Cytoscape란","Cytoscape 대안","Cytoscape와 다른 RPG 캠페인 관리자 비교","Cytoscape 설치","Cytoscape 설정 가이드","RPG 캠페인 관리 도구","AI 에이전트를 사용한 RPG 캠페인"],"es":["cómo usar Cytoscape","qué es Cytoscape","herramientas de AI para RPG","Cytoscape vs otras herramientas de AI","instalación de Cytoscape","guía de configuración de Cytoscape","alternativas a Cytoscape"],"fr":["comment utiliser Cytoscape","qu''est-ce que Cytoscape","outils d''IA pour RPG","Cytoscape vs autres outils d''IA","installation de Cytoscape","guide de configuration de Cytoscape","alternatives à Cytoscape"],"de":["wie man Cytoscape verwendet","was ist Cytoscape","AI-Tools für RPG","Cytoscape vs andere AI-Tools","Installation von Cytoscape","Konfigurationsanleitung für Cytoscape","Alternativen zu Cytoscape"],"pt":["como usar Cytoscape","o que é Cytoscape","ferramentas de IA para jogos","gerenciamento de campanhas RPG","Cytoscape vs outros gerenciadores","instalação do Cytoscape","guia de configuração do Cytoscape"],"ru":["как использовать Cytoscape","что такое Cytoscape","инструменты ИИ для игр","управление кампаниями RPG","Cytoscape vs другие менеджеры","установка Cytoscape","руководство по настройке Cytoscape"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام سايتو سكايب","ما هو سايتو سكايب","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للألعاب","ادارة حملات رول بلاينج","سايتو سكايب مقابل أدوات ادارة أخرى","تثبيت سايتو سكايب","دليل إعداد سايتو سكايب"]}},"owner":"eserlan","repo":"Codex-Cryptica","repoPath":"eserlan/Codex-Cryptica","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.914Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cytoscape","description":"Master Cytoscape.js for graph visualization, including Svelte 5 integration, sci-fi styling, custom layouts, and interaction patterns. Use when building relationship maps, node-link diagrams, or interactive network visualizations.","bodyPreview":"# Cytoscape Graph Visualization\n\nMaster the art of creating high-performance, aesthetically striking network visualizations using Cytoscape.js, with a focus on Svelte 5 integration and the \"Codex Arcana\" sci-fi aesthetic.\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### 1. Svelte 5 Integration\n\nManage Cytoscape lifecycle and reactivity using Svelte 5 `$effect` and `onMount`.\n\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { onMount, onDestroy } from \"svelte\";\n  import cytoscape, { type Core } from \"cytoscape\";\n\n  let container: H","body":"# Cytoscape Graph Visualization\n\nMaster the art of creating high-performance, aesthetically striking network visualizations using Cytoscape.js, with a focus on Svelte 5 integration and the \"Codex Arcana\" sci-fi aesthetic.\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### 1. Svelte 5 Integration\n\nManage Cytoscape lifecycle and reactivity using Svelte 5 `$effect` and `onMount`.\n\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { onMount, onDestroy } from \"svelte\";\n  import cytoscape, { type Core } from \"cytoscape\";\n\n  let container: HTMLElement;\n  let cy: Core | undefined = $state();\n  let { elements } = $props();\n\n  onMount(() => {\n    cy = cytoscape({\n      container,\n      elements,\n      style: [\n        /* styles */\n      ],\n      layout: { name: \"cose\" },\n    });\n  });\n\n  onDestroy(() => {\n    cy?.destroy();\n  });\n\n  // Reactive updates\n  $effect(() => {\n    if (cy && elements) {\n      cy.elements().remove();\n      cy.add(elements);\n      cy.layout({ name: \"cose\", animate: true }).run();\n    }\n  });\n</script>\n\n<div bind:this={container} class=\"w-full h-full\"></div>\n```\n\n### 2. Sci-Fi \"Terminal\" Styling\n\nEmbrace a high-contrast, glowing aesthetic. Use dark backgrounds with vibrant green or amber accents.\n\n| Feature        | Pattern                                                                  |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Node Shape** | `round-rectangle` or `diamond` for sci-fi feel.                          |\n| **Node Label** | Use `text-valign: bottom` and `text-margin-y` for a data-readout look.   |\n| **Edge Style** | `bezier` curves with `triangle` arrows. Keep lines thin and subtle.      |\n| **Overlays**   | Use `overlay-color` and `overlay-opacity` for glowing selection effects. |\n\n**Example Sci-Fi Style:**\n\n```ts\nconst SCIFI_STYLE = [\n  {\n    selector: \"node\",\n    style: {\n      \"background-color\": \"#022c22\",\n      \"border-width\": 1,\n      \"border-color\": \"#15803d\",\n      label: \"data(label)\",\n      color: \"#86efac\",\n      \"font-family\": \"Inter, monospace\",\n      \"font-size\": 10,\n      \"text-transform\": \"uppercase\",\n    },\n  },\n  {\n    selector: \"edge\",\n    style: {\n      \"line-color\": \"#14532d\",\n      \"target-arrow-shape\": \"triangle\",\n      \"curve-style\": \"bezier\",\n      opacity: 0.6,\n    },\n  },\n];\n```\n\n### 3. Layout Strategies\n\n- **Cose**: Good for organic, balanced layouts.\n- **Circle/GridLayout**: Use for structured overviews or specific groupings.\n- **Fcose/Cola**: Advanced force-directed layouts for complex networks (require plugins).\n- **Manual**: Use `metadata.coordinates` if entities have fixed positions.\n\n## Interaction Patterns\n\n### Selection & Focus\n\nAnimate the view when a node is selected to provide feedback.\n\n```ts\ncy.on(\"tap\", \"node\", (evt) => {\n  const node = evt.target;\n  cy.animate({\n    center: { eles: node },\n    zoom: 1.5,\n    duration: 500,\n    easing: \"ease-out-cubic\",\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Connection Management\n\nImplement a \"Connect Mode\" to allow users to link nodes visually.\n\n- Tap Source -> Tap Target -> Save relationship.\n- Visual feedback via classes (e.g., `.selected-source`).\n\n## Performance Guidelines\n\n1. **Batch Updates**: Use `cy.batch()` when performing many operations.\n2. **Selective Layouts**: Only run layouts when elements change significantly, not on every prop update.\n3. **Hardware Acceleration**: Cytoscape uses Canvas, which is generally performant, but keep texture usage low.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Lifecycle Management**: Always `destroy()` the instance in `onDestroy`.\n2. **Viewport Handling**: Use `cy.fit()` and `cy.resize()` to ensure the graph looks good on all screens.\n3. **Data Transformation**: Use a separate `Transformer` utility to map domain objects (Entities) to Cytoscape elements.\n4. **Overlay Elements**: Use HTML/CSS overlays for UI (zoom controls, legends) instead of rendering them in the Canvas.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:02:22.340Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visualization Agents needing high-performance network visualization capabilities with Cytoscape.js and Svelte 5 integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高性能网络可视化能力的可视化代理，特别是与Cytoscape.js和Svelte 5集成。","ja":"Cytoscape.jsとSvelte 5の統合を必要とする、高性能のネットワーク可視化機能を必要とするビジュアライゼーションエージェントに最適。","ko":"Cytoscape.js와 Svelte 5 통합을 필요로 하는 고성능 네트워크 시각화 기능이 필요한 시각화 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de visualización que necesitan capacidades de visualización de red de alto rendimiento con integración de Cytoscape.js y Svelte 5.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de visualisation nécessitant des capacités de visualisation de réseau haute performance avec intégration de Cytoscape.js et Svelte 5.","de":"Perfekt für Visualisierungsagenten, die hochleistungsstarke Netzwerkvisualisierungsfunktionen mit Cytoscape.js- und Svelte-5-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Visualização que precisam de capacidades de visualização de rede de alto desempenho com integração do Cytoscape.js e Svelte 5.","ru":"Идеально для агентов визуализации, требующих высокопроизводительных возможностей визуализации сетей с интеграцией Cytoscape.js и Svelte 5.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المرئيين الذين يحتاجون إلىقدرات مرئية للشبكة عالية الأداء مع دمج Cytoscape.js و Svelte 5."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create aesthetically striking network visualizations using Cytoscape.js, with seamless Svelte 5 integration and support for the ''Codex Arcana'' sci-fi aesthetic, leveraging $effect and onMount for lifecycle management.","zh":"赋予代理创建以Cytoscape.js为基础、集成Svelte 5并支持''Codex Arcana''科幻美学的美观网络可视化能力，利用$effect和onMount进行生命周期管理。","ja":"Cytoscape.jsを使用した美観のあるネットワーク可視化を作成し、Svelte 5をシームレスに統合し、''Codex Arcana''のSF美学をサポートし、$effectとonMountを使用してライフサイクル管理を行うエージェントをエンパワーメントします。","ko":"에이전트가 Cytoscape.js를 사용하여 미려한 네트워크 시각화를 생성하고 Svelte 5를无缝통합하고 ''Codex Arcana''의 SF 미학을 지원하며 $effect와 onMount를 사용하여 수명 주기 관리를 하는 것을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear visualizaciones de red estéticamente impactantes utilizando Cytoscape.js, con integración perfecta de Svelte 5 y soporte para el estético de ciencia ficción ''Codex Arcana'', aprovechando $effect y onMount para la gestión del ciclo de vida.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des visualisations de réseau esthétiquement frappantes en utilisant Cytoscape.js, avec une intégration transparente de Svelte 5 et un support pour l''esthétique de science-fiction ''Codex Arcana'', en exploitant $effect et onMount pour la gestion du cycle de vie.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ästhetisch auffallende Netzwerkvisualisierungen mit Cytoscape.js zu erstellen, mit nahtloser Svelte-5-Integration und Unterstützung für das Sci-Fi-Ästhetik ''Codex Arcana'', indem $effect und onMount für Lebenszyklusverwaltung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar visualizações de rede esteticamente impressionantes usando Cytoscape.js, com integração sem problemas do Svelte 5 e suporte ao estético de ficção científica ''Codex Arcana'', aproveitando $effect e onMount para gerenciamento de ciclo de vida.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать визуально впечатляющие сетевые визуализации с помощью Cytoscape.js, с бесшовной интеграцией Svelte 5 и поддержкой научно-фантастического эстетического стиля ''Codex Arcana'', используя $effect и onMount для управления жизненным циклом.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء تصورات شبكية بصرية مذهلة باستخدام Cytoscape.js، مع دمج بدون مشاكل من Svelte 5 ودعم الجماليات الخيالية العلمية ''Codex Arcana''، واستخدام $effect و onMount لإدارة دورة الحياة."},"useCases":{"en":["Visualizing complex node-based RPG campaign networks","Generating interactive graph visualizations with Cytoscape.js","Integrating Svelte 5 components with Cytoscape for dynamic reactivity"],"zh":["可视化复杂的基于节点的RPG战役网络","使用Cytoscape.js生成交互式图形可视化","将Svelte 5组件与Cytoscape集成以实现动态反应性"],"ja":["ノードベースのRPGキャンペーンネットワークの可視化","Cytoscape.jsを使用したインタラクティブなグラフ可視化の生成","Svelte 5コンポーネントをCytoscapeと統合して動的リアクティブ性を実現"],"ko":["노드 기반 RPG 캠페인 네트워크 시각화","Cytoscape.js를 사용한 상호작용 그래프 시각화 생성","Svelte 5 컴포넌트를 Cytoscape와 통합하여 동적 반응성 실현"],"es":["Visualización de redes de campaña de RPG basadas en nodos complejos","Generación de visualizaciones de gráficos interactivos con Cytoscape.js","Integración de componentes de Svelte 5 con Cytoscape para reactividad dinámica"],"fr":["Visualisation de réseaux de campagne de RPG basés sur des nœuds complexes","Génération de visualisations de graphiques interactifs avec Cytoscape.js","Intégration de composants Svelte 5 avec Cytoscape pour réactivité dynamique"],"de":["Visualisierung komplexer knotenbasierter RPG-Kampagnennetze","Generierung interaktiver Graphvisualisierungen mit Cytoscape.js","Integration von Svelte-5-Komponenten mit Cytoscape für dynamische Reaktivität"],"pt":["Visualizando redes de campanha de RPG baseadas em nós complexos","Gerando visualizações de gráficos interativos com Cytoscape.js","Integrando componentes do Svelte 5 com Cytoscape para reatividade dinâmica"],"ru":["Визуализация сложных сетей кампаний RPG на основе узлов","Генерация интерактивных графических визуализаций с помощью Cytoscape.js","Интеграция компонентов Svelte 5 с Cytoscape для динамической реактивности"],"ar":["مرئية للشبكات الحملات RPG المعقدة القائمة على العقد","إنتاج تصورات الرسوم التفاعلية باستخدام Cytoscape.js","دمج مكونات Svelte 5 مع Cytoscape للتفاعل الديناميكي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Svelte 5 and Cytoscape.js compatibility","Limited to network visualization use cases"],"zh":["需要Svelte 5和Cytoscape.js兼容性","仅限网络可视化用例"],"ja":["Svelte 5およびCytoscape.jsの互換性が必要","ネットワーク可視化のユースケースに限定"],"ko":["Svelte 5 및 Cytoscape.js 호환성 필요","네트워크 시각화 사용 사례로 제한"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con Svelte 5 y Cytoscape.js","Limitado a casos de uso de visualización de red"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec Svelte 5 et Cytoscape.js","Limité aux cas d''utilisation de visualisation de réseau"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit Svelte 5 und Cytoscape.js","Begrenzt auf Netzwerkvisualisierungs-Anwendungsfälle"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com Svelte 5 e Cytoscape.js","Limitado a casos de uso de visualização de rede"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с Svelte 5 и Cytoscape.js","Ограничен случаи использования визуализации сетей"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع Svelte 5 و Cytoscape.js","محدود لحالات استخدام مرئية للشبكة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ec44230c7efa1472a3eba645714871970a11ef88a43011db4f2e60c84298ec1c","qualityScore":31}');
