크플로우를 유지함으로써 개발 효율성을 향상시킵니다","es":"El plugin de flujo de trabajo ''do'' es una herramienta personalizada para desarrolladores, mantenida actualizada","fr":"Le plugin de workflow ''do'' est un outil personnalisé pour les développeurs, tenu à jour","de":"Das Plugin für den Workflow ''do'' ist ein benutzerdefiniertes Tool für Entwickler, das aktuell gehalten wird","pt":"O plugin de workflow do é uma ferramenta de IA para desenvolvedores, mantida atualizada com as últimas funcionalidades.","ru":"Плагин workflow do - это инструмент ИИ для разработчиков, который поддерживается в актуальном состоянии с последними функциями.","ar":"플러그인 ووركفلو دو هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للمطورين، يتم تحديثها بانتظام بأحدث الميزات.","en":"My own claude plugin workflow, I''ll keep it up to date. "},"definition":{"en":"My own claude plugin workflow, I''ll keep it up to date. "},"features":{"zh":["简化开发过程","提升开发效率","最新的工作流","AI智能工具","开发过程自动化","提高生产力"],"ja":["開発プロセスの簡素化","開発効率の向上","最新のワークフロー","AIエージェント","開発プロセスの自動化","生産性の向上"],"ko":["개발 프로세스 단순화","개발 효율성 향상","최신 워크플로우","AI 에이전트","개발 프로세스 자동화","생산성 향상"],"es":["Flujo de trabajo personalizado","Actualizaciones constantes","Herramienta de desarrollo de software","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Flexibilidad y personalización"],"fr":["Workflow personnalisé","Mises à jour régulières","Outil de développement de logiciels","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Flexibilité et personnalisation"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierter Workflow","Regelmäßige Updates","Software-Entwicklungstool","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Flexibilität und Anpassung"],"pt":["Automatização de tarefas de desenvolvimento","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento populares","Atualizações regulares com novas funcionalidades","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de desenvolvimento","Código aberto e personalizável"],"ru":["Автоматизация задач разработки","Интеграция с популярными инструментами разработки","Регулярные обновления с новыми функциями","Поддержка нескольких сред разработки","Открытый и настраиваемый код"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في مهام التطوير","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الشهيرة","التحديثات المنتظمة مع ميزات جديدة","الدعم لعدة بيئات تطوير","الرمز المفتوح والقابل للتعديل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","do插件工作流","开发过程简化","开发效率提升","如何使用do","do插件工作流教程","do安装指南","do设置步骤"],"ja":["AIエージェント","doプラグインワークフロー","開発プロセスの簡素化","開発効率の向上","doの使い方","doプラグインワークフローのチュートリアル","doのインストール方法","doの設定手順"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","do 플러그인 워크플로우","개발 프로세스 단순화","개발 효율성 향상","do 사용 방법","do 플러그인 워크플로우 튜토리얼","do 설치 가이드","do 설정 단계"],"es":["herramientas de ai para desarrolladores","plugin de flujo de trabajo","desarrollo de software con ai","alternativas a herramientas de ai","guias de instalación de herramientas de ai","configuración de herramientas de ai","usos de herramientas de ai en el desarrollo","herramientas de ai vs herramientas de machine learning"],"fr":["outils d''ia pour les développeurs","plugin de workflow","développement de logiciels avec ia","alternatives aux outils d''ia","guides d''installation des outils d''ia","configuration des outils d''ia","utilisations des outils d''ia dans le développement","outils d''ia vs outils de machine learning"],"de":["ki-tools für entwickler","plugin für workflow","software-entwicklung mit ki","alternativen zu ki-tools","installationsanleitungen für ki-tools","konfiguration von ki-tools","anwendungen von ki-tools in der entwicklung","ki-tools vs machine-learning-tools"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","plugin de workflow do","automatização de tarefas de desenvolvimento","como usar o plugin de workflow do","alternativas ao plugin de workflow do","guia de instalação do plugin de workflow do"],"ru":["инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","плагин workflow do","автоматизация задач разработки","как использовать плагин workflow do","альтернативы плагину workflow do","руководство по установке плагина workflow do"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","플러그ين ووركفلو دو","التحكم الآلي في مهام التطوير","كيفية استخدام 플러غين ووركفلو دو","بديل 플러그ين ووركفلو دو","دليل تثبيت 플러그ين ووركفلو دو"]}},"owner":"zolkers","repo":"better-claude","repoPath":"zolkers/better-claude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.950Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"do","description":"Use for ANY task - automatically plans if needed, then executes step by step with mandatory code review","bodyPreview":"# Do\n\n<CRITICAL>\nThis skill has MANDATORY requirements. You do NOT have a choice. You MUST follow every step exactly as written. This is not negotiable. This is not optional. You cannot rationalize your way out of this.\n\nThis skill handles EVERYTHING: planning, execution, review, and git. One command to rule them all.\n</CRITICAL>\n\n## Overview\n\nThe main workflow skill. Automatically:\n1. Creates a plan if none exists (or resumes existing plan)\n2. Executes the plan step by step\n3. Runs mandatory co","body":"# Do\n\n<CRITICAL>\nThis skill has MANDATORY requirements. You do NOT have a choice. You MUST follow every step exactly as written. This is not negotiable. This is not optional. You cannot rationalize your way out of this.\n\nThis skill handles EVERYTHING: planning, execution, review, and git. One command to rule them all.\n</CRITICAL>\n\n## Overview\n\nThe main workflow skill. Automatically:\n1. Creates a plan if none exists (or resumes existing plan)\n2. Executes the plan step by step\n3. Runs mandatory code review\n4. Handles git operations if enabled\n\n## Mandatory Announcements\n\nYou MUST announce every action BEFORE taking it. No exceptions.\n\n| Action          | Required Announcement                                  |\n|-----------------|--------------------------------------------------------|\n| Starting skill  | \"Using the do skill.\"                                  |\n| Checking plan   | \"Checking for existing plan...\"                        |\n| No plan found   | \"No plan found. Starting planning phase.\"              |\n| Plan found      | \"Plan found. Resuming execution.\"                      |\n| Starting phase  | \"Phase [N]: [name]\"                                    |\n| Loading module  | \"Loading [module].\"                                    |\n| Asking question | \"Question: [text]\"                                     |\n| Noting answer   | \"Noted: [summary].\"                                    |\n| Detecting       | \"Detecting [what]... [Result] detected from [source].\" |\n| Writing plan    | \"Writing plan to .b-claude/plan.md.\"                   |\n| Executing step  | \"Executing step [N]: [description]\"                    |\n| Step complete   | \"Step [N] complete.\"                                   |\n| Batch complete  | \"Batch complete. Ready for feedback.\"                  |\n| Starting review | \"Starting mandatory code review.\"                      |\n| Issue found     | \"Issue found: [severity] - [description]\"              |\n| Committing      | \"Committing: [message]\"                                |\n| Complete        | \"Task complete.\"                                       |\n\n## Red Flags - You Are Rationalizing If You Think:\n\n| Thought                            | Reality                                  |\n|------------------------------------|------------------------------------------|\n| \"I can skip planning\"              | NO. Planning is mandatory for new tasks. |\n| \"I already understand the request\" | WRONG. Ask clarifying questions anyway.  |\n| \"I know this codebase\"             | FALSE. Analyze it anyway.                |\n| \"I''ll combine steps\"               | NO. One step at a time.                  |\n| \"Code review is optional\"          | NEVER. Review is mandatory.              |\n| \"This is simple\"                   | DOESN''T MATTER. Full process every time. |\n| \"I''ll announce at the end\"         | WRONG. Announce BEFORE each action.      |\n| \"I''ll skip the checkpoint\"         | NO. Every checkpoint is mandatory.       |\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 0: Initialize\n\n**Step 0.1: Announce**\n```\n\"Using the do skill.\"\n\"Checking for .b-claude/preferences.md...\"\n```\n\n**Step 0.2: Preferences**\nIf no preferences exist, ask ONE AT A TIME:\n```\n\"Preference: Do you want emojis? (yes/no)\"\n\"Preference: Auto-commit enabled? (yes/no)\"\n\"Preference: Branch management? (yes/no)\"\n```\nSave to `.b-claude/preferences.md`.\n\n### Step 1: Check for Plan\n\n```\n\"Checking for existing plan in .b-claude/plan.md...\"\n```\n\n- If plan exists with uncompleted steps → **Go to Step 3 (Execute)**\n- If plan exists but all steps done → **Ask: \"Plan complete. New task?\"**\n- If no plan exists → **Go to Step 2 (Plan)**\n\n### Step 2: Planning Phase\n\nOnly runs if no plan exists.\n\n#### Phase 2.1: Think\n\n```\n\"Phase 2.1: Think -- Understanding the request.\"\n```\n\nAsk clarifying questions ONE AT A TIME:\n- What is the goal?\n- What are the constraints?\n- What are the acceptance criteria?\n\n```\n\"Noted: [summary of answer].\"\n```\n\nAfter all questions:\n```\n\"Understanding established:\n- Goal: [goal]\n- Constraints: [constraints]\n- Criteria: [criteria]\"\n```\n\n**CHECKPOINT: \"Is this understanding correct?\"**\n\n#### Phase 2.2: Analyze\n\n```\n\"Phase 2.2: Analyze -- Scanning the project.\"\n\"Loading internal/language module.\"\n```\n\nFollow the language module to detect and announce:\n- Language\n- Frameworks\n- Runtimes\n- Environments\n\n```\n\"Project analysis:\n- Language: [lang]\n- Frameworks: [list]\n- Architecture: [pattern]\n- Key files: [list]\"\n```\n\n**CHECKPOINT: \"Is this analysis correct?\"**\n\n#### Phase 2.3: Planify\n\n```\n\"Phase 2.3: Planify -- Creating the plan.\"\n```\n\nCreate a step-by-step plan with checkboxes:\n\n```markdown\n# Plan: [task name]\n\n## Context\n- Language: [lang]\n- Frameworks: [list]\n\n## Steps\n- [ ] Step 1: [description]\n- [ ] Step 2: [description]\n- [ ] Step 3: [description]\n...\n```\n\n```\n\"Writing plan to .b-claude/plan.md.\"\n\"Plan created with [N] steps.\"\n```\n\n**CHECKPOINT: \"Approve this plan to proceed?\"**\n\n### Step 3: Execution Phase\n\n```\n\"Starting execution phase.\"\n\"Loading plan from .b-claude/plan.md.\"\n```\n\n#### Step 3.1: Branch (if enabled)\n\nIf branch management enabled:\n```\n\"Creating branch: [branch-name]\"\n```\n\n#### Step 3.2: Execute Steps\n\nBatch size: **3 steps** max. Stop after each batch.\n\nFor EACH step:\n```\n\"Executing step [N]: [description]\"\n```\n\nWhile working:\n```\n\"Step [N] in progress: [action]\"\n```\n\nWhen done:\n```\n\"Step [N] complete. Marking as done.\"\n```\nUpdate checkbox in `.b-claude/plan.md`.\n\nIf auto-commit enabled:\n```\n\"Committing: [message]\"\n```\n\n**CHECKPOINT after each batch:**\n```\n\"Batch complete. Steps [X-Y] done.\"\n\"Continue with next batch?\"\n```\n\n**STOP and wait.**\n\n#### Step 3.3: Handle Blockers\n\nIf blocked:\n```\n\"BLOCKED at step [N]: [reason]\"\n\"Need clarification: [question]\"\n```\n**STOP and wait.**\n\n### Step 4: Code Review (MANDATORY)\n\n```\n\"All steps complete. Starting mandatory code review.\"\n```\n\nReview all changes against:\n- Language conventions\n- Code quality (SOLID, complexity, etc.)\n- Security (no secrets, injection, XSS)\n\nFor each issue:\n```\n\"Issue found: [SEVERITY] - [file:line] - [description]\"\n```\n\n```\n\"Code review complete. Verdict: [APPROVE/REQUEST_CHANGES]\"\n```\n\nIf issues found:\n- CRITICAL/MAJOR: Fix immediately, re-commit\n- MINOR: Ask user \"Fix now or defer?\"\n\n### Step 5: Completion\n\n```\n\"Task complete.\"\n\"Summary:\"\n\"- Steps completed: [N]\"\n\"- Commits made: [N]\"\n\"- Code review: [verdict]\"\n```\n\nIf git push enabled:\n```\n\"Push to remote? (yes/no)\"\n```\n\n## STOP Conditions\n\nSTOP immediately and ask if:\n- Request is ambiguous\n- Multiple approaches possible\n- Destructive action required\n- CRITICAL issue found\n- Step unclear\n- Conflict with requirements\n\n## Internal Modules\n\nAutomatically loaded during analysis:\n- `internal/language` - Convention detection\n\n<REMINDER>\nYou MUST announce EVERY step. You MUST wait at EVERY checkpoint. Code review is MANDATORY. No shortcuts. No exceptions.\n</REMINDER>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:11:40.604Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Task Automation Agents needing streamlined planning and execution workflows","zh":"适合需要简化规划和执行工作流的任务自动化代理","ja":"タスクの自動化エージェントに適しており、計画と実行のワークフローをストリームライン化できます","ko":"작업 자동화 에이전트에 적합하며 계획 및 실행 워크플ロー가 간소화됩니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización de Tareas que necesitan flujos de trabajo de planificación y ejecución optimizados","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Automatisation de Tâches nécessitant des flux de travail de planification et d''exécution rationalisés","de":"Perfekt für Task-Automatisierungsagenten, die optimierte Planungs- und Ausführungsworkflows benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Tarefas que precisam de fluxos de trabalho de planejamento e execução otimizados","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации задач, требующих оптимизированных рабочих процессов планирования и выполнения","ar":"مثالي لعميل تلقائي لإدارة المهام الذي يحتاج إلى تدفقات عمل مخططة وتنفيذية مبسطة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle everything from planning to git management using a single command, leveraging mandatory code reviews and execution protocols","zh":"赋予代理能够使用单个命令处理从规划到git管理的一切，利用强制代码审查和执行协议","ja":"エージェントが単一のコマンドを使用して、計画からgit管理までを処理できるようにし、強制的なコードレビューと実行プロトコルを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 단일 명령을 사용하여 계획부터 git 관리까지 모든 것을 처리할 수 있도록 하며, 강제 코드 리뷰 및 실행 프로토콜을 활용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar todo, desde la planificación hasta la gestión de git, utilizando un solo comando, aprovechando las revisiones de código obligatorias y los protocolos de ejecución","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer tout, de la planification à la gestion de git, en utilisant une seule commande, en exploitant les examens de code obligatoires et les protocoles d''exécution","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, alles von der Planung bis zur Git-Verwaltung mit einem einzigen Befehl zu verwalten, indem es obligatorische Code-Reviews und Ausführungsprotokolle nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar com tudo, desde o planejamento até o gerenciamento do git, usando um único comando, aproveitando revisões de código obrigatórias e protocolos de execução","ru":"Позволяет агентам обрабатывать все, от планирования до управления git, используя одну команду, используя обязательные проверки кода и протоколы выполнения","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على التعامل مع كل شيء بدءًا من التخطيط حتى إدارة الجيت باستخدام أمر واحد، مع الاستفادة من المراجعات الإلزامية للرمز والبروتوكولات التنفيذية"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating project planning and execution","Resuming existing plans for continuous workflow","Executing plans step by step with integrated review"],"zh":["自动化项目规划和执行","恢复现有计划以实现持续工作流","逐步执行计划并集成审查"],"ja":["プロジェクトの計画と実行の自動化","既存の計画を再開して継続的なワークフローを実現","計画をステップごとに実行し、レビューを統合"],"ko":["프로젝트 계획 및 실행 자동화","기존 계획을 재개하여 연속적인 워크플ロー 달성","계획을 단계별로 실행하고 리뷰를 통합"],"es":["Automatización de la planificación y ejecución de proyectos","Reanudación de planes existentes para un flujo de trabajo continuo","Ejecución de planes paso a paso con revisión integrada"],"fr":["Automatisation de la planification et de l''exécution de projets","Reprise de plans existants pour un flux de travail continu","Exécution de plans étape par étape avec examen intégré"],"de":["Automatisierung der Projektplanung und -ausführung","Wiederaufnahme bestehender Pläne für einen kontinuierlichen Arbeitsablauf","Schrittweise Ausführung von Plänen mit integrierter Überprüfung"],"pt":["Automatizar o planejamento e execução de projetos","Retomar planos existentes para fluxo de trabalho contínuo","Executar planos passo a passo com revisão integrada"],"ru":["Автоматизировать планирование и выполнение проектов","Возобновить существующие планы для непрерывного рабочего процесса","Выполнять п