he leading agent orchestration platform for Claude. Deploy intelligent multi-agent swarms, coordinate autonomous workflows, and build conversational AI s..."},"definition":{"en":"🌊 The leading agent orchestration platform for Claude. Deploy intelligent multi-agent swarms, coordinate autonomous workflows, and build conversational AI systems. Features    enterprise-grade architecture, distributed swarm intelligence, RAG integration, and native Claude Code / Codex Integration"},"features":{"zh":["企业级架构","分布式群智能","RAG集成","原生Claude Code/Codex集成","智能多智能体群部署"],"ja":["企業レベルのアーキテクチャ","分散型のスウォームインテリジェンス","RAG統合","ネイティブのClaude Code/Codex統合","智能なマルチエージェントのスウォームの展開"],"ko":["엔터프라이즈급 아키텍처","분산형 스ウォーム 인텔리전스","RAG 통합","네이티브 클로드 코드/코덱스 통합","지능형 멀티 에이전트의 스ウォーム 배포"],"es":["Arquitectura empresarial","Inteligencia de enjambre distribuida","Integración de RAG","Integración de Claude Code","Soporte para flujos de trabajo autónomos"],"fr":["Architecture d''entreprise","Intelligence de swarm distribuée","Intégration de RAG","Intégration de Claude Code","Support pour les flux de travail autonomes"],"de":["Unternehmensarchitektur","Verteilte Schwarmintelligenz","Integration von RAG","Integration von Claude Code","Unterstützung für autonome Workflows"],"pt":["Arquitetura de empresa","Inteligência de enxame distribuída","Integração com RAG","Integração nativa com Claude Code/Codex"],"ru":["Корпоративная архитектура","Распределенная интеллект роя","Интеграция с RAG","Нативная интеграция с Claude Code/Codex"],"ar":["هندسة شركة","ذكاء السرب الموزع","تكامل مع RAG","التكامل الأصلي مع Claude Code/Codex"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能体","智能体协调器","多智能体群","企业级架构","分布式群智能","RAG集成","Claude Code","Codex","智能多智能体群部署"],"ja":["AIエージェント","エージェントのオーケストレーション","マルチエージェント","企業レベルのアーキテクチャ","分散型のスウォームインテリジェンス","RAG統合","Claude Code","Codex","智能なマルチエージェントのスウォームの展開"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","에이전트 오케스트레이션","멀티 에이전트","엔터프라이즈급 아키텍처","분산형 스ウォーム 인텔리전스","RAG 통합","클로드 코드","코덱스","지능형 멀티 에이전트의 스ウォーム 배포"],"es":["agentes de IA","herramientas de IA","cómo usar agent-gossip-coordinator","qué es un agente de coordinación de gossip","alternativas a agent-gossip-coordinator","instalación de agent-gossip-coordinator","guía de configuración de agent-gossip-coordinator"],"fr":["agents d''IA","outils d''IA","comment utiliser agent-gossip-coordinator","qu''est-ce qu''un coordinateur de gossip d''agent","alternatives à agent-gossip-coordinator","installation de agent-gossip-coordinator","guide de configuration de agent-gossip-coordinator"],"de":["KI-Agenten","KI-Tools","wie man agent-gossip-coordinator verwendet","was ist ein Gossip-Koordinationsagent","Alternativen zu agent-gossip-coordinator","Installation von agent-gossip-coordinator","Konfigurationsanleitung für agent-gossip-coordinator"],"pt":["como usar agente ia","o que é agente ia","agente ia alternative","agente ia vs competidor","instalar agente ia","guia de configuração de agente ia"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ агент","что такое ИИ агент","ИИ агент альтернатива","ИИ агент vs конкурент","установить ИИ агент","руководство по настройке ИИ агента"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مقابل المنافس","تثبيت وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ruvnet","repo":"ruflo","repoPath":"ruvnet/ruflo","stars":16653,"forks":1887,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:06:35Z","topics":["agentic-ai","agentic-engineering","agentic-framework","agentic-rag","agentic-workflow","agents","ai-assistant","ai-tools","anthropic-claude","autonomous-agents","claude-code","claude-code-skills","codex","huggingface","mcp-server","model-context-protocol","multi-agent","multi-agent-systems","swarm","swarm-intelligence"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-gossip-coordinator","description":"Agent skill for gossip-coordinator - invoke with $agent-gossip-coordinator","bodyPreview":"---\nname: gossip-coordinator\ntype: coordinator\ncolor: \"#FF9800\"\ndescription: Coordinates gossip-based consensus protocols for scalable eventually consistent systems\ncapabilities:\n  - epidemic_dissemination\n  - peer_selection\n  - state_synchronization\n  - conflict_resolution\n  - scalability_optimization\npriority: medium\nhooks:\n  pre: |\n    echo \"📡 Gossip Coordinator broadcasting: $TASK\"\n    # Initialize peer connections\n    if [[ \"$TASK\" == *\"dissemination\"* ]]; then\n      echo \"🌐 Establishing","body":"---\nname: gossip-coordinator\ntype: coordinator\ncolor: \"#FF9800\"\ndescription: Coordinates gossip-based consensus protocols for scalable eventually consistent systems\ncapabilities:\n  - epidemic_dissemination\n  - peer_selection\n  - state_synchronization\n  - conflict_resolution\n  - scalability_optimization\npriority: medium\nhooks:\n  pre: |\n    echo \"📡 Gossip Coordinator broadcasting: $TASK\"\n    # Initialize peer connections\n    if [[ \"$TASK\" == *\"dissemination\"* ]]; then\n      echo \"🌐 Establishing peer network topology\"\n    fi\n  post: |\n    echo \"🔄 Gossip protocol cycle complete\"\n    # Check convergence status\n    echo \"📊 Monitoring eventual consistency convergence\"\n---\n\n# Gossip Protocol Coordinator\n\nCoordinates gossip-based consensus protocols for scalable eventually consistent distributed systems.\n\n## Core Responsibilities\n\n1. **Epidemic Dissemination**: Implement push$pull gossip protocols for information spread\n2. **Peer Management**: Handle random peer selection and failure detection\n3. **State Synchronization**: Coordinate vector clocks and conflict resolution\n4. **Convergence Monitoring**: Ensure eventual consistency across all nodes\n5. **Scalability Control**: Optimize fanout and bandwidth usage for efficiency\n\n## Implementation Approach\n\n### Epidemic Information Spread\n- Deploy push gossip protocol for proactive information spreading\n- Implement pull gossip protocol for reactive information retrieval\n- Execute push-pull hybrid approach for optimal convergence\n- Manage rumor spreading for fast critical update propagation\n\n### Anti-Entropy Protocols\n- Ensure eventual consistency through state synchronization\n- Execute Merkle tree comparison for efficient difference detection\n- Manage vector clocks for tracking causal relationships\n- Implement conflict resolution for concurrent state updates\n\n### Membership and Topology\n- Handle seamless integration of new nodes via join protocol\n- Detect unresponsive or failed nodes through failure detection\n- Manage graceful node departures and membership list maintenance\n- Discover network topology and optimize routing paths\n\n## Collaboration\n\n- Interface with Performance Benchmarker for gossip optimization\n- Coordinate with CRDT Synchronizer for conflict-free data types\n- Integrate with Quorum Manager for membership coordination\n- Synchronize with Security Manager for secure peer communication"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T12:48:27.065Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Distributed AI Agents needing scalable gossip-based consensus protocols for autonomous workflow coordination.","zh":"非常适合需要可扩展的基于流言协议的一致性协议的分布式AI代理的自治工作流协调。","ja":"スケーラブルなゴシップベースのコンセンサスプロトコルを使用した自律的なワークフロー調整が必要な分散型AIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"분산된 AI 에이전트가 스케일러블한 가십 기반 합의 프로토콜을 사용하여 자율적인 워크플로우 조정을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial Distribuidos que necesitan protocolos de consenso basados en rumores escalables para la coordinación autónoma del flujo de trabajo.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle Distribués ayant besoin de protocoles de consensus basés sur les rumeurs évolutifs pour la coordination autonome du flux de travail.","de":"Perfekt für verteilte KI-Agents, die skalierbare Konsensprotokolle auf Basis von Gerüchten für die autonome Arbeitsablaufkoordination benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Distribuídos que necessitam de protocolos de consenso baseados em fofoca escaláveis para coordenação de fluxo de trabalho autônoma.","ru":"Идеально подходит для распределенных агентов ИИ, которым требуются масштабируемые протоколы консенсуса на основе сплетен для автономной координации рабочих процессов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الموزع الذي يحتاج إلى بروتوكولات إجماع قابلة للتوسيع على أساس الإشاعة من أجل تنسيق سير العمل الذاتي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to establish epidemic dissemination, perform peer selection, and achieve state synchronization using native Claude Code and Codex Integration, while optimizing for scalability and conflict resolution through RAG integration.","zh":"赋予代理建立流行传播，执行同伴选择，并使用原生Claude Code和Codex集成实现状态同步，同时通过RAG集成优化可扩展性和冲突解决。","ja":"エージェントが疫学的伝播を確立し、ピアの選択を実行し、ネイティブのClaude CodeとCodex統合を使用して状態の同期を達成し、RAG統合を通じてスケーラビリティとコンフリクト解決を最適化できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 전염병적 전파를 설정하고 동료 선택을 수행하고 네이티브 Claude Code와 Codex 통합을 사용하여 상태 동기화를 달성하며 RAG 통합을 통해 확장성과 충돌 해결을 최적화 할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a establecer la diseminación epidémica, realizar la selección de pares y lograr la sincronización de estados utilizando el código nativo Claude Code y la integración de Codex, al mismo tiempo que se optimiza para la escalabilidad y la resolución de conflictos a través de la integración de RAG.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''établir la dissémination épidémique, de réaliser la sélection de pairs et d''atteindre la synchronisation d''états en utilisant le code natif Claude Code et l''intégration de Codex, tout en optimisant pour l''évolutivité et la résolution de conflits via l''intégration de RAG.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, eine epidemische Verbreitung herzustellen, Peer-Auswahl durchzuführen und eine Zustandssynchronisation unter Verwendung des nativen Claude Code und der Codex-Integration zu erreichen, während gleichzeitig die Skalierbarkeit und die Konfliktlösung durch die RAG-Integration optimiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estabelecerem disseminação epidêmica, realizarem seleção de pares e alcançarem sincronização de estado usando Claude Code e Codex Integration nativos, enquanto otimizam a escalabilidade e resolução de conflitos por meio da integração RAG.","ru":"Позволяет агентам устанавливать эпидемиологическое распространение, выполнять выбор пиров и достигать синхронизации состояния с использованием родной Claude Code и Codex Integration, оптимизируя масштабируемость и разрешение конфликтов посредством интеграции RAG.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء انتشار وبائي وتنفيذ اختيار الزوج وبلوغ تناسق الحالة باستخدام Claude Code و Codex Integration الأصليين، مع تحسين القدرة على التوسع وحل النزاعات من خلال تكامل RAG."},"useCases":{"en":["Coordinating multi-agent swarms for conversational AI systems","Implementing gossip-based consensus protocols for eventually consistent systems","Optimizing autonomous workflow scalability using distributed swarm intelligence"],"zh":["用于对话式AI系统的多代理群集协调","实现最终一致性系统的基于流言的合意协议","使用分布式群集智能优化自主工作流的可扩展性"],"ja":["会話AIシステムのマルチエージェントスウォームの調整","最終的一貫性システムのゴシップベースのコンセンサスプロトコルの実装","分散スウォームインテリジェンスを使用した自律ワークフローのスケーラビリティの最適化"],"ko":["대화형 AI 시스템을 위한 다중 에이전트 군집 조정","최종적으로 일관된 시스템을 위한 가십 기반 합의 프로토콜 구현","분산 군집 지능을 사용하여 자율적인 워크플로의 확장성 최적화"],"es":["Coordinar enjambres de agentes múltiples para sistemas de inteligencia artificial conversacional","Implementar protocolos de consenso basados en rumores para sistemas eventualmente coherentes","Optimizar la escalabilidad del flujo de trabajo autónomo utilizando la inteligencia de enjambre distribuida"],"fr":["Coordonner les essaims d''agents multiples pour les systèmes d''intelligence artificielle conversationnelle","Mettre en œuvre des protocoles de consensus basés sur les rumeurs pour les systèmes éventuellement cohérents","Optimiser l''évolutivité du flux de travail autonome en utilisant l''intelligence de swarm distribuée"],"de":["Koordinieren von Multi-Agenten-Schwärmen für konversationale KI-Systeme","Implementieren von Konsensprotokollen auf Basis von Gerüchten für letztendlich konsistente Systeme","Optimieren der Skalierbarkeit des autonomen Arbeitsablaufs unter Verwendung der verteilten Schwarmintelligenz"],"pt":["Coordenar enxames de multiagentes para sistemas de IA conversacional","Implementar protocolos de consenso baseados em fofoca para sistemas eventualmente consistentes","Otimizar escalabilidade de fluxo de trabalho autônomo usando inteligência de enxame distribuída"],"ru":["Координация многоагентных роев для систем разговорного ИИ","Реализация протоколов консенсуса на основе сплетен для систем с окончательной согласованностью","Оптимизация масштабируемости автономного рабочего процесса с использованием распределенного роевого интеллекта"],"ar":["تنسيق السرب المتعدد للعميل من أجل أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي الحواري","تطبيق بروتوكولات الإجماع القائمة على الإشاعة لأنظمة متسقة في النهاية","تحسين قابلية التوسع لسير العمل الذاتي باستخدام ذكاء السرب الموزع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code or Codex Integration","Enterprise-grade architecture setup needed","Distributed system environment required"],"zh":["需要Claude Code或Codex集成","需要企业级架构设置","需要分布式系统环境"],"ja":["Claude CodeまたはCodex統合が必要","企業グレードのアーキテクチャ設定が必要","分散システム環境が必要"],"ko":["Claude Code 또는 Codex 통합이 필요","企業 등급 아키텍처 설정이 필요","분산 시스템 환경이 필요"],"es":["Requiere Claude Code o Integración de Codex","Se necesita una configuración de arquitectura de nivel empresarial","Se requiere un entorno de sistema distribuido"],"fr":["Nécessite Claude Code ou Intégration de Codex","Une configuration d''architecture de niveau entreprise est nécessaire","Un environnement de système distribué est requis"],"de":["Benötigt Claude Code oder Codex-Integration","Eine Unternehmensarchitektur-Setup ist erforderlich","Ein verteiltes Systemumgebung ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer Claude Code ou Codex Integration","Configuração de arquitetura de nível empresarial necessária","Ambiente de sistema distribuído necessário"],"ru":["Требуется Claude Code или Codex Integration","Необходима настройка архитектуры уровня предприятия","Требуется распределенная среда системы"],"ar":["يتطلب Claude Code أو Codex Integration","إعداد هيئة بنية مستوى المؤسسة ضروري","بيئة نظام موزعة ضرورية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8b61bbbebc16144c99354d7a4d204dbeccc307183839eb966bcc548716ff2515","qualityScore":30}');
