erwendet","was ist ein KI-Assistent","alternativen zu git-workflow","git-workflow vs andere KI-Assistenten","installation von git-workflow","anleitung zur einrichtung von git-workflow"],"pt":["agente AI de fluxo de trabalho Git","ferramenta de desenvolvimento autônoma","integrações de ferramentas","capacidade offline total","FastAPI","React","Ollama","como usar agente AI de fluxo de trabalho Git","o que é agente AI de fluxo de trabalho Git"],"ru":["ИИ агент для Git Workflow","самодостаточный инструмент для разработчиков","интеграции инструментов","полная离线-способность","FastAPI","React","Ollama","как использовать ИИ агент для Git Workflow","что такое ИИ агент для Git Workflow"],"ar":["وكيل إدارة العمل_git","أداة مطورين ذاتية الحفظ","تكاملات أداة","قدرة完全 بدون اتصال","FastAPI","React","Ollama","كيفية استخدام وكيل إدارة العمل_git","ما هو وكيل إدارة العمل_git"]}},"owner":"ebongard","repo":"renfield","repoPath":"ebongard/renfield","stars":1,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T11:49:18Z","topics":["ai-assistant","docker","knowledge-base","knowledge-graph","mcp","offline-first","ollama","presence-detection","privacy","pwa","rag","raspberry-pi","react","self-hosted","speaker-recognition","typescript","voice-assistant"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-workflow","description":"Git workflow rules for Renfield. Commit message format, issue numbering, branch naming, PR creation, documentation updates before push. Triggers on commit, push, PR erstellen, pull request, branch, git, merge.","bodyPreview":"# Git Workflow\n\n## CRITICAL RULES\n\n1. **NIEMALS ohne Erlaubnis pushen** — `git push` NUR nach expliziter Bestätigung\n2. **Issue-Nummer bei jedem Commit** — Vor jedem Commit nach der Issue-Nummer fragen\n3. **Dokumentation vor Push** — CLAUDE.md, docs/, README müssen Änderungen widerspiegeln\n4. **Branch Protection** — Direct push to `main` is blocked. Always use feature branch → PR → merge.\n5. **Co-Authored-By** — Jeder Commit muss die Co-Author-Zeile enthalten\n\n## Commit Message Format\n\n```\ntype(","body":"# Git Workflow\n\n## CRITICAL RULES\n\n1. **NIEMALS ohne Erlaubnis pushen** — `git push` NUR nach expliziter Bestätigung\n2. **Issue-Nummer bei jedem Commit** — Vor jedem Commit nach der Issue-Nummer fragen\n3. **Dokumentation vor Push** — CLAUDE.md, docs/, README müssen Änderungen widerspiegeln\n4. **Branch Protection** — Direct push to `main` is blocked. Always use feature branch → PR → merge.\n5. **Co-Authored-By** — Jeder Commit muss die Co-Author-Zeile enthalten\n\n## Commit Message Format\n\n```\ntype(scope): Kurze Beschreibung (#issue)\n\nLängere Beschreibung falls nötig.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n```\n\n**Example:** `feat(satellites): Add monitoring dashboard (#25)`\n\n## Commit Types\n\n| Type | Usage |\n|------|-------|\n| `feat` | Neues Feature |\n| `fix` | Bugfix |\n| `docs` | Dokumentation |\n| `refactor` | Code-Refactoring |\n| `test` | Tests hinzufügen/ändern |\n| `chore` | Wartung, Dependencies |\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Create feature branch: `git checkout -b type/short-description`\n2. Make changes + write tests (TDD)\n3. Update documentation (CLAUDE.md, docs/)\n4. Ask for issue number\n5. Commit with proper format\n6. Ask user: \"Soll ich pushen?\"\n7. Only after confirmation: `git push -u origin branch-name`\n8. Create PR: `gh pr create --title \"type(scope): Description (#issue)\" --body \"...\"`\n\n## PR Format\n\n```bash\ngh pr create --title \"type(scope): Description (#issue)\" --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\n- Bullet points describing changes\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Tests added/updated\n- [ ] Manual testing done\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T13:25:54.337Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured collaborative version control with Git workflow management.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Git工作流管理的结构化协作版本控制的开发代理。","ja":"Gitワークフローマネージメントを使用した構造化された共同のバージョン管理が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Git 워크플로우 관리를 사용한 구조화된 협력 버전 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan un control de versiones colaborativo estructurado con gestión de flujo de trabajo de Git.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''un contrôle de version collaborative structuré avec une gestion de workflow Git.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die ein strukturiertes kollaboratives Versionskontrollsystem mit Git-Workflow-Management benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de um controle de versão colaborativo estruturado com gestão de fluxo de trabalho Git.","ru":"Идеально для Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de um controle de versão colaborativo estruturado com gestão de fluxo de trabalho Git.","ar":"يستخدم Agentes de Desenvolvimento الذين يحتاجون إلى وسيط للرقابة و VERSION CONTROL COLLABORATIVE مع gestion de fluxo de trabalho Git."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce critical Git rules, including branch protection, co-authored commits, and documentation updates, utilizing Git push and pull requests with feature branches, while ensuring issue tracking and commit message formatting compliance.","zh":"赋予代理人执行关键的Git规则的能力，包括分支保护、共同提交和文档更新，利用Git推送和拉取请求与功能分支，同时确保问题跟踪和提交消息格式化的合规性。","ja":"エージェントが重要なGitルールを適用できるようにすることで、ブランチ保護、共同コミット、ドキュメントの更新を含む機能ブランチとプルリクエストを使用したGitのプッシュとプルリクエストを利用し、問題の追跡とコミットメッセージのフォーマットの準拠を保証する。","ko":"기능 브랜치 및 풀 리퀘스트와 함께 Git 푸시 및 풀 리퀘스트를 사용하여 중요한 Git 규칙을 적용할 수 있는 에이전트를 제공하여 브랜치 보호, 공동 커밋 및 문서 업데이트를 포함하며 문제 추적 및 커밋 메시지 형식의 준수를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar reglas críticas de Git, incluida la protección de ramas, confirmaciones coautorizadas y actualizaciones de documentación, utilizando push y solicitudes de extracción de Git con ramas de características, al mismo tiempo que garantiza el seguimiento de problemas y el cumplimiento del formato de mensaje de confirmación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des règles Git critiques, y compris la protection des branches, les commits co-signés et les mises à jour de la documentation, en utilisant les push et les demandes d''extraction Git avec des branches de fonctionnalités, tout en garantissant le suivi des problèmes et la conformité au format de message de commit.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, kritische Git-Regeln durchzusetzen, einschließlich Branch-Schutz, Co-Author-Commits und Dokumentationsaktualisierungen, unter Verwendung von Git-Push und Pull-Requests mit Feature-Branches, während sie gleichzeitig die Problemmeldung und die Einhaltung des Commit-Nachrichtenformats sicherstellen.","pt":"Empodera os agentes a aplicar regras críticas de Git, incluindo proteção de branch, commits co-autoreados, e atualizações de documentação, utilizando Git push e pull requests com feature branches, enquanto garante o rastreamento de problemas e o formato de mensagem de commit.","ru":"Эмподера agentes a aplicar regras críticas de Git, incluindo proteção de branch, commits co-autoreados, e atualizações de documentação, utilizando Git push e pull requests com feature branches, enquanto garante o rastreamento de problemas e o formato de mensagem de commit.","ar":"يستخدم Agentes de Desenvolvimento الذين يحتاجون إلى وسيط للرقابة و VERSION CONTROL COLLABORATIVE مع gestion de fluxo de trabalho Git."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing branch protection policies","Automating commit message formatting","Validating documentation updates before push"],"zh":["执行分支保护策略","自动化提交消息格式化","在推送前验证文档更新"],"ja":["ブランチ保護ポリシーの適用","コミットメッセージのフォーマット自動化","プッシュ前にドキュメントの更新を検証"],"ko":["브랜치 보호 정책 적용","커밋 메시지 형식 자동화","푸시 전 문서 업데이트 검증"],"es":["Aplicar políticas de protección de ramas","Automatizar el formato de mensajes de confirmación","Validar actualizaciones de documentación antes de push"],"fr":["Appliquer des politiques de protection des branches","Automatiser le formatage des messages de commit","Valider les mises à jour de la documentation avant push"],"de":["Durchsetzen von Branch-Schutzrichtlinien","Automatisieren der Commit-Nachrichtenformatierung","Validieren von Dokumentationsaktualisierungen vor Push"],"pt":["Enforcing branch protection policies","Automating commit message formatting","Validating documentation updates before push"],"ru":["Enforcing branch protection policies","Automating commit message formatting","Validating documentation updates before push"],"ar":["Enforcing branch protection policies","Automating commit message formatting","Validating documentation updates before push"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git version control system","Needs explicit confirmation for push actions","Limited to feature branch and pull request workflow"],"zh":["需要Git版本控制系统","需要明确的推送动作确认","仅限功能分支和拉取请求工作流"],"ja":["Gitバージョン管理システムの必要性","プッシュアクションの明示的な確認の必要性","機能ブランチとプルリクエストのワークフローへの制限"],"ko":["Git 버전 관리 시스템 필요","푸시 동작에 대한 명시적인 확인 필요","기능 브랜치 및 풀 리퀘스트 워크플로에 대한 제한"],"es":["Requiere sistema de control de versiones Git","Necesita confirmación explícita para acciones de push","Limitado a flujo de trabajo de ramas de características y solicitudes de extracción"],"fr":["Nécessite un système de contrôle de version Git","Nécessite une confirmation explicite pour les actions de push","Limité au workflow de branches de fonctionnalités et de demandes d''extraction"],"de":["Erfordert Git-Versionssystem","Benötigt explizite Bestätigung für Push-Aktionen","Begrenzt auf Feature-Branch- und Pull-Request-Workflow"],"pt":["Requires Git version control system","Needs explicit confirmation for push actions","Limited to feature branch and pull request workflow"],"ru":["Requires Git version control system","Needs explicit confirmation for push actions","Limited to feature branch and pull request workflow"],"ar":["Requires Git version control system","Needs explicit confirmation for push actions","Limited to feature branch and pull request workflow"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"eac8bed60118dbc9eccc0853360a0e977f8021d09cfcd4be6e2243dd1ac31ea3","qualityScore":30}');
