to con Tantivy","Escalabilidad y flexibilidad para desarrolladores","Implementación en Rust para mayor seguridad","Inspiration en Apache Lucene para una búsqueda precisa","Facilidad de uso y configuración para proyectos de desarrollo"],"fr":["Recherche de texte complet avec Tantivy","Évolutivité et flexibilité pour les développeurs","Implémentation en Rust pour une sécurité accrue","Inspiré de Apache Lucene pour une recherche précise","Facilité d''utilisation et de configuration pour les projets de développement"],"de":["Volltext-Suche mit Tantivy","Skalierbarkeit und Flexibilität für Entwickler","Implementierung in Rust für höhere Sicherheit","Inspiration von Apache Lucene für eine präzise Suche","Einfachheit bei der Verwendung und Konfiguration für Entwicklungsvorhaben"],"pt":["Busca em texto completo","Inspirada no Apache Lucene","Escrita em Rust","Solução de busca eficiente","Ideal para desenvolvedores","Flexível e personalizável"],"ru":["Полнотекстовый поиск","Вдохновленная Apache Lucene","Написанная на Rust","Эффективный поисковый инструмент","Предназначенная для разработчиков","Гибкая и настраиваемая"],"ar":["بحث نص كامل","مستوحاة من Apache Lucene","مكتوبة بلغة Rust","حل بحث فعال","مثالية للمطورين","مرنة وقابلة للتخصيص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tantivy","全文搜索引擎库","Apache Lucene","Rust","高性能搜索","如何使用Tantivy","Tantivy安装","Tantivy教程"],"ja":["Tantivy","全文検索エンジンライブラリ","Apache Lucene","Rust","高速な検索","Tantivyの使い方","Tantivyのインストール","Tantivyのチュートリアル"],"ko":["Tantivy","전체문서 검색 엔진 라이브러리","Apache Lucene","Rust","고성능 검색","Tantivy 사용법","Tantivy 설치","Tantivy 튜토리얼"],"es":["cómo usar Tantivy","qué es simple-pr","herramientas de IA para desarrolladores","alternativas a Apache Lucene","simple-pr vs Elasticsearch","instalación de Tantivy","guía de configuración de simple-pr"],"fr":["comment utiliser Tantivy","qu''est-ce que simple-pr","outils d''IA pour les développeurs","alternatives à Apache Lucene","simple-pr vs Elasticsearch","installation de Tantivy","guide de configuration de simple-pr"],"de":["wie man Tantivy verwendet","was ist simple-pr","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Alternativen zu Apache Lucene","simple-pr vs Elasticsearch","Installation von Tantivy","Konfigurationsanleitung für simple-pr"],"pt":["como usar Tantivy","o que é Tantivy","Tantivy alternativa","Tantivy vs Apache Lucene","instalar Tantivy","guia de configuração do Tantivy","desenvolvimento de busca em texto completo","bibliotecas de busca em Rust"],"ru":["как использовать Tantivy","что такое Tantivy","Tantivy альтернатива","Tantivy vs Apache Lucene","установить Tantivy","руководство по настройке Tantivy","разработка полнотекстового поиска","библиотеки поиска на Rust"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Tantivy","ما هي Tantivy","بديل Tantivy","Tantivy مقابل Apache Lucene","تثبيت Tantivy","دليل إعداد Tantivy","تنمية بحث نص كامل","مكتبات بحث بلغة Rust"]}},"owner":"quickwit-oss","repo":"tantivy","repoPath":"quickwit-oss/tantivy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.682Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"simple-pr","description":"Create a simple PR from staged changes with an auto-generated commit message","bodyPreview":"# Simple PR\n\nFollow these steps to create a simple PR from staged changes:\n\n## Step 1: Check workspace state\n\nRun: `git status`\n\nVerify that all changes have been staged (no unstaged changes). If there are unstaged changes, abort and ask the user to stage their changes first with `git add`.\n\nAlso verify that we are on the `main` branch. If not, abort and ask the user to switch to main first.\n\n## Step 2: Ensure main is up to date\n\nRun: `git pull origin main`\n\nThis ensures we''re working from the l","body":"# Simple PR\n\nFollow these steps to create a simple PR from staged changes:\n\n## Step 1: Check workspace state\n\nRun: `git status`\n\nVerify that all changes have been staged (no unstaged changes). If there are unstaged changes, abort and ask the user to stage their changes first with `git add`.\n\nAlso verify that we are on the `main` branch. If not, abort and ask the user to switch to main first.\n\n## Step 2: Ensure main is up to date\n\nRun: `git pull origin main`\n\nThis ensures we''re working from the latest code.\n\n## Step 3: Review staged changes\n\nRun: `git diff --cached`\n\nReview the staged changes to understand what the PR will contain.\n\n## Step 4: Generate commit message\n\nBased on the staged changes, generate a concise commit message (1-2 sentences) that describes the \"why\" rather than the \"what\".\n\nDisplay the proposed commit message to the user and ask for confirmation before proceeding.\n\n## Step 5: Create a new branch\n\nGet the git username: `git config user.name | tr '' '' ''-'' | tr ''[:upper:]'' ''[:lower:]''`\n\nCreate a short, descriptive branch name based on the changes (e.g., `fix-typo-in-readme`, `add-retry-logic`, `update-deps`).\n\nCreate and checkout the branch: `git checkout -b {username}/{short-descriptive-name}`\n\n## Step 6: Commit changes\n\nCommit with the message from step 3:\n```\ngit commit -m \"{commit-message}\"\n```\n\n## Step 7: Push and open a PR\n\nPush the branch and open a PR:\n```\ngit push -u origin {branch-name}\ngh pr create --title \"{commit-message-title}\" --body \"{longer-description-if-needed}\"\n```\n\nReport the PR URL to the user when complete.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:24:35.909Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Version Control Agents needing streamlined Git workflows.","zh":"非常适合需要简化 Git 工作流程的版本控制 Agent。","ja":"Git ワークフローを効率化する必要があるバージョン管理 Agent に最適です。","ko":"간소화된 Git 워크플로우가 필요한 버전 관리 Agent에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de control de versiones que necesitan flujos de trabajo de Git optimizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de contrôle de version nécessitant des flux de travail Git rationalisés.","de":"Perfekt für Version Control Agents, die optimierte Git-Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Controle de Versão que precisam de fluxos de trabalho Git otimizados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов контроля версий, которым необходимы оптимизированные рабочие процессы Git.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة الإصدار الذين يحتاجون إلى تدفقات عمل Git المُختزلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Git repositories efficiently by ensuring a clean workspace state with `git status`, updating the main branch with `git pull origin main`, and handling staged changes for simple PR creation.","zh":"通过使用 `git status` 确保工作区状态清洁、使用 `git pull origin main` 更新 main 分支以及处理暂存更改以简化 PR 创建，使 Agent 能够高效管理 Git 仓库。","ja":"`git status` を使用してワークスペースの状態をクリーンに保ち、`git pull origin main` で main ブランチを更新し、ステージングされた変更を処理してシンプルな PR 作成を実現することで、Agent が Git リポジトリを効率的に管理できるようにします。","ko":"`git status`로 작업 공간 상태를 깨끗하게 유지하고, `git pull origin main`으로 main 브랜치를 업데이트하며, 스테이징된 변경 사항을 처리하여 간단한 PR 생성을 가능하게 함으로써 Agent가 Git 저장소를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar repositorios Git de manera eficiente al garantizar un estado de espacio de trabajo limpio con `git status`, actualizar la rama principal con `git pull origin main` y manejar cambios con stage para la creación de PR simples.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les référentiels Git de manière efficace en garantissant un état de workspace propre avec `git status`, en mettant à jour la branche principale avec `git pull origin main` et en gérant les modifications avec stage pour la création de PR simples.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Git-Repositorys effizient zu verwalten, indem ein sauberer Arbeitsbereichzustand mit `git status` sichergestellt wird, der Hauptzweig mit `git pull origin main` aktualisiert wird und gestufte Änderungen für die einfache Erstellung von PR verarbeitet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar repositórios Git de forma eficiente, garantindo um estado de espaço de trabalho limpo com `git status`, atualizando a branch principal com `git pull origin main` e lidando com alterações em stage para criação simples de PR.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять репозиториями Git, обеспечивая чистое состояние рабочего пространства с помощью `git status`, обновляя основную ветку с помощью `git pull origin main` и обрабатывая зафиксированные изменения для простого создания PR.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة مستودعات Git بفعالية من خلال ضمان حالة مساحة عمل نظيفة مع `git status`، وتحديث الفرع الرئيسي مع `git pull origin main`، ومعالجة التغييرات المُرحلة لإنشاء طلبات سحب بسيطة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Git workflow checks","Verifying workspace state before PR creation","Ensuring main branch is up to date"],"zh":["自动化 Git 工作流程检查","在创建 PR 前验证工作区状态","确保 main 分支是最新的"],"ja":["Git ワークフローチェックの自動化","PR 作成前のワークスペース状態の確認","main ブランチが最新であることの確認"],"ko":["Git 워크플로우 검사 자동화","PR 생성 전 작업 공간 상태 확인","main 브랜치가 최신 상태인지 확인"],"es":["Automatización de controles de flujo de trabajo de Git","Verificación del estado del espacio de trabajo antes de la creación de PR","Garantía de que la rama principal esté actualizada"],"fr":["Automatisation des vérifications de flux de travail Git","Vérification de l''état du workspace avant la création de PR","Assurance que la branche principale est à jour"],"de":["Automatisierung von Git-Workflow-Prüfungen","Überprüfung des Arbeitsbereichszustands vor der PR-Erstellung","Sicherstellung, dass der Hauptzweig aktuell ist"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de fluxo de trabalho Git","Verificar o estado do espaço de trabalho antes da criação de PR","Garantir que a branch principal esteja atualizada"],"ru":["Автоматизация проверок рабочих процессов Git","Проверка состояния рабочего пространства перед созданием PR","Обеспечение актуальности основной ветки"],"ar":["توفير عمليات تدقيق في تدفقات عمل Git","تحقق حالة مساحة العمل قبل إنشاء طلبات السحب","ضمان تحديث الفرع الرئيسي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation","Limited to main branch operations","No support for handling merge conflicts"],"zh":["需要安装 Git","仅限于 main 分支操作","不支持处理合并冲突"],"ja":["Git のインストールが必要","main ブランチの操作に限定","マージコンフリクトの処理をサポートしない"],"ko":["Git 설치 필요","main 브랜치 작업으로 제한됨","병합 충돌 처리 미지원"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Git","Limitado a operaciones de la rama principal","No admite el manejo de conflictos de fusión"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Git","Limité aux opérations de la branche principale","N''a pas de prise en charge pour la gestion des conflits de fusion"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Installation","Begrenzt auf Hauptzweig-Operationen","Keine Unterstützung für die Verarbeitung von Merge-Konflikten"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Git","Limitado a operações da branch principal","Sem suporte para lidar com conflitos de mesclagem"],"ru":["Требуется установка Git","Ограничен операциями основной ветки","Отсутствует поддержка обработки конфликтов слияния"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Git","محدود لعمليات الفرع الرئيسي","لا يدعم معالجة تعارضات الدمج"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1cfa210ff5fcefe144f4968411f8656b9874aad4e79180e54847356cefe2f390","qualityScore":30}');
