l desarrollo","fr":"openai-gpt5-prompting est un outil d''IA qui simplifie le développement","de":"openai-gpt5-prompting ist ein KI-Tool, das die Entwicklung vereinfacht","pt":"O openai-gpt5-prompting é uma habilidade de IA que permite desenvolver aplicativos sem codificação, utilizando a técnica de ''jaunt, dont code''","ru":"ИИ Агент openai-gpt5-prompting позволяет разрабатывать приложения без кодирования, используя технику ''jaunt, dont code''","ar":"الوكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي openai-gpt5-prompting يسمح بتطوير التطبيقات بدون كتابة شفرة، باستخدام تقنية ''jaunt, dont code''","en":"jaunt, dont code."},"definition":{"en":"jaunt, dont code."},"features":{"zh":["无代码开发","AI智能代理","支持多种编程语言","高性能计算","灵活的API接口"],"ja":["ノーコード開発","AIエージェント","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","高性能計算","柔軟なAPIインターフェース"],"ko":["노코드 개발","AI 에이전트","複数의 프로그래밍 언어를 지원","고성능 계산","유연한 API 인터페이스"],"es":["Simplificación del desarrollo","Jaunt sin codificar","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas","Documentación y soporte técnico"],"fr":["Simplification du développement","Jaunt sans codage","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes","Documentation et support technique"],"de":["Vereinfachung der Entwicklung","Jaunt ohne Codierung","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen","Dokumentation und technischer Support"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos de IA sem codificação","Utilização da técnica de ''jaunt, dont code''","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento de IA","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de desenvolvimento","Facilidade de uso e implementação"],"ru":["Разработка приложений ИИ без кодирования","Использование техники ''jaunt, dont code''","Интеграция с инструментами разработки ИИ","Поддержка нескольких сред разработки","Легкость использования и реализации"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي بدون كتابة شفرة","استخدام تقنية ''jaunt, dont code''","التكامل مع أدوات تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم بيئات متعددة للتطوير","سهولة الاستخدام والتنفيذ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openai-gpt5-prompting","AI智能代理","无代码开发","如何使用openai-gpt5-prompting","openai-gpt5-prompting安装","openai-gpt5-prompting替代品"],"ja":["openai-gpt5-prompting","AIエージェント","ノーコード開発","openai-gpt5-promptingの使い方","openai-gpt5-promptingのインストール","openai-gpt5-promptingの代替"],"ko":["openai-gpt5-prompting","AI 에이전트","노코드 개발","openai-gpt5-prompting 사용법","openai-gpt5-prompting 설치","openai-gpt5-prompting 대안"],"es":["cómo usar openai-gpt5-prompting","qué es openai-gpt5-prompting","alternativas a openai-gpt5-prompting","openai-gpt5-prompting vs otras herramientas de AI","instalación de openai-gpt5-prompting","guía de configuración de openai-gpt5-prompting","desarrollo con openai-gpt5-prompting","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser openai-gpt5-prompting","qu''est-ce que openai-gpt5-prompting","alternatives à openai-gpt5-prompting","openai-gpt5-prompting vs d''autres outils d''IA","installation de openai-gpt5-prompting","guide de configuration de openai-gpt5-prompting","développement avec openai-gpt5-prompting","outils d''IA pour les développeurs"],"de":["wie man openai-gpt5-prompting verwendet","was ist openai-gpt5-prompting","alternativen zu openai-gpt5-prompting","openai-gpt5-prompting vs andere KI-Tools","installation von openai-gpt5-prompting","einrichtungsanleitung für openai-gpt5-prompting","entwicklung mit openai-gpt5-prompting","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["Como usar openai-gpt5-prompting","O que é openai-gpt5-prompting","Ferramentas de IA para desenvolvimento","Alternativas ao openai-gpt5-prompting","Guia de instalação do openai-gpt5-prompting","Configuração do openai-gpt5-prompting","Exemplos de uso do openai-gpt5-prompting"],"ru":["Как использовать openai-gpt5-prompting","Что такое openai-gpt5-prompting","Инструменты ИИ для разработки","Альтернативы openai-gpt5-prompting","Руководство по установке openai-gpt5-prompting","Настройка openai-gpt5-prompting","Примеры использования openai-gpt5-prompting"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام openai-gpt5-prompting","ما هو openai-gpt5-prompting","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتطوير","بديلات openai-gpt5-prompting","دليل تثبيت openai-gpt5-prompting","إعداد openai-gpt5-prompting","أمثلة على استخدام openai-gpt5-prompting"]}},"owner":"ijindal1","repo":"jaunt","repoPath":"ijindal1/jaunt","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.743Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openai-gpt5-prompting","description":"Write, critique, and iterate prompts for OpenAI GPT-5 series models. Use for tasks like: (1) turning vague requirements into high-signal instructions, (2) selecting between quick vs deep reasoning behaviors, (3) creating robust structured-output prompts (JSON schemas, tool calls), (4) designing evaluation prompts and rubrics, and (5) debugging prompt failures (hallucinations, format drift, tool misuse). Trigger when the user mentions GPT-5, prompt engineering, system/developer messages, structured outputs, agent prompts, or wants best-practice templates.","bodyPreview":"# GPT-5 Prompting (OpenAI)\n\n## Overview\n\nUse this skill to produce prompts that are: unambiguous, testable, robust to edge cases, and aligned to the desired tradeoff between speed and reliability. Avoid hardcoding model IDs or limits; confirm current model names and features with `$openai-docs` when needed.\n\n## Prompt Pack (Use These Defaults)\n\n### System Message Template\n\nUse a system message that defines role, priorities, safety bounds, and formatting constraints.\n\nRequired elements:\n- Role: w","body":"# GPT-5 Prompting (OpenAI)\n\n## Overview\n\nUse this skill to produce prompts that are: unambiguous, testable, robust to edge cases, and aligned to the desired tradeoff between speed and reliability. Avoid hardcoding model IDs or limits; confirm current model names and features with `$openai-docs` when needed.\n\n## Prompt Pack (Use These Defaults)\n\n### System Message Template\n\nUse a system message that defines role, priorities, safety bounds, and formatting constraints.\n\nRequired elements:\n- Role: what the model is (and is not) responsible for.\n- Output contract: exact format, sections, and any JSON schema constraints.\n- Non-goals: what to avoid (guessing, inventing APIs, ignoring inputs).\n- Clarification policy: what to ask if required info is missing.\n\n### Developer Message Template\n\nUse a developer message for task-specific instructions, context, and constraints (without contradicting system).\n\nInclude:\n- Task statement (1 sentence).\n- Inputs provided and their meaning.\n- Constraints and preferences (libraries, time, cost).\n- Acceptance criteria (how you will judge success).\n\n### User Message Template\n\nMake the user message concrete and data-heavy:\n- Provide examples (good and bad).\n- Provide edge cases.\n- Provide “definition of done”.\n\n## Workflow: Draft -> Test -> Patch\n\n1. Draft the prompt (system/developer/user separation).\n2. Add 3 to 10 targeted test cases:\n- Typical case, tricky case, adversarial case, empty/degenerate input.\n3. Run a “prompt diff” patch cycle:\n- Identify failure mode (ambiguity, missing constraints, competing goals).\n- Patch the smallest instruction that fixes it.\n- Re-run tests.\n\n## Structured Output Guidance\n\nPrefer:\n- Explicit JSON schema (or a strict example) plus “no extra keys”.\n- Deterministic ordering only if needed.\n- “If you cannot comply, return an error object with fields …” (never silently fallback).\n\n## Common Failure Modes (And Fixes)\n\n1. Hallucinated facts:\n- Add: “If unknown, say `I don’t know` and ask for X.”\n- Add: cite-only-from-provided-sources rule when applicable.\n\n2. Format drift:\n- Add: strict schema, no prose, and a single top-level object.\n- Add: “Validate output against schema before responding.”\n\n3. Tool misuse:\n- Add: tool selection rule (“Only call tools when …”), plus examples.\n- Add: “Never fabricate tool outputs.”\n\n## References\n\nSee `references/templates.md` for copy-paste prompt templates and a test-case checklist.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:08:06.034Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced Language Agents needing precise and robust prompt engineering for OpenAI GPT-5 models.","zh":"非常适合需要为 OpenAI GPT-5 模型进行精确且稳健的提示工程的高级语言代理。","ja":"OpenAI GPT-5 モデルに対して、正確かつ堅牢なプロンプトエンジニアリングを必要とする高度な言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"OpenAI GPT-5 모델을 위한 정확하고 강력한 프롬프트 엔지니어링이 필요한 고급 언어 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de lenguaje avanzados que necesitan una ingeniería de prompts precisa y robusta para modelos OpenAI GPT-5.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents linguistiques avancés nécessitant une ingénierie de prompts précise et robuste pour les modèles OpenAI GPT-5.","de":"Perfekt für fortgeschrittene Sprachagenten, die ein präzises und robustes Prompt-Engineering für OpenAI GPT-5-Modelle benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem Avançados que necessitam de engenharia de prompt precisa e robusta para modelos OpenAI GPT-5.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых языковых агентов, которым требуется точное и надежное проектирование промптов для моделей OpenAI GPT-5.","ar":"مثالي لوكلات اللغة المتقدمة التي تحتاج إلى هندسة أوامر دقيقة وقوية لنماذج OpenAI GPT-5."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft unambiguous, testable, and robust prompts aligned with desired tradeoffs between speed and reliability, leveraging system message templates and avoiding hardcoded model IDs or limits, while utilizing $openai-docs for current model features.","zh":"使代理能够利用系统消息模板，避免硬编码的模型 ID 或限制，同时利用 $openai-docs 获取最新的模型特性，来构建明确、可测试且稳健的提示，以符合速度与可靠性之间的期望权衡。","ja":"システムメッセージテンプレートを活用し、ハードコードされたモデルIDや制限を避け、$openai-docs を利用して最新のモデル機能を確認しながら、速度と信頼性のトレードオフに沿った、明確でテスト可能かつ堅牢なプロンプトを作成することをエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"시스템 메시지 템플릿을 활용하고 하드 코딩된 모델 ID나 제한을 피하며, 최신 모델 기능을 위해 $openai-docs를 사용하는 동시에, 속도와 신뢰성 간의 원하는 트레이드오프에 부합하는 명확하고, 테스트 가능하며, 강력한 프롬프트를 제작할 수 있도록 에이전트를 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear prompts inequívocos, comprobables y robustos alineados con las compensaciones deseadas entre velocidad y confiabilidad, aprovechando plantillas de mensajes del sistema y evitando IDs de modelo o límites codificados, mientras se utiliza $openai-docs para las características actuales del modelo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des prompts non ambigus, testables et robustes, alignés sur les compromis souhaités entre vitesse et fiabilité, en tirant parti des modèles de messages système et en évitant les IDs de modèles ou les limites codés en dur, tout en utilisant $openai-docs pour les fonctionnalités actuelles des modèles.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eindeutige, testbare und robuste Prompts zu erstellen, die an den gewünschten Kompromissen zwischen Geschwindigkeit und Zuverlässigkeit ausgerichtet sind, indem Systemnachrichtenvorlagen genutzt und hartkodierte Modell-IDs oder Limits vermieden werden, während $openai-docs für aktuelle Modellfunktionen verwendet wird.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a criar prompts inequívocos, testáveis e robustos alinhados com as compensações desejadas entre velocidade e confiabilidade, aproveitando modelos de mensagens do sistema e evitando IDs de modelo ou limites codificados, enquanto utiliza $openai-docs para recursos atuais do modelo.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать однозначные, тестируемые и надежные промпты, соответствующие желаемому балансу между скоростью и надежностью, используя шаблоны системных сообщений и избегая жестко заданных идентификаторов моделей или лимитов, при этом используя $openai-docs для получения информации о текущих функциях моделей.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من صياغة أوامر واضحة وقابلة للاختبار وقوية تتماشى مع المفاضلات المرغوبة بين السرعة والموثوقية، والاستفادة من قوالب رسائل النظام وتجنب معرفات النماذج أو الحدود الثابتة، مع استخدام $openai-docs لميزات النموذج الحالية."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating prompts for edge case testing","Creating robust system messages for role definition and safety bounds","Optimizing prompt performance for speed and reliability tradeoffs"],"zh":["生成用于边缘案例测试的提示","为角色定义和安全边界创建稳健的系统消息","针对速度与可靠性的权衡优化提示性能"],"ja":["エッジケーステストのためのプロンプト生成","役割定義と安全基準のための堅牢なシステムメッセージの作成","速度と信頼性のトレードオフに対するプロンプトパフォーマンスの最適化"],"ko":["엣지 케이스 테스트를 위한 프롬프트 생성","역할 정의와 안전 범위를 위한 강력한 시스템 메시지 생성","속도와 신뢰성 간의 트레이드오프에 대한 프롬프트 성능 최적화"],"es":["Generar prompts para pruebas de casos extremos","Crear mensajes de sistema robustos para la definición de roles y límites de seguridad","Optimizar el rendimiento del prompt para compensaciones entre velocidad y confiabilidad"],"fr":["Générer des prompts pour les tests de cas limites","Créer des messages système robustes pour la définition des rôles et les limites de sécurité","Optimiser les performances des prompts pour les compromis entre vitesse et fiabilité"],"de":["Generieren von Prompts für Edge-Case-Tests","Erstellen robuster Systemnachrichten zur Rollendefinition und Sicherheitsgrenzen","Optimieren der Prompt-Leistung für Kompromisse zwischen Geschwindigkeit und Zuverlässigkeit"],"pt":["Geração de prompts para testes de casos extremos","Criação de mensagens de sistema robustas para definição de função e limites de segurança","Otimização do desempenho do prompt para compensações entre velocidade e confiabilidade"],"ru":["Генерация промптов для тестирования пограничных случаев","Создание надежных системных сообщений для определения роли и границ безопасности","Оптимизация производительности промпта для баланса между скоростью и надежностью"],"ar":["إنشاء أوامر لاختبار الحالات المتطرفة","إنشاء رسائل نظام قوية لتعريف الدور وحدود الأمان","تحسين أداء الأوامر للمفاضلة بين السرعة والموثوقية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires familiarity with OpenAI GPT-5 models and $openai-docs","May need adjustments for non-OpenAI models or custom implementations"],"zh":["需要熟悉 OpenAI GPT-5 模型和 $openai-docs","对于非 OpenAI 模型或自定义实现可能需要调整"],"ja":["OpenAI GPT-5 モデルと $openai-docs への習熟が必要","非OpenAIモデルやカスタム実装には調整が必要な場合がある"],"ko":["OpenAI GPT-5 모델 및 $openai-docs에 대한 친숙함이 필요함","비OpenAI 모델이나 사용자 정의 구현의 경우 조정이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere familiaridad con los modelos OpenAI GPT-5 y $openai-docs","Puede necesitar ajustes para modelos que no son de OpenAI o implementaciones personalizadas"],"fr":["Nécessite une familiarité avec les modèles OpenAI GPT-5 et $openai-docs","Peut nécessiter des ajustements pour les modèles non OpenAI ou les implémentations personnalisées"],"de":["Erfordert Vertrautheit mit OpenAI GPT-5-Modellen und $openai-docs","Kann Anpassungen für Nicht-OpenAI-Modelle oder benutzerdefinierte Implementierungen erfordern"],"pt":["Requer familiaridade com os modelos OpenAI GPT-5 e $openai-docs","Pode necessitar de ajustes para modelos não OpenAI ou implementações personalizadas"],"ru":["Требует знакомства с моделями OpenAI GPT-5 и $openai-docs","Может потребовать корректировок для моделей не от OpenAI или пользовательских реализаций"],"ar":["يتطلب الإلمام بنماذج OpenAI GPT-5 و $openai-docs","قد يحتاج إلى تعديلات للنماذج غير التابعة لـ OpenAI أو التطبيقات المخصصة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"dd98f560f5d069f4ed642a242e3950cce522e2dcfd56d8d2bca2a03a727ac2f4","qualityScore":30}');
