"],"de":["wie man KI-Agenten verwendet","was ist die Deckenunterstützung","Werkzeuge für Deckenunterstützung alternativen","Deckenunterstützung vs andere Methoden","Installation von Werkzeugen für Deckenunterstützung","Konfigurationsanleitung für Entwickler","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit KI-Agenten"],"pt":["ferramentas de suporte de teto em lajes","como usar ferramentas de suporte de teto em lajes","melhores práticas de suporte de teto em lajes","ferramentas de construção para lajes","alternativas para ferramentas de suporte de teto em lajes","guia de instalação de ferramentas de suporte de teto em lajes"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для поддержки потолков на плитах","как использовать ИИ Агенты для поддержки потолков на плитах","лучшие практики поддержки потолков на плитах","инструменты строительства для плит","альтернативы для ИИ Агентов для поддержки потолков на плитах","руководство по установке ИИ Агентов для поддержки потолков на плитах"],"ar":["أدوات دعم السقف على البلاط","كيفية استخدام أدوات دعم السقف على البلاط","أفضل الممارسات لدعم السقف على البلاط","أدوات البناء للبلاط","بديل لأدوات دعم السقف على البلاط","دليل تثبيت أدوات دعم السقف على البلاط"]}},"owner":"joolbits","repo":"slabbed","repoPath":"joolbits/slabbed","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.813Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"slabbed-ceiling-support","description":"Add hanging/ceiling attachment support for blocks under top slabs, using SlabSupport.isCeilingSupportSurface as the single source of truth.","bodyPreview":"# Slabbed — Skill: Ceiling Support\n\n## Goal\nAllow blocks that require ceiling attachment (chains, hanging signs, lanterns) to place on and survive under top slabs and double slabs.\n\n## Key finding (2026-02-07)\nAnalysis showed that ceiling support **already works** without additional mixins:\n- `SlabSupportStateMixin.isSideSolid` returns true for `Direction.DOWN` on top slabs (all `SideShapeType` variants)\n- `SlabSupportBlockMixin.sideCoversSmallSquare` returns true for `Direction.DOWN` on top sla","body":"# Slabbed — Skill: Ceiling Support\n\n## Goal\nAllow blocks that require ceiling attachment (chains, hanging signs, lanterns) to place on and survive under top slabs and double slabs.\n\n## Key finding (2026-02-07)\nAnalysis showed that ceiling support **already works** without additional mixins:\n- `SlabSupportStateMixin.isSideSolid` returns true for `Direction.DOWN` on top slabs (all `SideShapeType` variants)\n- `SlabSupportBlockMixin.sideCoversSmallSquare` returns true for `Direction.DOWN` on top slabs\n- Top slab collision shape `[0,0.5,0 → 1,1,1]` natively satisfies `isSideSolid(DOWN, CENTER)` via shape cache\n- `ChainBlock` has no `canPlaceAt` override — places anywhere\n- `HangingSignBlock.canPlaceAt` checks `isSideSolid(pos.up(), DOWN, CENTER)` — satisfied by top slabs natively\n- Lanterns use `sideCoversSmallSquare(DOWN)` — covered by `SlabSupportBlockMixin`\n\n## When to use this skill\nWhen adding ceiling-attachment support for a new block type under top slabs.\n\n## Hard stops\n- Ceiling support leaks to bottom slabs, stairs, fences, walls, or panes\n- Baseline full-block behavior changes\n- Build fails\n\n## Steps\n1. Test whether existing `isSideSolid` / `sideCoversSmallSquare` changes already enable placement\n2. If not: check what placement method the block uses (`isSideSolid`, `sideCoversSmallSquare`, or custom)\n3. If custom: add a narrow per-block mixin (`canPlaceAt` inject with early return) routing through `SlabSupport`\n4. Verify survival after neighbor updates (break and replace the slab above)\n5. Verify visual alignment (flush against slab bottom)\n6. Build gate\n7. Test matrix\n8. Commit + tag\n\n## Note on `isCeilingSupportSurface`\nA dedicated `SlabSupport.isCeilingSupportSurface(BlockView, BlockPos)` helper was planned but is NOT needed currently. The existing shared hooks cover all known ceiling-attachment blocks. Only add this helper if a future block requires a custom check that the shared hooks don''t cover.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:34:39.480Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Minecraft Modding Agents needing advanced block placement capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级方块放置能力的Minecraft Modding Agents。","ja":"Minecraft Modding Agentsが高度なブロック配置機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 블록 배치 기능이 필요한 Minecraft Modding Agents에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Modificación de Minecraft que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de colocación de bloques.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de modification de Minecraft ayant besoin de capacités de placement de blocs avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Minecraft-Modding-Agents, die erweiterte Blockplatzierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Modding do Minecraft que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de colocação de blocos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов моддинга Minecraft, требующих продвинутых возможностей размещения блоков.","ar":" مثالي لعميل موددينغ ماين كرافت الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة ل وضع الكتل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and manage block configurations with ceiling support, utilizing SlabSupportStateMixin and SlabSupportBlockMixin, and handling top slabs and double slabs with ease, enabling the placement of chains, hanging signs, and lanterns.","zh":"赋予代理生成和管理带有天花板支持的方块配置的能力，利用SlabSupportStateMixin和SlabSupportBlockMixin，并轻松处理顶部挡板和双挡板，实现链条、悬挂标志和灯笼的放置。","ja":"エージェントが天井サポートを備えたブロック構成を生成および管理する機能を提供し、SlabSupportStateMixinおよびSlabSupportBlockMixinを利用し、トップスラブやダブルスラブを容易に処理し、チェーンやハングサイン、ランタンの配置を可能にします。","ko":"천장 지원을 갖춘 블록 구성 생성 및 관리 기능을 제공하며 SlabSupportStateMixin 및 SlabSupportBlockMixin을 활용하여 상단 슬래브와 이중 슬래브를 쉽게 처리하여 체인, 매달린 표지 및 랜턴의 배치를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar y gestionar configuraciones de bloques con soporte de techo, utilizando SlabSupportStateMixin y SlabSupportBlockMixin, y manejar losas superiores y dobles con facilidad, lo que permite la colocación de cadenas, letreros colgantes y lámparas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de gérer des configurations de blocs avec un support de plafond, en utilisant SlabSupportStateMixin et SlabSupportBlockMixin, et en gérant les dalles supérieures et doubles avec facilité, permettant ainsi le placement de chaînes, de panneaux suspendus et de lanternes.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Blockkonfigurationen mit Deckenunterstützung zu generieren und zu verwalten, indem sie SlabSupportStateMixin und SlabSupportBlockMixin verwenden und Top-Slabs und Doppelslabs mühelos handhaben, wodurch die Platzierung von Ketten, hängenden Schildern und Laternen ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e gerenciar configurações de blocos com suporte ao teto, utilizando SlabSupportStateMixin e SlabSupportBlockMixin, e lidando com lajes superiores e lajes duplas com facilidade, permitindo a colocação de correntes, placas penduradas e lanternas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать и управлять конфигурациями блоков с поддержкой потолка, используя SlabSupportStateMixin и SlabSupportBlockMixin, и обрабатывая верхние плиты и двойные плиты с легкостью, позволяя размещать цепи, висящие знаки и фонари.","ar":"يُجهز الوكلاء لتوليد وإدارةconfigurations من الكتل مع دعم السقف، باستخدام SlabSupportStateMixin و SlabSupportBlockMixin، ومعالجة الألواح العلوية والألواح المزدوجة بسهولة، مما يتيح وضع السلاسل واللافتات المعلقة والمصابيح."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating block placement under top slabs","Generating configurations for hanging decorations","Debugging ceiling attachment issues for chains and lanterns"],"zh":["自动化顶部挡板下的方块放置","生成悬挂装饰的配置","调试链条和灯笼的天花板附着问题"],"ja":["トップスラブの下のブロック配置の自動化","ハング装飾の構成の生成","チェーンやランタンの天井付着の問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["상단 슬래브 아래의 블록 배치 자동화","매달린 장식의 구성 생성","체인 및 랜턴의 천장 부착 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la colocación de bloques bajo losas superiores","Generar configuraciones para decoraciones colgantes","Depurar problemas de fijación de techos para cadenas y lámparas"],"fr":["Automatiser le placement de blocs sous les dalles supérieures","Générer des configurations pour les décorations suspendues","Déboguer les problèmes d''attache de plafond pour les chaînes et les lanternes"],"de":["Automatisieren des Blockplatzierens unter Top-Slabs","Generieren von Konfigurationen für hängende Dekorationen","Debuggen von Deckenbefestigungsproblemen für Ketten und Laternen"],"pt":["Automatizar a colocação de blocos sob lajes superiores","Gerar configurações para decorações penduradas","Depurar problemas de fixação do teto para correntes e lanternas"],"ru":["Автоматизация размещения блоков под верхними плитами","Генерация конфигураций для висящих украшений","Отладка проблем с креплением потолка для цепей и фонарей"],"ar":["تأتمتة وضع الكتل تحت الألواح العلوية","توليد التكوينات للزينة المعلقة","تصحيح أخطاء تركيب السقف للسلاسل والمصابيح"]},"limitations":{"en":["Minecraft modding environment required","Compatibility with specific block types (chains, hanging signs, lanterns)"],"zh":["需要Minecraft模组环境","特定方块类型（链条、悬挂标志、灯笼）兼容性"],"ja":["Minecraftモディング環境が必要","特定のブロックタイプ（チェーン、ハングサイン、ランタン）との互換性"],"ko":["Minecraft 모딩 환경이 필요","특정 블록 유형(체인, 매달린 표지, 랜턴)과 호환성"],"es":["Entorno de modificación de Minecraft requerido","Compatibilidad con tipos de bloques específicos (cadenas, letreros colgantes, lámparas)"],"fr":["Environnement de modification de Minecraft requis","Compatibilité avec des types de blocs spécifiques (chaînes, panneaux suspendus, lanternes)"],"de":["Minecraft-Modding-Umgebung erforderlich","Kompatibilität mit bestimmten Blocktypen (Ketten, hängende Schilder, Laternen)"],"pt":["Ambiente de modding do Minecraft necessário","Compatibilidade com tipos de blocos específicos (correntes, placas penduradas, lanternas)"],"ru":["Требуется среда моддинга Minecraft","Совместимость с конкретными типами блоков (цепи, висящие знаки, фонари)"],"ar":["بيئة موددينغ ماين كرافت مطلوبة","التوافق مع أنواع الكتل المحددة (السلاسل، واللافتات المعلقة، والمصابيح)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5bdc6a51000cdfd5009df03caa00e41d7bea61692d7e2aa3b61e0b332b6824b8","qualityScore":30}');
