developer是CAPE的监控工具，用于提升开发效率和优化性能","ja":"capemon-developerはCAPEの監視ツールで、開発効率とパフォーマンスの最適化に役立ちます","ko":"capemon-developer는 CAPE의 모니터링 툴로 개발 효율과 성능을 최적화하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"capemon-developer es un monitor de CAPE que permite a los desarrolladores supervisar y optimizar sus proyectos. Es una herramienta de AI que ayuda a mejorar ...","fr":"capemon-developer est un moniteur CAPE qui permet aux développeurs de surveiller et d''optimiser leurs projets. C''est un outil d''IA qui aide à améliorer l''eff...","de":"capemon-developer ist ein CAPE-Monitor, der es Entwicklern ermöglicht, ihre Projekte zu überwachen und zu optimieren. Es ist ein KI-Tool, das dabei hilft, di...","pt":"O capemon-developer é uma ferramenta de monitoramento da CAPE projetada para desenvolvedores","ru":"capemon-developer - это инструмент мониторинга CAPE, предназначенный для разработчиков","ar":"أداة capemon-developer لمراقبة CAPE مصممة لمنشئي التطبيقات","en":"capemon: CAPE''s monitor"},"definition":{"en":"capemon: CAPE''s monitor"},"features":{"zh":["支持React和Node.js开发环境","提供实时监控和性能分析","支持CLI命令行工具","提供开发效率优化建议"],"ja":["ReactとNode.js開発環境をサポート","リアルタイムモニタリングとパフォーマンス分析を提供","CLIコマンドラインツールをサポート","開発効率最適化の提案を提供"],"ko":["React와 Node.js 개발 환경을 지원","실시간 모니터링과 성능 분석을 제공","CLI 명령줄 툴을 지원","개발 효율 최적화 제안을 제공"],"es":["Monitorización de proyectos","Optimización de la eficiencia","Mejora de la productividad","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Análisis de datos en tiempo real"],"fr":["Surveillance de projets","Optimisation de l''efficacité","Amélioration de la productivité","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Analyse de données en temps réel"],"de":["Projektüberwachung","Optimierung der Effizienz","Verbesserung der Produktivität","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Echtzeit-Datenanalyse"],"pt":["Monitoramento da CAPE","Desenvolvido para desenvolvedores","Ferramenta de linha de comando (CLI)","Integração com Node.js e Python","Suporte a React","Documentação detalhada"],"ru":["Мониторинг CAPE","Разработан для разработчиков","Инструмент командной строки (CLI)","Интеграция с Node.js и Python","Поддержка React","Детальная документация"],"ar":["مراقبة CAPE","تم تطويره لمنشئي التطبيقات","أداة سطر الأوامر (CLI)","التكامل مع Node.js و Python","دعم React","توثيق مفصل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理工具","capemon-developer教程","如何使用capemon-developer","capemon-developer替代品","capemon-developer安装","capemon-developer设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェントツール","capemon-developerチュートリアル","capemon-developerの使い方","capemon-developerの代替","capemon-developerのインストール","capemon-developerの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 툴","capemon-developer 튜토리얼","capemon-developer 사용법","capemon-developer 대체","capemon-developer 설치","capemon-developer 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","capemon-developer alternativa","CAPE monitor","cómo utilizar capemon-developer","instalación de capemon-developer","guía de configuración de capemon-developer"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","capemon-developer alternative","moniteur CAPE","comment utiliser capemon-developer","installation de capemon-developer","guide de configuration de capemon-developer"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","capemon-developer Alternative","CAPE-Monitor","wie man capemon-developer verwendet","Installation von capemon-developer","Konfigurationsanleitung für capemon-developer"],"pt":["como usar capemon-developer","o que é capemon-developer","alternativas para capemon-developer","capemon-developer vs CAPE","instalar capemon-developer","guia de configuração do capemon-developer","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com capemon-developer","capemon-developer e Node.js","capemon-developer e Python"],"ru":["как использовать capemon-developer","что такое capemon-developer","альтернативы capemon-developer","capemon-developer vs CAPE","установка capemon-developer","руководство по настройке capemon-developer","разработка приложений с capemon-developer","capemon-developer и Node.js","capemon-developer и Python"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة capemon-developer","ما هي أداة capemon-developer","بديل لاداة capemon-developer","أداة capemon-developer مقابل CAPE","تثبيت أداة capemon-developer","دليل إعداد أداة capemon-developer","تطوير التطبيقات مع أداة capemon-developer","أداة capemon-developer و Node.js","أداة capemon-developer و Python"]}},"owner":"kevoreilly","repo":"capemon","repoPath":"kevoreilly/capemon","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.889Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"capemon-developer","description":"Expert capability for navigating, modifying, and extending the capemon malware monitoring codebase. Includes deep knowledge of Windows API hooking, PE structures, and the CAPEv2 sandbox architecture.","bodyPreview":"# Capemon Skills\n\n`capemon` is a sophisticated monitoring and instrumentation engine designed for malware analysis, configuration extraction, and payload recovery. It acts as the core injection component for the CAPEv2 sandbox.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. API Hooking & Monitoring\n`capemon` implements an extensive hooking engine derived from `cuckoomon-modified`, providing deep visibility into application behavior across multiple subsystems:\n- **Process & Thread Management:** Monitoring creatio","body":"# Capemon Skills\n\n`capemon` is a sophisticated monitoring and instrumentation engine designed for malware analysis, configuration extraction, and payload recovery. It acts as the core injection component for the CAPEv2 sandbox.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. API Hooking & Monitoring\n`capemon` implements an extensive hooking engine derived from `cuckoomon-modified`, providing deep visibility into application behavior across multiple subsystems:\n- **Process & Thread Management:** Monitoring creation, termination, and manipulation of processes and threads.\n- **File System Operations:** Tracking file creation, deletion, reading, and writing.\n- **Registry Activity:** Capturing configuration changes and persistence mechanisms.\n- **Network Communication:** Intercepting socket operations, DNS queries, and high-level protocol activity (HTTP, etc.).\n- **Cryptography:** Extracting keys and monitoring encryption/decryption routines.\n- **Synchronization & Services:** Monitoring mutexes, events, and Windows Service interactions.\n- **Windows Management Instrumentation (WMI):** Intercepting WMI queries used for anti-analysis or reconnaissance.\n- **Scripting Engines:** Specific hooks for VBScript and other language runtimes.\n\n### 2. Debugging & Tracing\n`capemon` implements a powerful in-process debugger independent of Windows debugging interfaces, but harnessing the capabilities of the processor:\n- **Hardware breakpoints:** Four breakpoints bp0-bp3 that can be set on execute, read or write\n- **Software breakpoints:** Unlimited INT3 or ''CC'' breakpoints overwriting instruction byte\n- **Single-step:** Tracing allows instruction-level capture enhanced with configurable step-over, trace-length, register changes, function names, strings & more\n- **Actions:** Configurable actions allow control flow manipulation with skipped or taken jumps, arbitrary register changes or jumps, string capture, dumps, scans & more\n- **Programmable:** Debugger configurable either on submission with simple text options or via dynamic YARA signature scans during unpacking or detonation\n- **Integration:** Hooking engine integrated with optional behavior log output & breakpoints set on return from hooked APIs (break-on-return)\n- **Stealth:** Debugger does not rely upon Windows interface and thus evades detection by a slew of interface-related indicators, with additional stealth from hook-based protections\n\n### 3. Automated Unpacking\n''capemon'' implements a powerful unpacking engine using a combination of techniques\n- **Memory region tracking:** Regions of memory revealed through indicators of execution, allocation or protection are tracked\n- **Early capture:** Multiple possible triggers allow payload capture at earliest moment often resulting in working unpacked samples\n- **Injection capture:**: Strong coverage of injection techniques for inter-process payload capture\n- **PE unmapping:** Integrated Scylla engine allows capture of memory or file-mapped PE images in memory\n- **Shellcode dumping:** Shellcode * non-PE regions equally captured as payloads\n- **Import Reconstruction:** Repairing Import Address Tables (IAT) to create functional dumped executables.\n- **AMSI Dumping:** Intercepting and dumping buffers passed to the Antimalware Scan Interface (AMSI).\n\n### 4. Config Extraction\nAutomated Static & Dynamic malware configuration extraction relies on ''capemon'' capabilities\n- **Static extraction:** Typically reliant upon capemon''s unpacking or process dump capture before static parsing\n- **Dynamic extraction:** When parser implementation is onerous, dynamic capture of decrypted configs can be performed by debugger via YARA signature\n\n### 5. YARA integration\nIntegration of YARA for in-memory scanning\n- **Dynamic configuration:** Sandbox configuration such as hooking exclusions or options implemented during detonation\n- **Debugger programming:** Precise dydnamic breakpoint address resolution using YARA signatures & cape-specific metadata\n- **Unpacking engine integration:** Dynamic scanning of all memory regions prior to unpacking capture\n- **Function resolution:** Allows dynamic address resolution for APIs or functions for hooking or other purposes\n\n## Technical Foundations\n- **Platform:** Windows (x86 and x64).\n- **Hooking Method:** Inline hooking of Win32 and Native APIs (NTAPI).\n- **Debugger:** Native in-process ''self'' debugging utilising minimal OS interfaces & hardware capabilities (breakpoint, single-step)\n- **Dependencies:** \n    - `distorm` for instruction decoding.\n    - `libyara` for pattern matching.\n    - `Scylla` for PE reconstruction.\n    - `bson` for data serialization.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:54:28.180Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Malware Analysis Agents requiring advanced API hooking and monitoring capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级API钩子和监控功能的恶意软件分析代理。","ja":"高度なAPIフックとモニタリング機能を必要とするマルウェア分析エージェントに最適。","ko":"고급 API 후킹 및 모니터링 기능을 필요로 하는 악성 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis de malware que requieren capacidades avanzadas de hooking y monitoreo de API.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de malware nécessitant des capacités avancées de hooking et de surveillance d''API.","de":"Ideal für Malware-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte API-Hooking- und Überwachungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Malware que exigem recursos avançados de hooking e monitoramento de API.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа вредоносного ПО, требующих продвинутых возможностей перехвата и мониторинга API.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل البرمجيات الخبيثة الذي يتطلب تقنيات متقدمة لربط ومراقبة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement extensive hooking engines for deep visibility into application behavior across multiple subsystems, including process and thread management, utilizing technologies like cuckoomon-modified for comprehensive analysis and payload recovery.","zh":"赋予代理实现广泛的钩子引擎以深入可见性到应用程序行为，跨多个子系统，包括进程和线程管理，利用类似cuckoomon-modified的技术进行全面分析和有效载荷恢复。","ja":"エージェントに、プロセスとスレッド管理を含む複数のサブシステムを横断するアプリケーションの動作に対する深い可視性を提供する広範なフッキングエンジンを実装する力を与え、cuckoomon-modifiedなどの技術を使用して包括的な分析とペイロードの復旧を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 프로세스 및 쓰레드 관리를 포함한 여러 하위 시스템을 가로지르는 애플리케이션 동작에 대한 깊은 가시성을 제공하는 광범위한 후킹 엔진을 구현할 수 있도록 해줍니다. 또한, cuckoomon-modified와 같은 기술을 사용하여 포괄적인 분석 및 페이로드 복구를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar motores de hooking extensos para una visibilidad profunda en el comportamiento de la aplicación en varios subsistemas, incluyendo la gestión de procesos y subprocesos, utilizando tecnologías como cuckoomon-modified para un análisis y recuperación de payloads exhaustivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des moteurs de hooking étendus pour une visibilité approfondie dans le comportement de l''application à travers plusieurs sous-systèmes, notamment la gestion de processus et de threads, en utilisant des technologies comme cuckoomon-modified pour une analyse et une récupération de payloads complètes.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, umfangreiche Hooking-Engines für eine tiefe Einsicht in das Verhalten der Anwendung über mehrere Subsysteme hinweg zu implementieren, einschließlich Prozess- und Thread-Management, unter Nutzung von Technologien wie cuckoomon-modified für eine umfassende Analyse und Payload-Wiederherstellung.","pt":"Permite que os agentes implementem motores de hooking extensivos para uma visibilidade profunda no comportamento da aplicação em vários subsistemas, incluindo gerenciamento de processos e threads, utilizando tecnologias como cuckoomon-modified para análise abrangente e recuperação de payload.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать обширные движки перехвата для глубокой видимости поведения приложения в нескольких подсистемах, включая управление процессами и потоками, используя технологии, такие как cuckoomon-modified, для всестороннего анализа и восстановления полезной нагрузки.","ar":"يمكّن العملاء من تنفيذ محركات ربط شاملة لتحقيق رؤية عميقة في سلوك التطبيق عبر عدة أنظمة فرعية، بما في ذلك إدارة العمليات والخيط، باستخدام تقنيات مثل cuckoomon-modified من أجل تحليل شامل واستعادة الحمولة."},"useCases":{"en":["Monitoring malware behavior through API hooking","Extracting configurations from malicious applications","Recovering payloads for further analysis"],"zh":["通过API钩子监控恶意软件行为","从恶意应用程序中提取配置","恢复有效载荷以进行进一步分析"],"ja":["APIフックを使用したマルウェアの動作の監視","悪意のあるアプリケーションから構成を抽出","さらに分析するためにペイロードを回復"],"ko":["API 후킹을 통한 악성 코드 행동 모니터링","악성 애플리케이션에서 구성 추출","추가 분석을 위한 페이로드 복구"],"es":["Monitoreo del comportamiento de malware a través de hooking de API","Extracción de configuraciones de aplicaciones maliciosas","Recuperación de payloads para un análisis posterior"],"fr":["Surveillance du comportement de malware via hooking d''API","Extraction de configurations d''applications malveillantes","Récupération de payloads pour une analyse ultérieure"],"de":["Überwachung des Malware-Verhaltens durch API-Hooking","Extraktion von Konfigurationen aus bösartigen Anwendungen","Wiederherstellung von Payloads für eine weitere Analyse"],"pt":["Monitorar o comportamento de malware por meio de hooking de API","Extrair configurações de aplicações maliciosas","Recuperar payloads para análise adicional"],"ru":["Отслеживать поведение вредоносного ПО с помощью перехвата API","Извлекать конфигурации из вредоносных приложений","Восстанавливать полезные нагрузки для дальнейшего анализа"],"ar":["مراقبة سلوك البرمجيات الخبيثة من خلال ربط واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","استخراج التكوينات من التطبيقات الخبيثة","استعادة الحمولات لأغراض التحليل الإضافي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with CAPEv2 sandbox","Limited to malware analysis and related use cases"],"zh":["需要与CAPEv2沙箱集成","仅限于恶意软件分析和相关用例"],"ja":["CAPEv2サンドボックスとの統合が必要","マルウェア分析と関連するユースケースに限定"],"ko":["CAPEv2 샌드박스와의 통합이 필요","악성 코드 분석 및 관련 사용 사례에 한정"],"es":["Requiere integración con CAPEv2 sandbox","Limitado al análisis de malware y casos de uso relacionados"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec le sandbox CAPEv2","Limité à l''analyse de malware et aux cas d''utilisation associés"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit CAPEv2-Sandbox","Begrenzt auf Malware-Analyse und damit verbundene Anwendungsfälle"],"pt":["Exige integração com o sandbox CAPEv2","Limitado à análise de malware e casos de uso relacionados"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с sandbox CAPEv2","Ограничен анализом вредоносного ПО и связанными с ним случаями использования"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع sandbox CAPEv2","محدود بالتحليل البرمجي الخبيث والحالات ذات الصلة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"25b0266c3933f3b48b96dcbac37f1d9860493b08986fc9d319afa75a0a190f19","qualityScore":30}');
