figuration von KI-Tools","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit bmad-validate-prd","Alternativen zu bmad-validate-prd","bmad-validate-prd vs andere Tools","wie man bmad-validate-prd verwendet","Installationsanleitung für bmad-validate-prd"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","bmad-validate-prd","instalação em replit","validação de prd","o que é bmad-validate-prd","guia de instalação bmad-validate-prd","bmad-validate-prd vs outras ferramentas","alternativas ao bmad-validate-prd","como usar bmad-validate-prd"],"ru":["инструменты ии","bmad-validate-prd","установка на replit","валидация prd","что такое bmad-validate-prd","руководство по установке bmad-validate-prd","bmad-validate-prd vs другие инструменты","альтернативы bmad-validate-prd","как использовать bmad-validate-prd"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","bmad-validate-prd","تثبيت على replit","تحقق prd","ما هو bmad-validate-prd","دليل تثبيت bmad-validate-prd","bmad-validate-prd مقابل أدوات أخرى","بديلات bmad-validate-prd","كيفية استخدام bmad-validate-prd"]}},"owner":"KatTate","repo":"Bmad-for-Replit","repoPath":"KatTate/Bmad-for-Replit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.929Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bmad-validate-prd","description":">","bodyPreview":"# BMAD Validate PRD Workflow\n\nThis skill activates the BMAD PRD Validation workflow. It reviews an existing\nPRD against BMAD standards through comprehensive quality assessment.\n\n## Activation\n\nWhen this skill is triggered, load and follow the workflow directly:\n\nRead fully and follow: `_bmad/bmm/workflows/2-plan-workflows/create-prd/workflow-validate-prd.md`\n\nThe workflow uses step-file architecture with steps in `steps-v/` directory.\n- Configuration loading from `_bmad/bmm/config.yaml`\n- PRD fi","body":"# BMAD Validate PRD Workflow\n\nThis skill activates the BMAD PRD Validation workflow. It reviews an existing\nPRD against BMAD standards through comprehensive quality assessment.\n\n## Activation\n\nWhen this skill is triggered, load and follow the workflow directly:\n\nRead fully and follow: `_bmad/bmm/workflows/2-plan-workflows/create-prd/workflow-validate-prd.md`\n\nThe workflow uses step-file architecture with steps in `steps-v/` directory.\n- Configuration loading from `_bmad/bmm/config.yaml`\n- PRD file discovery and loading\n- Output: validation report\n\n## Workflow Steps (13 Steps + 1 Conditional Branch)\n\n1. **step-v-01-discovery** — Discover and load the PRD to validate, detect format\n2. **step-v-02-format-detection** — Format classification and structure analysis\n   - ↳ **step-v-02b-parity-check** — Parity check handler (conditional: auto-loaded for variant/legacy formats)\n3. **step-v-03-density-validation** — Information density validation (wordiness, filler, conciseness)\n4. **step-v-04-brief-coverage-validation** — Product brief coverage validation\n5. **step-v-05-measurability-validation** — Measurability validation (quantified success criteria)\n6. **step-v-06-traceability-validation** — Traceability validation (requirements linkage)\n7. **step-v-07-implementation-leakage-validation** — Implementation leakage detection (technology in requirements)\n8. **step-v-08-domain-compliance-validation** — Domain compliance validation\n9. **step-v-09-project-type-validation** — Project-type compliance validation\n10. **step-v-10-smart-validation** — SMART requirements validation\n11. **step-v-11-holistic-quality-validation** — Holistic quality assessment and rating\n12. **step-v-12-completeness-validation** — Completeness validation\n13. **step-v-13-report-complete** — Final report compilation, summary, and next steps\n\n## Commonly Missed Steps\n\n- ⚠️ **step-v-07-implementation-leakage** — Agents may skip leakage detection since it requires checking FRs/NFRs for technology-specific language. This is a critical quality gate.\n- ⚠️ **step-v-11-holistic-quality** — The holistic assessment provides the overall quality rating. Skipping it means no overall score.\n- ⚠️ **step-v-13-report-complete** — Final report step that compiles all findings and presents actionable options (edit, review, fix). Must not be skipped.\n- ⚠️ **Each validation step must be executed sequentially** — agents may try to batch multiple validations together. Each step must complete fully before the next begins.\n\n## Replit Task List Integration\n\n**MANDATORY on activation:** Before beginning Step 1, create a Replit task list using the `write_task_list` tool with one task per workflow step listed above (13 sequential steps; if step-v-02b parity check is triggered, add it as a task dynamically). Each task should include the step number and name (e.g., \"Step 1: Discovery — Discover and load the PRD to validate\"). Mark the first task as `in_progress`. As you complete each step, immediately mark its task as `completed` (architect_reviewed: \"not_applicable\", reason: \"BMAD workflow step — planning/facilitation, not code\") and mark the next task as `in_progress`. This gives the user visible progress tracking throughout the workflow.\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n- NEVER skip steps or optimize the sequence\n- NEVER auto-proceed past WAIT points — stop and wait for user input\n- ALWAYS read each step file completely before taking action\n- ALWAYS follow step-file architecture: load one step at a time, never look ahead\n- ALWAYS halt at menus and wait for user selection\n- Recommend using a different high-quality LLM for validation if available\n- Each validation step must produce findings independently — do not batch\n\n## What''s Next\n\nAfter validating a PRD, the typical next steps are:\n- If issues found: **Edit PRD (EP)** — fix the identified problems\n- If passed: **Create Architecture (CA)** or **Create UX (CU)**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:06:43.937Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Documentation Analysis Agents specializing in PRD quality assurance and BMAD compliance workflows.","zh":"非常适合专门从事PRD质量保证和BMAD合规工作流程的文档分析智能体。","ja":"PRDの品質保証とBMADコンプライアンスワークフローを専門とするドキュメント分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"PRD 품질 보증 및 BMAD 준수 워크플로우를 전문으로 하는 문서 분석 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Documentation Analysis Agents especializados en flujos de trabajo de garantía de calidad de PRD y cumplimiento de BMAD.","fr":"Idéal pour les Documentation Analysis Agents spécialisés dans les flux de travail d''assurance qualité PRD et de conformité BMAD.","de":"Ideal für Documentation Analysis Agents, die sich auf PRD-Qualitätssicherung und BMAD-Compliance-Workflows spezialisieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Documentação especializados em garantia de qualidade de PRD e fluxos de trabalho de conformidade BMAD.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов анализа документации, специализирующихся на обеспечении качества PRD и рабочих процессах соответствия BMAD.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تحليل الوثائق المتخصصين في ضمان جودة PRD وسير عمل الامتثال لمعايير BMAD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Executes comprehensive PRD validation against BMAD standards through step-file architecture, loading configurations from _bmad/bmm/config.yaml and following structured validation workflows.","zh":"通过step-file架构，从_bmad/bmm/config.yaml加载配置，并遵循结构化的验证工作流程，针对BMAD标准执行全面的PRD验证。","ja":"step-fileアーキテクチャを通じて、_bmad/bmm/config.yamlから設定を読み込み、構造化された検証ワークフローに従って、BMAD標準に対する包括的なPRD検証を実行します。","ko":"step-file 아키텍처를 통해 _bmad/bmm/config.yaml에서 구성을 로드하고 구조화된 검증 워크플로우를 따라 BMAD 표준에 대한 포괄적인 PRD 검증을 실행합니다.","es":"Ejecuta una validación integral de PRD según los estándares BMAD mediante una arquitectura de archivos de pasos, cargando configuraciones desde _bmad/bmm/config.yaml y siguiendo flujos de trabajo de validación estructurados.","fr":"Exécute une validation PRD complète selon les normes BMAD grâce à une architecture de fichiers d''étapes, en chargeant les configurations depuis _bmad/bmm/config.yaml et en suivant des flux de travail de validation structurés.","de":"Führt eine umfassende PRD-Validierung nach BMAD-Standards durch eine Step-File-Architektur aus, lädt Konfigurationen aus _bmad/bmm/config.yaml und folgt strukturierten Validierungs-Workflows.","pt":"Executa uma validação abrangente de PRD em relação aos padrões BMAD através de uma arquitetura de step-file, carregando configurações de _bmad/bmm/config.yaml e seguindo fluxos de trabalho de validação estruturados.","ru":"Выполняет комплексную проверку PRD на соответствие стандартам BMAD с помощью архитектуры step-file, загружая конфигурации из _bmad/bmm/config.yaml и следуя структурированным рабочим процессам валидации.","ar":"ينفذ التحقق الشامل من PRD وفقًا لمعايير BMAD من خلال بنية step-file، مع تحميل التكوينات من _bmad/bmm/config.yaml واتباع سير عمل منظم للتحقق."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating PRD completeness against BMAD standards","Automating quality assessment workflows","Loading and processing configuration files from YAML","Executing step-by-step validation procedures"],"zh":["根据BMAD标准验证PRD的完整性","自动化质量评估工作流程","从YAML加载和处理配置文件","执行分步验证程序"],"ja":["BMAD標準に対するPRDの完全性の検証","品質評価ワークフローの自動化","YAMLからの設定ファイルの読み込みと処理","ステップバイステップの検証手順の実行"],"ko":["BMAD 표준에 대한 PRD 완성도 검증","품질 평가 워크플로우 자동화","YAML에서 구성 파일 로드 및 처리","단계별 검증 절차 실행"],"es":["Validar la integridad de PRD según los estándares BMAD","Automatizar flujos de trabajo de evaluación de calidad","Cargar y procesar archivos de configuración desde YAML","Ejecutar procedimientos de validación paso a paso"],"fr":["Validation de l''exhaustivité des PRD par rapport aux normes BMAD","Automatisation des flux de travail d''évaluation de la qualité","Chargement et traitement des fichiers de configuration depuis YAML","Exécution de procédures de validation étape par étape"],"de":["Validierung der Vollständigkeit von PRD gegen BMAD-Standards","Automatisierung von Workflows zur Qualitätsbewertung","Laden und Verarbeiten von Konfigurationsdateien aus YAML","Durchführung schrittweiser Validierungsverfahren"],"pt":["Validar a completude do PRD em relação aos padrões BMAD","Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de avaliação de qualidade","Carregar e processar arquivos de configuração a partir de YAML","Executar procedimentos de validação passo a passo"],"ru":["Проверка полноты PRD на соответствие стандартам BMAD","Автоматизация рабочих процессов оценки качества","Загрузка и обработка файлов конфигурации из YAML","Выполнение пошаговых процедур валидации"],"ar":["التحقق من اكتمال PRD وفقًا لمعايير BMAD","أتمتة سير عمل تقييم الجودة","تحميل ومعالجة ملفات التكوين من YAML","تنفيذ إجراءات التحقق خطوة بخطوة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific BMAD file structure and workflow directory","Dependent on _bmad/bmm/config.yaml configuration","Limited to PRD document validation workflows"],"zh":["需要特定的BMAD文件结构和工作流程目录","依赖于_bmad/bmm/config.yaml配置","仅限于PRD文档验证工作流程"],"ja":["特定のBMADファイル構造とワークフローディレクトリが必要","_bmad/bmm/config.yamlの設定に依存","PRDドキュメント検証ワークフローに限定される"],"ko":["특정 BMAD 파일 구조 및 워크플로우 디렉토리 필요","_bmad/bmm/config.yaml 구성에 종속됨","PRD 문서 검증 워크플로우로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una estructura de archivos BMAD específica y un directorio de flujo de trabajo","Dependiente de la configuración de _bmad/bmm/config.yaml","Limitado a flujos de trabajo de validación de documentos PRD"],"fr":["Nécessite une structure de fichiers BMAD spécifique et un répertoire de flux de travail","Dépendant de la configuration _bmad/bmm/config.yaml","Limité aux flux de travail de validation de documents PRD"],"de":["Erfordert eine spezifische BMAD-Dateistruktur und Workflow-Verzeichnis","Abhängig von der _bmad/bmm/config.yaml Konfiguration","Beschränkt auf PRD-Dokumentenvalidierungs-Workflows"],"pt":["Requer uma estrutura de arquivo BMAD específica e diretório de fluxo de trabalho","Dependente da configuração _bmad/bmm/config.yaml","Limitado a fluxos de trabalho de validação de documentos PRD"],"ru":["Требует определенной структуры файлов BMAD и рабочего каталога","Зависит от конфигурации _bmad/bmm/config.yaml","Ограничено рабочими процессами проверки документов PRD"],"ar":["يتطلب بنية ملف BMAD محددة ودليل سير عمل","يعتمد على تكوين _bmad/bmm/config.yaml","يقتصر على سير عمل التحقق م