latform built on Stellar. Featuring milestone-based escrows, gamified engagement, and LLM tools. GUIDE: https://kindfis-organization.gitbook.io/development"},"features":{"zh":["基于Stellar的Web3众筹","里程碑式的托管","游戏化的互动","LLM工具","开源平台"],"ja":["StellarベースのWeb3クラウドファンディング","里程碑ベースのエスクロー","ゲーム化されたエンゲージメント","LLMツール","オープンソースプラットフォーム"],"ko":["스텔라 기반의 Web3 크라우드펀딩","마일스톤 기반의 에스크로","게임화된 상호작용","LLM 툴","오픈소스 플랫폼"],"es":["Plataforma de crowdfunding Web3 basada en Stellar","Escrows basados en hitos","Herramientas de LLM","Código abierto","Milestone-based escrows","Gamified engagement"],"fr":["Plateforme de crowdfunding Web3 basée sur Stellar","Escrows basés sur des jalons","Outils LLM","Code open-source","Escrows basés sur des jalons","Engagement gamifié"],"de":["Web3-Crowdfunding-Plattform basierend auf Stellar","Meilensteinbasierte Escrows","LLM-Tools","Open-Source-Code","Meilensteinbasierte Escrows","Gamifiziertes Engagement"],"pt":["Plataforma de financiamento coletivo Web3","Recursos de escrow baseado em marcos","Ferramentas LLM integradas","Código aberto e personalizável","Guia de desenvolvimento detalhado"],"ru":["Открытая платформа краудфандинга Web3","Функции эскроу на основе вех","Интегрированные инструменты LLM","Открытый и настраиваемый код","Подробный гид разработчика"],"ar":["منصة تمويل جماعي مفتوحة المصدر على الويب 3","ميزات إسكرو مدمجة","أدوات LLM متكاملة","كود مفتوح و قابل للتعديل","دليل تطوير مفصل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用stellar-dev","什么是Web3众筹","stellar-dev安装","stellar-dev设置指南","stellar-dev替代品","stellar-dev vs 其他众筹平台"],"ja":["stellar-devの使い方","Web3クラウドファンディングとは","stellar-devのインストール","stellar-devのセットアップガイド","stellar-devの代替品","stellar-dev vs その他のクラウドファンディングプラットフォーム"],"ko":["stellar-dev 사용법","Web3 크라우드펀딩이란","stellar-dev 설치","stellar-dev 설정 가이드","stellar-dev 대체품","stellar-dev vs 다른 크라우드펀딩 플랫폼"],"es":["cómo utilizar stellar-dev","qué es stellar-dev","stellar-dev alternativa","stellar-dev vs otras plataformas","instalar stellar-dev","guía de configuración de stellar-dev","desarrollo de aplicaciones con stellar-dev","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser stellar-dev","qu''est-ce que stellar-dev","alternative à stellar-dev","stellar-dev vs autres plateformes","installer stellar-dev","guide de configuration de stellar-dev","développement d''applications avec stellar-dev","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les développeurs"],"de":["wie man stellar-dev verwendet","was ist stellar-dev","stellar-dev-Alternative","stellar-dev vs andere Plattformen","stellar-dev installieren","Setup-Anleitung für stellar-dev","App-Entwicklung mit stellar-dev","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar stellar-dev","o que é stellar-dev","stellar-dev alternativa","stellar-dev vs outras plataformas","instalar stellar-dev","guia de configuração do stellar-dev","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com stellar-dev","recursos de financiamento coletivo","ferramentas LLM para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать stellar-dev","что такое stellar-dev","альтернатива stellar-dev","stellar-dev vs другие платформы","установить stellar-dev","гид по настройке stellar-dev","разработка приложений с stellar-dev","возможности краудфандинга","инструменты LLM для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام stellar-dev","ما هو stellar-dev","بديل stellar-dev","stellar-dev مقابل منصات أخرى","تثبيت stellar-dev","دليل إعداد stellar-dev","تطوير التطبيقات مع stellar-dev","إمكانيات التمويل الجماعي","أدوات LLM للمطورين"]}},"owner":"kindfi-org","repo":"kindfi","repoPath":"kindfi-org/kindfi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.803Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"stellar-dev","description":"End-to-end Stellar development playbook. Covers Soroban smart contracts (Rust SDK), Stellar CLI, JavaScript/Python/Go SDKs for client apps, Stellar RPC (preferred) and Horizon API (legacy), Stellar Assets vs Soroban tokens (SAC bridge), wallet integration (Freighter, Stellar Wallets Kit), smart accounts with passkeys, status-sensitive zero-knowledge proof patterns, testing strategies, security patterns, and common pitfalls. Optimized for payments, asset tokenization, DeFi, privacy-aware applications, and financial applications. Use when building on Stellar, Soroban, or working with XLM, Stellar Assets, trustlines, anchors, SEPs, ZK proofs, or the Stellar RPC/Horizon APIs.","bodyPreview":"# Stellar Development Skill (Soroban-first)\n\n## What this Skill is for\n\nUse this Skill when the user asks for:\n\n- Soroban smart contract development (Rust)\n- Stellar dApp frontend work (React / Next.js / Node.js)\n- Wallet connection + signing flows (Freighter, etc.)\n- Transaction building / sending / confirmation\n- Stellar Asset issuance and management\n- Client SDK usage (JavaScript, Python, Go, Rust)\n- Zero-knowledge proof verification (where supported by target network/protocol)\n- Privacy-pres","body":"# Stellar Development Skill (Soroban-first)\n\n## What this Skill is for\n\nUse this Skill when the user asks for:\n\n- Soroban smart contract development (Rust)\n- Stellar dApp frontend work (React / Next.js / Node.js)\n- Wallet connection + signing flows (Freighter, etc.)\n- Transaction building / sending / confirmation\n- Stellar Asset issuance and management\n- Client SDK usage (JavaScript, Python, Go, Rust)\n- Zero-knowledge proof verification (where supported by target network/protocol)\n- Privacy-preserving applications (privacy pools, confidential tokens)\n- Local testing and deployment\n- Security hardening and audit-style reviews\n\n## What this Skill is NOT for\n\n- Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, or other non-Stellar blockchain development\n- Stellar node/validator operation (see [validators docs](https://developers.stellar.org/docs/validators))\n- General Rust programming unrelated to Soroban\n- Stellar protocol governance or CAP authoring\n\n## Default stack decisions (opinionated)\n\n### 1. Smart Contracts: Soroban (Rust)\n\n- Use Soroban SDK (`soroban-sdk` crate) for all smart contract development\n- Contracts compile to WebAssembly (WASM)\n- Use `#![no_std]` - standard library not available\n- 64KB contract size limit - use release optimizations\n- Prefer Stellar Assets over custom token contracts when possible\n\n### 2. Client SDK: stellar-sdk (JavaScript) first\n\n- Use `@stellar/stellar-sdk` for browser and Node.js applications\n- Supports both Stellar RPC and legacy Horizon API\n- Full transaction building, signing, and submission\n- Soroban contract deployment and invocation\n\n### 3. API Access: Stellar RPC first (Horizon legacy-focused)\n\n- **Prefer Stellar RPC** for new projects (JSON-RPC, real-time state)\n- **Horizon API** remains available for legacy compatibility and historical-query workflows\n- RPC: 7-day history for most methods; `getLedgers` queries back to genesis (Infinite Scroll)\n- Use Hubble/Galexie for comprehensive historical data beyond RPC\n\n### 4. Token Strategy: Stellar Assets first\n\n- **Prefer Stellar Assets** (classic issuance + trustlines) for fungible tokens\n- Built-in ecosystem support (wallets, exchanges, anchors)\n- Stellar Asset Contracts (SAC) provide Soroban interoperability\n- Use custom Soroban tokens only for complex logic requirements\n\n### 5. Testing\n\n- **Local**: Use Stellar Quickstart Docker for local network\n- **Testnet**: Use Testnet with Friendbot for funding\n- **Unit tests**: Compile to native for fast iteration\n- **Integration tests**: Deploy to local/testnet\n\n### 6. Wallet Integration\n\n- **Freighter** is the primary browser wallet\n- Use Stellar Wallets Kit for multi-wallet support\n- Wallet Standard for consistent connection patterns\n\n### 7. Freshness policy\n\n- Verify volatile facts (protocol support, RPC endpoints, CAP/SEP status, SDK API changes) against official docs before asserting them as current.\n\n## Operating procedure (how to execute tasks)\n\n### 1. Classify the task layer\n\n- Smart contract layer (Soroban/Rust)\n- Client SDK/scripts layer (JS/Python/Go)\n- Frontend/wallet layer\n- Asset management layer (issuance, trustlines)\n- Testing/CI layer\n- Infrastructure (RPC/Horizon/indexing)\n\n### Quick routing\n\n- Need custom on-chain logic? → [contracts-soroban.md](contracts-soroban.md)\n- Building a frontend/dApp? → [frontend-stellar-sdk.md](frontend-stellar-sdk.md)\n- Issuing or managing tokens? → [stellar-assets.md](stellar-assets.md)\n- Zero-knowledge proofs or privacy? → [zk-proofs.md](zk-proofs.md)\n- Setting up tests/CI? → [testing.md](testing.md)\n- Querying chain data or indexing? → [api-rpc-horizon.md](api-rpc-horizon.md) (also see [Data Docs](https://developers.stellar.org/docs/data))\n- Security review? → [security.md](security.md)\n- Hit an error? → [common-pitfalls.md](common-pitfalls.md)\n- Need upgrade/factory/governance/DeFi architecture patterns? → [advanced-patterns.md](advanced-patterns.md)\n- Need SEP/CAP guidance and standards links? → [standards-reference.md](standards-reference.md)\n\n### 2. Pick the right building blocks\n\n- Contracts: Soroban Rust SDK + Stellar CLI\n- Frontend: stellar-sdk (JS) + Freighter/Wallets Kit\n- Backend: stellar-sdk (JS/Python/Go) + RPC\n- Assets: Classic operations or SAC for Soroban interop\n- Testing: Quickstart (local) or Testnet\n\n### 3. Implement with Stellar-specific correctness\n\nAlways be explicit about:\n\n- Network passphrase (Mainnet vs Testnet vs local)\n- Source account + sequence number\n- Fee + resource limits (for Soroban)\n- Authorization requirements\n- Trustline status for assets\n- Contract storage types (temporary vs persistent vs instance)\n\n### 4. Add tests\n\n- Unit tests: Native compilation with `#[test]`\n- Integration tests: Local Quickstart or Testnet\n- Contract tests: Use `Env` from soroban-sdk\n- Frontend tests: Mock wallet/RPC interactions\n\n### 5. Deliverables expectations\n\nWhen you implement changes, provide:\n\n- Exact files changed + diffs\n- Commands to install/build/test/deploy\n- Network configuration (passphrase, RPC endpoint)\n- Risk notes for signing/fees/storage/authorization\n\n## Progressive disclosure (read when needed)\n\n- Smart contracts: [contracts-soroban.md](contracts-soroban.md)\n- Frontend + wallets: [frontend-stellar-sdk.md](frontend-stellar-sdk.md)\n- Testing strategy: [testing.md](testing.md)\n- Stellar Assets: [stellar-assets.md](stellar-assets.md)\n- Zero-knowledge proofs: [zk-proofs.md](zk-proofs.md)\n- API access (RPC/Horizon): [api-rpc-horizon.md](api-rpc-horizon.md)\n- Security checklist: [security.md](security.md)\n- Common pitfalls: [common-pitfalls.md](common-pitfalls.md)\n- Advanced architecture patterns: [advanced-patterns.md](advanced-patterns.md)\n- SEP/CAP standards map: [standards-reference.md](standards-reference.md)\n- Ecosystem projects: [ecosystem.md](ecosystem.md)\n- Reference links: [resources.md](resources.md)\n\n## Keywords\n\nstellar, soroban, xlm, smart contracts, rust, wasm, webassembly, rpc, horizon,\nfreighter, stellar-sdk, soroban-sdk, stellar-cli, trustline, anchor, sep, passkey,\nsmart wallet, sac, stellar asset contract, defi, token, nft, scaffold stellar, constructor, upgrade, factory, governance, standards,\nzero-knowledge, zk, zk-snark, groth16, bn254, poseidon, pairing, privacy, confidential, noir, risc zero, privacy pool, merkle tree\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:30:19.371Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Web3-focused AI Agents requiring advanced Stellar network integration and Soroban smart contract development capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级Stellar网络集成和Soroban智能合约开发能力的Web3重点AI代理。","ja":"Web3に注力したStellarネットワークの高度な統合とSorobanスマートコントラクト開発機能を必要とするAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 Stellar 네트워크 통합 및 Soroban 스마트 계약 개발 기능이 필요한 Web3 중심 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial centrados en Web3 que requieren una integración avanzada de la red Stellar y capacidades de desarrollo de contratos inteligentes Soroban.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle axés sur Web3 nécessitant une intégration avancée du réseau Stellar et des capacités de développement de contrats intelligents Soroban.","de":"Ideal für Web3-fokussierte KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Stellar-Netzwerkintegration und Soroban-Smart-Contract-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA com foco em Web3 que exigem integração avançada de rede Stellar e capacidades de desenvolvimento de contrato inteligente Soroban.","ru":"Идеально для AI-агентов, ориентированных на Web3, требующих расширенной интеграции с сетью Stellar и возможностей разработки умных контрактов Soroban.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يركز على الويب 3 الذي يتطلب تكاملًا متقدمًا للشبكة ستيلار وقدرات تطوير عقود ذكية سوروبان."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build and interact with Stellar dApps using React, Next.js, and Node.js, while leveraging Soroban for smart contract development in Rust, and facilitating wallet connections and transaction management through protocols like Freighter.","zh":"赋予代理使用React、Next.js和Node.js构建和与Stellar dApps交互的能力，同时利用Soroban进行Rust智能合约开发，并通过协议如Freighter实现钱包连接和事务管理。","ja":"React、Next.js、Node.jsを使用してStellar dAppsを構築および操作するエージェントをEmpowerし、Sorobanを使用してRustのスマートコントラクトを開発し、Freighterなどのプロトコルを介してウォレット接続とトランザクション管理を容易にします。","ko":"React, Next.js 및 Node.js를 사용하여 Stellar dApps를 구축하고 상호 작용할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하고 Soroban을 사용하여 Rust 스마트 계약을 개발하며 Freighter와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 지갑 연결 및 트랜잭션 관리를 용이하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear e interactuar con dApps de Stellar utilizando React, Next.js y Node.js, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha Soroban para el desarrollo de contratos inteligentes en Rust y facilita las conexiones de billetera y la gestión de transacciones a través de protocolos como Freighter.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et d''interagir avec des dApps Stellar en utilisant React, Next.js et Node.js, tout en exploitant Soroban pour le développement de contrats intelligents en Rust, et en facilitant les connexions de portefeuille et la gestion des transactions via des protocoles comme Freighter.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Stellar-dApps mit React, Next.js und Node.js zu erstellen und zu interagieren, während Soroban für die Entwicklung von Smart Contracts in Rust genutzt wird und die Verbindung von Wallets und die Transaktionsverwaltung durch Protokolle wie Freighter erleichtert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir e interagir com dApps Stellar usando React, Next.js e Node.js, aproveitando Soroban para desenvolvimento de contrato inteligente em Rust e facilitando conexões de carteira e gerenciamento de transações por meio de protocolos como Freighter.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и взаимодействовать с dApps Stellar, используя React, Next.js и Node.js, а также использует Soroban для разработки умных контрактов на Rust и облегчает подключения кошельков и управление транзакциями через протоколы, такие как Freighter.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء وتفاعل مع تطبيقات داب ستيلار باستخدام رياكت و نيكست و نود، مع استخدام سوروبان لتطوير العقود الذكية بلغة راست، وتسهيل الاتصالات المحفظة وإدارة المعاملات من خلال بروتوكولات مثل فريتر."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing milestone-based escrows on the Stellar network","Building gamified engagement platforms with LLM tools integration","Implementing zero-knowledge proof verification for enhanced privacy and security","Creating and managing Stellar Assets with client SDKs in JavaScript, Python, Go, or Rust"],"zh":["在Stellar网络上开发基于里程碑的托管","使用LLM工具集成构建游戏化参与平台","实现零知识证明验证以增强隐私和安全","使用JavaScript、Python、Go或Rust的客户端SDK创建和管理Stellar资产"],"ja":["Stellarネットワーク上でマイルストーンベースのエスクローを開発する","LLMツールの統合を使用してゲーム化されたエンゲージメントプラットフォームを構築する","プライバシーとセキュリティの向上のためにゼロ知識証明の検証を実装する","JavaScript、Python、Go、またはRustのクライアントSDKを使用してStellar Assetを作成および管理する"],"ko":["Stellar 네트워크에서里程碑 기반의 에스크로를 개발","LLM 도구 통합을 사용하여 게임화된 참여 플랫폼을 구축","개인 정보 보호 및 보안을 강화하기 위해 제로 지식 증명을 구현","JavaScript, Python, Go 또는 Rust의 클라이언트 SDK를 사용하여 Stellar 자산을 생성 및 관리"],"es":["Desarrollar escrows basados en hitos en la red Stellar","Crear plataformas de participación gamificadas con integración de herramientas LLM","Implementar la verificación de prueba de conocimiento cero para una mayor privacidad y seguridad","Crear y gestionar activos de Stellar con SDK de cliente en JavaScript, Python, Go o Rust"],"fr":["Développer des escrows basés sur des jalons sur le réseau Stellar","Créer des plateformes d''engagement gamifiées avec une intégration d''outils LLM","Mettre en œuvre la vérification de preuve de connaissance zéro pour une plus grande confidentialité et sécurité","Créer et gérer des actifs Stellar avec des SDK de client en JavaScript, Python, Go ou Rust"],"de":["Meilenstein-basierte Escrows in dem Stellar-Netzwerk entwickeln","Gamifizierte Engagement-Plattformen mit LLM-Tools-Integration erstellen","Zero-Knowledge-Beweis-Verifizierung für verbesserte Privatsphäre und Sicherheit implementieren","Stellar-Assets mit Client-SDKs in JavaScript, Python, Go oder Rust erstellen und verwalten"],"pt":["Desenvolver escrows baseados em marcos na rede Stellar","Construir plataformas de engajamento gamificado com integração de ferramentas LLM","Implementar verificação de prova de conhecimento zero para privacidade e segurança aprimoradas","Criar e gerenciar Ativos Stellar com SDKs de cliente em JavaScript, Python, Go ou Rust"],"ru":["Разработка эскроу на основе вех в сети Stellar","Создание игровых платформ с интеграцией инструментов LLM","Реализация проверки доказательства с нулевым знанием для повышения конфиденциальности и безопасности","Создание и управление активами Stellar с помощью клиентских SDK на JavaScript, Python, Go или Rust"],"ar":["تطوير الإسكرو على أساس الحجارة الزمنية في شبكة ستيلار","بناء منصات المشاركة القائمة على الألعاب مع دمج أدوات ليم","تنفيذ التحقق من برهان المعرفة الصفري لتحسين الخصوصية والأمان","إنشاء وإدارة أصول ستيلار باستخدام SDK العميل في جافا سكريبت، بايثون، جو، أو راست"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Rust for Soroban smart contract development","Limited to Stellar network and compatible protocols","Dependent on specific client SDKs for JavaScript, Python, Go, or Rust"],"zh":["需要Rust知识来进行Soroban智能合约开发","仅限于Stellar网络和兼容协议","依赖特定的客户端SDK用于JavaScript、Python、Go或Rust"],"ja":["Sorobanスマートコントラクト開発のためにRustの知識が必要","Stellarネットワークと互換性のあるプロトコルに限定される","JavaScript、Python、Go、またはRustの特定のクライアントSDKに依存する"],"ko":["Soroban 스마트 계약 개발을 위해 Rust 지식이 필요","Stellar 네트워크 및 호환 가능한 프로토콜로 제한","JavaScript, Python, Go 또는 Rust의 특정 클라이언트 SDK에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Rust para el desarrollo de contratos inteligentes Soroban","Limitado a la red Stellar y protocolos compatibles","Dependiente de SDK de cliente específicos para JavaScript, Python, Go o Rust"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de Rust pour le développement de contrats intelligents Soroban","Limité au réseau Stellar et aux protocoles compatibles","Dépendant de SDK de client spécifiques pour JavaScript, Python, Go ou Rust"],"de":["Benötigt Rust-Kenntnisse für die Entwicklung von Soroban-Smart-Contracts","Begrenzt auf das Stellar-Netzwerk und kompatible Protokolle","Abhängig von spezifischen Client-SDKs für JavaScript, Python, Go oder Rust"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de Rust para desenvolvimento de contrato inteligente Soroban","Limitado à rede Stellar e protocolos compatíveis","Dependente de SDKs de cliente específicos para JavaScript, Python, Go ou Rust"],"ru":["Требует знания Rust для разработки умных контрактов Soroban","Ограничен сетью Stellar и совместимыми протоколами","Зависит от конкретных клиентских SDK для JavaScript, Python, Go или Rust"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة راست لتطوير العقود الذكية سوروبان","محدود بالشبكة ستيلار وبروتوكولات متوافقة","يعتمد على SDK العميل المحدد لجافا سكريبت، بايثون، جو، أو راست"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b8dcd872cda86918f9dd42ff0e482f8a7631c3d9948db2a8b3cba2d6f3156b3f","qualityScore":29}');
