INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('MohmmedAshraf/laravel-translations/inertia-react-development', 'inertia-react-development', 'MohmmedAshraf', 'laravel-translations', 'community', 'inertia-react-development MohmmedAshraf laravel-translations community Inertia React开发是一个AI智能开发工具，简化React开发流程，提高开发效率 Inertia React開発はAIエージェントによる開発を簡素化し、開発効率を向上させるツールです Inertia React 개발은 AI 에이전트 개발 도구를简化하고 개발 효율성을 높이는 툴입니다 La interfaz de usuario de Laravel Translations ofrece una forma sencilla de gestionar traducciones en tu aplicación Laravel L''interface utilisateur de Laravel Translations offre un moyen simple de gérer les traductions dans votre application Laravel Die Benutzeroberfläche von Laravel Translations bietet eine einfache Möglichkeit, Übersetzungen in Ihrer Laravel-Anwendung zu verwalten A interface de traduções do Laravel simplifica a gestão de traduções em aplicações React. Fornece recursos como adicionar, editar e exportar traduções. Интерфейс переводов Laravel упрощает управление переводами в приложениях на React. Предоставляет такие возможности, как добавление, редактирование и экспорт переводов. تُبسط واجهة ترجمة لارافيل إدارة الترجمات في تطبيقات رياكت. توفر ميزات مثل إضافة وتنقيح وتصدير الترجمات. Laravel Translations UI package provides a user-friendly interface for managing translations in your Laravel application. It simplifies tasks such as adding, editing, deleting, and exporting translations. The package also includes a handy search feature and the ability to invite collaborators for... Inertia React开发 AI智能开发工具 React开发流程 开发效率提高 AIエージェント开发 如何使用Inertia React Inertia React安装 Inertia React设置指南 Laravel Translations UI package provides a user-friendly interface for managing translations in your Laravel application. It simplifies tasks such as adding, editing, deleting, and exporting translations. The package also includes a handy search feature and the ability to invite collaborators for easy translation management');
