Soporte para slate.js"],"fr":["Éditeur de texte enrichi avec IA","Intégration avec MCP et shadcn/ui","Compatibilité avec React et TypeScript","Édition de texte WYSIWYG","Support pour slate.js"],"de":["Reichhaltiger Texteditor mit KI","Integration mit MCP und shadcn/ui","Kompatibilität mit React und TypeScript","Texteditierung WYSIWYG","Unterstützung für slate.js"],"pt":["Editor de texto rico com IA","Integração com MCP e shadcn/ui","Suporte a React e TypeScript","Funcionalidades de WYSIWYG","Compatibilidade com Slate"],"ru":["Редактор с ИИ","Интеграция с MCP и shadcn/ui","Поддержка React и TypeScript","Функции WYSIWYG","Совместимость с Slate"],"ar":["محرر نص غني بالذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع MCP و shadcn/ui","دعم React و TypeScript","خصائص WYSIWYG","التوافق مع Slate"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用ankane-readme-writer","什么是AI智能工具","ankane-readme-writer替代品","ankane-readme-writer vs 其他工具","ankane-readme-writer安装","ankane-readme-writer设置指南","React富文本编辑器","TypeScript WYSIWYG编辑器"],"ja":["ankane-readme-writerの使い方","AIエージェントとは","ankane-readme-writerの代替","ankane-readme-writer vs 他のツール","ankane-readme-writerのインストール","ankane-readme-writerの設定ガイド","React WYSIWYGエディター","TypeScriptリアルタイムプレビュー"],"ko":["ankane-readme-writer 사용법","AI 에이전트란","ankane-readme-writer 대체","ankane-readme-writer vs 다른 도구","ankane-readme-writer 설치","ankane-readme-writer 설정 가이드","React 리치 텍스트 편집기","TypeScript 실시간预览"],"es":["cómo usar ankane-readme-writer","qué es ankane-readme-writer","alternativas a ankane-readme-writer","ankane-readme-writer vs otros editores","instalación de ankane-readme-writer","guía de configuración de ankane-readme-writer","desarrollo de aplicaciones con ankane-readme-writer","integración de ankane-readme-writer con React","uso de ankane-readme-writer en proyectos de TypeScript"],"fr":["comment utiliser ankane-readme-writer","qu''est-ce que ankane-readme-writer","alternatives à ankane-readme-writer","ankane-readme-writer vs autres éditeurs","installation d''ankane-readme-writer","guide de configuration d''ankane-readme-writer","développement d''applications avec ankane-readme-writer","intégration d''ankane-readme-writer avec React","utilisation d''ankane-readme-writer dans les projets TypeScript"],"de":["wie man ankane-readme-writer verwendet","was ist ankane-readme-writer","alternativen zu ankane-readme-writer","ankane-readme-writer vs andere editoren","installation von ankane-readme-writer","konfigurationsanleitung für ankane-readme-writer","entwicklung von anwendungen mit ankane-readme-writer","integration von ankane-readme-writer mit React","verwendung von ankane-readme-writer in TypeScript-projekten"],"pt":["como usar ankane-readme-writer","o que é ankane-readme-writer","alternativas ao ankane-readme-writer","ankane-readme-writer vs outros editores","instalar ankane-readme-writer","guia de configuração do ankane-readme-writer","desenvolvimento com ankane-readme-writer","ankane-readme-writer para iniciantes"],"ru":["как использовать ankane-readme-writer","что такое ankane-readme-writer","альтернативы ankane-readme-writer","ankane-readme-writer vs другие редакторы","установить ankane-readme-writer","руководство по настройке ankane-readme-writer","разработка с ankane-readme-writer","ankane-readme-writer для начинающих"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ankane-readme-writer","ما هو ankane-readme-writer","بديلات ankane-readme-writer","ankane-readme-writer مقابل محررات أخرى","تثبيت ankane-readme-writer","دليل إعداد ankane-readme-writer","التطوير مع ankane-readme-writer","ankane-readme-writer للمبتدئين"]}},"owner":"udecode","repo":"plate","repoPath":"udecode/plate","stars":15972,"forks":955,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:54:45Z","topics":["ai","mcp","react","shadcn-ui","slate","typescript","wysiwyg"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ankane-readme-writer","description":"Creates or updates README files following Ankane-style template for Ruby gems. Use when writing gem documentation with imperative voice, concise prose, and standard section ordering.","bodyPreview":"<examples>\n<example>\nContext: User is creating documentation for a new Ruby gem.\nuser: \"I need to write a README for my new search gem called ''turbo-search''\"\nassistant: \"I''ll use the ankane-readme-writer agent to create a properly formatted README following the Ankane style guide\"\n<commentary>Since the user needs a README for a Ruby gem and wants to follow best practices, use the ankane-readme-writer agent to ensure it follows the Ankane template structure.</commentary>\n</example>\n<example>\nCont","body":"<examples>\n<example>\nContext: User is creating documentation for a new Ruby gem.\nuser: \"I need to write a README for my new search gem called ''turbo-search''\"\nassistant: \"I''ll use the ankane-readme-writer agent to create a properly formatted README following the Ankane style guide\"\n<commentary>Since the user needs a README for a Ruby gem and wants to follow best practices, use the ankane-readme-writer agent to ensure it follows the Ankane template structure.</commentary>\n</example>\n<example>\nContext: User has an existing README that needs to be reformatted.\nuser: \"Can you update my gem''s README to follow the Ankane style?\"\nassistant: \"Let me use the ankane-readme-writer agent to reformat your README according to the Ankane template\"\n<commentary>The user explicitly wants to follow Ankane style, so use the specialized agent for this formatting standard.</commentary>\n</example>\n</examples>\n\nYou are an expert Ruby gem documentation writer specializing in the Ankane-style README format. You have deep knowledge of Ruby ecosystem conventions and excel at creating clear, concise documentation that follows Andrew Kane''s proven template structure.\n\nYour core responsibilities:\n1. Write README files that strictly adhere to the Ankane template structure\n2. Use imperative voice throughout (\"Add\", \"Run\", \"Create\" - never \"Adds\", \"Running\", \"Creates\")\n3. Keep every sentence to 15 words or less - brevity is essential\n4. Organize sections in the exact order: Header (with badges), Installation, Quick Start, Usage, Options (if needed), Upgrading (if applicable), Contributing, License\n5. Remove ALL HTML comments before finalizing\n\nKey formatting rules you must follow:\n- One code fence per logical example - never combine multiple concepts\n- Minimal prose between code blocks - let the code speak\n- Use exact wording for standard sections (e.g., \"Add this line to your application''s **Gemfile**:\")\n- Two-space indentation in all code examples\n- Inline comments in code should be lowercase and under 60 characters\n- Options tables should have 10 rows or fewer with one-line descriptions\n\nWhen creating the header:\n- Include the gem name as the main title\n- Add a one-sentence tagline describing what the gem does\n- Include up to 4 badges maximum (Gem Version, Build, Ruby version, License)\n- Use proper badge URLs with placeholders that need replacement\n\nFor the Quick Start section:\n- Provide the absolute fastest path to getting started\n- Usually a generator command or simple initialization\n- Avoid any explanatory text between code fences\n\nFor Usage examples:\n- Always include at least one basic and one advanced example\n- Basic examples should show the simplest possible usage\n- Advanced examples demonstrate key configuration options\n- Add brief inline comments only when necessary\n\nQuality checks before completion:\n- Verify all sentences are 15 words or less\n- Ensure all verbs are in imperative form\n- Confirm sections appear in the correct order\n- Check that all placeholder values (like <gemname>, <user>) are clearly marked\n- Validate that no HTML comments remain\n- Ensure code fences are single-purpose\n\nRemember: The goal is maximum clarity with minimum words. Every word should earn its place. When in doubt, cut it out.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T13:14:20.706Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing automated README generation for Ruby gems following the Ankane style guide.","zh":"非常适合需要为遵循 Ankane 风格指南的 Ruby gems 自动生成 README 的开发者代理。","ja":"Ankane スタイルガイドに従った Ruby gem に自動で README を生成する必要があるデベロッパーエージェントに最適。","ko":"Ankane 스타일 가이드에 따라 Ruby gem에 자동으로 README를 생성해야 하는 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan una generación automática de archivos README para gemas de Ruby siguiendo la guía de estilo de Ankane.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une génération automatisée de fichiers README pour les gemmes Ruby suivant le guide de style Ankane.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die eine automatisierte Erstellung von README-Dateien für Ruby-Gems nach dem Ankane-Styleguide benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de geração automática de arquivos README para gems Ruby que seguem o guia de estilo Ankane.","ru":"Идеально для агентов-разработчиков, которым требуется автоматическая генерация файлов README для рубиновых гемов, следующих руководству по стилю Ankane.","ar":"مثالي لوفاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى генера automated لتوليد ملفات README للجواهر Ruby التي تتبع دليل Ankane للأسلوب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create properly formatted README files using rich-text editors with AI, MCP, and shadcn/ui, ensuring consistency and adherence to best practices for Ruby gem documentation, including support for Ankane template structures.","zh":"赋予代理创建格式正确的 README 文件的能力，使用富文本编辑器和 AI、MCP、shadcn/ui，确保一致性和遵循 Ruby gem 文档的最佳实践，包括对 Ankane 模板结构的支持。","ja":"AI、MCP、shadcn/ui を使用したリッチテキストエディターで、正しくフォーマットされた README ファイルを作成するエージェントの能力を与え、ルビーゲムのドキュメントのベストプラクティスに一致性と従順性を保証する、Ankane テンプレート構造を含む。","ko":"AI, MCP, shadcn/ui를 사용한 리치 텍스트 편집기를 통해 올바르게 형식화된 README 파일을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하여 Ruby Gem 문서의 모범 사례에 대한 일致성 및 순응성을 보장하며 Ankane 템플릿 구조를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear archivos README con formato adecuado utilizando editores de texto rico con IA, MCP y shadcn/ui, garantizando la coherencia y el cumplimiento de las mejores prácticas para la documentación de gemas de Ruby, incluyendo soporte para estructuras de plantilla de Ankane.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des fichiers README correctement formatés en utilisant des éditeurs de texte enrichi avec l''IA, MCP et shadcn/ui, en garantissant la cohérence et le respect des meilleures pratiques pour la documentation des gemmes Ruby, y compris le support pour les structures de modèles Ankane.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, ordnungsgemäß formatierte README-Dateien mit reichhaltigen Texteditoren unter Verwendung von KI, MCP und shadcn/ui zu erstellen, wodurch Konsistenz und Einhaltung der besten Praktiken für die Ruby-Gem-Dokumentation sichergestellt werden, einschließlich Unterstützung für Ankane-Vorlagenstrukturen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar arquivos README formatados corretamente usando editores de texto rico com IA, MCP e shadcn/ui, garantindo consistência e adesão às melhores práticas para documentação de gems Ruby, incluindo suporte para estruturas de modelo Ankane.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать правильно отформатированные файлы README с помощью редакторов разметки с ИИ, MCP и shadcn/ui, обеспечивая согласованность и соблюдение лучших практик для документации рубиновых гемов, включая поддержку структур шаблонов Ankane.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء ملفات README منسقة بشكل صحيح باستخدام محررات نص غني بالوظائف مع الذكاء الاصطناعي و MCP و shadcn/ui، مما يضمن الاتساق والامتثال لأفضل الممارسات لتوثيق جواهر Ruby، بما في ذلك الدعم لSTRUCTURES Ankane."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating README files for new Ruby gems","Automating documentation for open-source projects","Creating consistent documentation across multiple repositories"],"zh":["为新的 Ruby gems 生成 README 文件","自动为开源项目文档化","跨多个仓库创建一致的文档"],"ja":["新しい Ruby gem の README ファイルを生成する","オープンソースプロジェクトのドキュメントを自動化する","複数のリポジトリにわたる一貫したドキュメントを作成する"],"ko":["새로운 Ruby Gem에 대한 README 파일 생성","오픈 소스 프로젝트의 자동 문서화","여러 저장소에 걸친 일관된 문서 생성"],"es":["Generación de archivos README para nuevas gemas de Ruby","Automatización de la documentación para proyectos de código abierto","Creación de documentación coherente en varios repositorios"],"fr":["Génération de fichiers README pour de nouvelles gemmes Ruby","Automatisation de la documentation pour les projets open source","Création d''une documentation cohérente sur plusieurs référentiels"],"de":["Erstellung von README-Dateien für neue Ruby-Gems","Automatisierung der Dokumentation für Open-Source-Projekte","Erstellung konsistenter Dokumentationen über mehrere Repositorys hinweg"],"pt":["Geração de arquivos README para novas gems Ruby","Automatização da documentação para projetos de código aberto","Criação de documentação consistente em vários repositórios"],"ru":["Генерация файлов README для новых рубиновых гемов","Автоматизация документации для проектов с открытым исходным кодом","Создание согласованной документации в нескольких репозиториях"],"ar":["توليد ملفات README للجواهر Ruby الجديدة","أتمتة توثيق المشاريع مفتوحة المصدر","إنشاء توثيق متسق عبر مستودعات متعددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Ruby gem development","Specific to Ankane style guide and template structure"],"zh":["需要 Ruby gem 开发的知识","特定于 Ankane 风格指南和模板结构"],"ja":["ルビーゲム開発の知識が必要","Ankane スタイルガイドとテンプレート構造に特有"],"ko":["Ruby Gem 개발에 대한 지식이 필요합니다.","Ankane 스타일 가이드 및 템플릿 구조에 특정"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del desarrollo de gemas de Ruby","Específico de la guía de estilo y la estructura de plantilla de Ankane"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en développement de gemmes Ruby","Spécifique au guide de style et à la structure de modèle Ankane"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in der Entwicklung von Ruby-Gems","Spezifisch für den Ankane-Styleguide und die Vorlagenstruktur"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do desenvolvimento de gems Ruby","Específico para o guia de estilo Ankane e estrutura de modelo"],"ru":["Требует знаний разработки рубиновых гемов","Специфичен для руководства по стилю Ankane и структуры шаблона"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بتطوير جواهر Ruby","محدد لدليل Ankane للأسلوب وهيكلة النموذج"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"43005a802f8a1659c03fc8a1227d12ee538b062a37bdd8b4261588433c656f1d","qualityScore":28}');
