tion de Upstash Vector JS","guide de configuration de Upstash Vector JS","développement d''intelligence artificielle avec Upstash Vector JS"],"de":["wie man Upstash Vector JS verwendet","was ist ein AI Agent","Alternativen zu Upstash Vector JS","Upstash Vector JS vs TensorFlow","Installation von Upstash Vector JS","Konfigurationsanleitung für Upstash Vector JS","Entwicklung von künstlicher Intelligenz mit Upstash Vector JS"],"pt":["como usar upstash vector js","o que é upstash vector js","upstash vector js vs competitors","upstash vector js install","upstash vector js setup guide","upstash vector js tutorial","upstash vector js exemplos","upstash vector js documentação","upstash vector js suporte"],"ru":["как использовать upstash vector js","что такое upstash vector js","upstash vector js vs конкуренты","upstash vector js установка","upstash vector js руководство по настройке","upstash vector js уроки","upstash vector js примеры","upstash vector js документация","upstash vector js поддержка"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام upstash vector js","ما هو upstash vector js","upstash vector js مقابل المنافسين","تثبيت upstash vector js","دليل إعداد upstash vector js","دروس upstash vector js","أمثلة upstash vector js","توثيق upstash vector js","دعم upstash vector js"]}},"owner":"upstash","repo":"vector-js","repoPath":"upstash/vector-js","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.664Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upstash-vector-js","description":"Provides quick-start guidance and a unified entry point for Vector features, SDK usage, and integrations. Use when users ask how to work with Vector, its TS SDK, features, or supported frameworks.","bodyPreview":"# Vector Documentation Skill\n\n## Quick Start\n\nVector is a high‑performance vector database for storing, querying, and managing vector embeddings.\n\nBasic workflow:\n\n- Install the Vector TS SDK.\n- Connect to a Vector instance.\n- Upsert vectors, query them, and manage namespaces.\n\nExample (TypeScript):\n\n```ts\nimport { Index } from \"@upstash/vector\";\nconst index = new Index({\n  url: process.env.UPSTASH_VECTOR_REST_URL!,\n  token: process.env.UPSTASH_VECTOR_REST_TOKEN!,\n});\n\nawait index.upsert([{ id:","body":"# Vector Documentation Skill\n\n## Quick Start\n\nVector is a high‑performance vector database for storing, querying, and managing vector embeddings.\n\nBasic workflow:\n\n- Install the Vector TS SDK.\n- Connect to a Vector instance.\n- Upsert vectors, query them, and manage namespaces.\n\nExample (TypeScript):\n\n```ts\nimport { Index } from \"@upstash/vector\";\nconst index = new Index({\n  url: process.env.UPSTASH_VECTOR_REST_URL!,\n  token: process.env.UPSTASH_VECTOR_REST_TOKEN!,\n});\n\nawait index.upsert([{ id: \"1\", vector: [0.1, 0.2], metadata: { tag: \"example\" } }]);\n\nconst results = await index.query({\n  vector: [0.1, 0.2],\n  topK: 5,\n});\n```\n\nFor full usage, refer to the linked skill files below.\n\n## Other Skill Files\n\n### TS SDK Reference\n\n- `sdk-methods`: Explains SDK commands: delete, fetch, info, query, range, reset, resumable-query, upsert\n\n### Features\n\n- `features/namespaces`: Explains namespaces and dataset organization.\n- `features/index-structure`: Covers hybrid and sparse index structures.\n- `features/filtering-and-metadata`: Details metadata storage and server-side filtering.\n\nUse these files for deeper guidance on SDK usage, advanced configurations, algorithms, and integrations.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:21:05.839Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring high-performance vector database capabilities for storing and querying vector embeddings.","zh":"适用于需要高性能向量数据库功能以存储和查询向量嵌入的AI代理。","ja":"ベクトル埋め込みを保存および照会するための高性能ベクトルデータベース機能を必要とするAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"벡터 임베딩을 저장 및 조회하기 위한 고성능 벡터 데이터베이스 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requieren capacidades de base de datos de vectores de alto rendimiento para almacenar y consultar incrustaciones de vectores.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA nécessitant des fonctionnalités de base de données de vecteurs hautes performances pour stocker et interroger des embeddings de vecteurs.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die hochleistungsfähige Vektor-Datenbankfunktionen zum Speichern und Abfragen von Vektor-Einbettungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que exigem capacidades de banco de dados de vetores de alto desempenho para armazenar e consultar incorporações de vetores.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, требующих высокопроизводительных возможностей векторных баз данных для хранения и запроса векторных вложений.","ar":"مثالي لوكيلات الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تتطلب قدرات قاعدة بيانات متجهات أداء عالٍ لتخزين واستعلام متجهات التضمين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage vector embeddings using the Upstash Vector JS SDK, enabling upsert, query, and namespace management operations over REST, leveraging TypeScript for seamless integration.","zh":"通过Upstash Vector JS SDK赋予代理高效管理向量嵌入的能力，支持upsert、查询和命名空间管理操作，通过TypeScript实现无缝集成，利用REST进行操作。","ja":"Upstash Vector JS SDKを使用して、エージェントがベクトル埋め込みを効率的に管理できるようにし、upsert、クエリ、名前空間管理操作をRESTで実行し、TypeScriptを使用してシームレスに統合します。","ko":"Upstash Vector JS SDK를 사용하여 에이전트가 벡터 임베딩을 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 업서트, 쿼리, 네임스페이스 관리 작업을 REST를 통해 수행하며, TypeScript를 사용하여 무중단 통합을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar eficientemente las incrustaciones de vectores utilizando el SDK de Upstash Vector JS, lo que permite operaciones de upsert, consulta y administración de espacios de nombres a través de REST, aprovechando TypeScript para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement les embeddings de vecteurs en utilisant le SDK Upstash Vector JS, permettant des opérations d''upsert, de requête et de gestion d''espaces de noms via REST, en exploitant TypeScript pour une intégration transparente.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Vektor-Einbettungen effizient mithilfe des Upstash Vector JS SDK zu verwalten, wodurch Upsert-, Abfrage- und Namensraumverwaltungsoperationen über REST ermöglicht werden, wobei TypeScript für eine nahtlose Integration genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerenciar incorporações de vetores de forma eficiente usando o SDK Upstash Vector JS, permitindo operações de upsert, consulta e gerenciamento de namespace sobre REST, aproveitando o TypeScript para integração transparente.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность эффективно управлять векторными вложениями с помощью SDK Upstash Vector JS, обеспечивая операции upsert, запроса и управления пространством имен через REST, используя TypeScript для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إدارة متجهات التضمين بطريقة فعالة باستخدام SDK Upstash Vector JS، وتمكينه من عمليات الإدخال والاستعلام وإدارة المساحة الاسمية عبر REST، مستفيدًا من TypeScript للدمج السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Upserting vector embeddings for similarity searches","Querying vector databases for nearest neighbors","Managing namespaces for organized vector data storage"],"zh":["用于相似性搜索的向量嵌入的upsert","查询向量数据库以查找最近邻","管理命名空间以组织化向量数据存储"],"ja":["類似性検索のためのベクトル埋め込みのupsert","最近傍を探すためにベクトルデータベースを照会する","ベクトルデータの整理された保存のために名前空間を管理する"],"ko":["유사성 검색을 위한 벡터 임베딩의 업서트","最近 이웃을 찾기 위해 벡터 데이터베이스를 조회","벡터 데이터의 조직화된 저장을 위해 네임스페이스를 관리"],"es":["Insertar incrustaciones de vectores para búsquedas de similitud","Consultar bases de datos de vectores para vecinos más cercanos","Administrar espacios de nombres para un almacenamiento organizado de datos de vectores"],"fr":["Insérer des embeddings de vecteurs pour des recherches de similarité","Interroger des bases de données de vecteurs pour les plus proches voisins","Gérer des espaces de noms pour un stockage organisé de données de vecteurs"],"de":["Einbettungen von Vektoren für Ähnlichkeitssuchen einfügen","Abfragen von Vektor-Datenbanken für nächste Nachbarn","Verwalten von Namensräumen für einen organisierten Speicher von Vektordaten"],"pt":["Inserção de incorporações de vetores para pesquisas de similaridade"