wendungen","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Datenformaten","Schnelle und präzise Suche"],"pt":["Cliente de pesquisa de IA baseado em HTTP/REST","Construído sobre a API REST do Upstash","Fácil integração com aplicações Node.js","Suporte a consultas de pesquisa personalizadas","Documentação detalhada para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["REST-клиент для поиска ИИ","Построенный на основе API Upstash","Легкая интеграция с приложениями Node.js","Поддержка индивидуальных поисковых запросов","Подробная документация для разработчиков"],"ar":["عميل بحث إيه آي قائم على بروتوكول HTTP/REST","مبني على واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Upstash","إمكانية التكامل السهل مع تطبيقات Node.js","دعم استفسارات البحث المخصصة","وثائق شاملة لمطوري البرمجيات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 Upstash-search-js","什么是 AI 工具","Upstash-search-js 替代品","Upstash-search-js 与其他工具的比较","Upstash-search-js 安装","Upstash-search-js 设置指南","AI 搜索客户端","HTTP/REST 基础 AI 搜索"],"ja":["Upstash-search-js の使用方法","AI エージェントとは","Upstash-search-js の代替品","Upstash-search-js と他のツールの比較","Upstash-search-js のインストール","Upstash-search-js の設定ガイド","AI 検索クライアント","HTTP/REST ベースの AI 検索"],"ko":["업스타시-서치-js 사용 방법","AI 에이전트란","업스타시-서치-js 대체품","업스타시-서치-js와 다른 도구의 비교","업스타시-서치-js 설치","업스타시-서치-js 설정 가이드","AI 검색 클라이언트","HTTP/REST 기반 AI 검색"],"es":["herramientas de búsqueda de IA","upstash-search-js","cómo utilizar upstash-search-js","qué es upstash-search-js","alternativas a upstash-search-js","upstash-search-js vs Elastic Search","instalación de upstash-search-js","guía de configuración de upstash-search-js"],"fr":["outils de recherche d''IA","upstash-search-js","comment utiliser upstash-search-js","qu''est-ce que upstash-search-js","alternatives à upstash-search-js","upstash-search-js vs Elastic Search","installation de upstash-search-js","guide de configuration de upstash-search-js"],"de":["KI-Suchtools","upstash-search-js","wie man upstash-search-js verwendet","was ist upstash-search-js","alternativen zu upstash-search-js","upstash-search-js vs Elastic Search","installation von upstash-search-js","konfigurationsanleitung für upstash-search-js"],"pt":["como usar upstash-search-js","o que é upstash-search-js","alternativas para upstash-search-js","upstash-search-js vs elastic search","instalar upstash-search-js","guia de configuração do upstash-search-js"],"ru":["как использовать upstash-search-js","что такое upstash-search-js","альтернативы upstash-search-js","upstash-search-js vs elastic search","установить upstash-search-js","руководство по настройке upstash-search-js"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام upstash-search-js","ما هو upstash-search-js","بديلات ل upstash-search-js","upstash-search-js مقابل elastic search","تثبيت upstash-search-js","دليل إعداد upstash-search-js"]}},"owner":"upstash","repo":"search-js","repoPath":"upstash/search-js","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.665Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upstash-search-js","description":"Entry point for documentation skills covering Upstash Search quick starts, core concepts, and TypeScript SDK usage. Use when a user asks how to get started, how indexing works, or how to use the TS client.","bodyPreview":"# Upstash Search Documentation\n\n## Quick Start\n\nInstall the TS SDK:\n\n```\nnpm install @upstash/search\n```\n\nCreate a client and perform a simple upsert + search:\n\n```\nimport { Search } from \"@upstash/search\";\n\nconst client = new Search({ url: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_URL, token: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_TOKEN });\nconst index = client.index(\"my-index\");\n\nawait index.upsert({ id: \"1\", content: { text: \"hello world\" } });\nconst results = await index.search({ query: \"hello\" });\n```\n\nBasi","body":"# Upstash Search Documentation\n\n## Quick Start\n\nInstall the TS SDK:\n\n```\nnpm install @upstash/search\n```\n\nCreate a client and perform a simple upsert + search:\n\n```\nimport { Search } from \"@upstash/search\";\n\nconst client = new Search({ url: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_URL, token: process.env.UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_TOKEN });\nconst index = client.index(\"my-index\");\n\nawait index.upsert({ id: \"1\", content: { text: \"hello world\" } });\nconst results = await index.search({ query: \"hello\" });\n```\n\nBasic steps:\n- Create an index\n- Insert or update documents\n- Run searches or filtered queries\n\n## Other Skill Files\n\n### sdk-overview\nProvides detailed documentation for all TypeScript SDK commands. Includes:\n- delete: Deleting documents\n- fetch: Retrieving a document\n- info: Index info\n- range: Range queries\n- reset: Clearing an index\n- search: Search queries\n- upsert: Adding/updating documents\n- getting-started: Setup steps for the SDK\n\n### quick-start\nProvides a fast, end-to-end workflow for creating a Search database, adding documents, and querying them. Covers essential concepts including:\n- Creating a database and storing credentials\n- Adding documents with content and metadata\n- Understanding content vs metadata (searchability and filterability)\n- Performing searches with optional reranking\n- Filtering syntax with SQL-like or structured filters\n- Common pitfalls and best practices\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:21:16.088Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring efficient and scalable search functionality, particularly those leveraging REST API integrations.","zh":"适用于需要高效且可扩展的搜索功能的AI代理，特别是那些利用REST API集成的代理。","ja":"REST APIの統合を利用する効率的でスケーラブルな検索機能を必要とするAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"REST API 통합을 활용하는 효율적이고 확장 가능한 검색 기능을 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requieren funcionalidad de búsqueda eficiente y escalable, particularmente aquellos que aprovechan las integraciones de API de REST.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA nécessitant une fonctionnalité de recherche efficace et scalable, en particulier ceux qui exploitent les intégrations d''API REST.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die eine effiziente und skalierbare Suchfunktion benötigen, insbesondere solche, die REST-API-Integrationen nutzen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que requerem funcionalidade de busca eficiente e escalável, particularmente aqueles que utilizam integrações de API REST.","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, требующих эффективной и масштабируемой функциональности поиска, особенно тех, которые используют интеграции с REST API.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الإصطناعي التي تتطلب وظائف بحث فعالة وقابلة للتوسيع، ولا سيما تلك التي تepend على تحسينات API REST."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform seamless upsert and search operations using the Upstash REST API, enabling efficient data indexing and querying via HTTP/REST protocols, and supporting advanced search functionalities through the @upstash/search library.","zh":"赋予代理使用Upstash REST API执行无缝的upsert和搜索操作的能力，实现通过HTTP/REST协议高效地索引和查询数据，并通过@upstash/search库支持高级搜索功能。","ja":"Upstash REST APIを使用してエージェントがシームレスなupsertと検索操作を実行できるようにし、HTTP/RESTプロトコルを介してデータの効率的なインデックス作成とクエリを可能にし、@upstash/searchライブラリを介して高度な検索機能をサポートします。","ko":"Upstash REST API를 사용하여 에이전트가 무결점으로 업서트와 검색 연산을 수행할 수 있도록 하여 HTTP/REST 프로토콜을 통해 데이터의 효율적인 색인과 쿼리를 가능하게 하고 @upstash/search 라이브러리를 통해 고급 검색 기능을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar operaciones de upsert y búsqueda transparentes utilizando la API de REST de Upstash, lo que permite un indexado de datos eficiente y una consulta a través de protocolos HTTP/REST, y admite funcionalidades de búsqueda avanzadas a través de la biblioteca @upstash/search.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des opérations d''upsert et de recherche transparentes en utilisant l''API REST Upstash, ce qui permet un indexage de données efficace et une interrogation via les protocoles HTTP/REST, et prend en charge des fonctionnalités de recherche avancées via la bibliothèque @upstash/search.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, nahtlose Upsert- und Suchvorgänge mithilfe der Upstash-REST-API durchzuführen, wodurch ein effizientes Datenindexing und Abfragen über HTTP/REST-Protokolle ermöglicht wird und erweiterte Suchfunktionen über die Bibliothek @upstash/search unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar operações de upsert e busca sem problemas usando a API REST do Upstash, permitindo indexação de dados eficiente e consultas via protocolos HTTP/REST, e suportando funcionalidades de busca avançadas por meio da biblioteca @upstash/search.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять безшовные операции upsert и поиска с использованием API REST Upstash, обеспечивая эффективную индексацию данных и запросы через протоколы HTTP/REST, а также поддержку расширенных функций поиска через библиотеку @upstash/search.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من أداء عمليات الإدراج والبحث دون مشاكل باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Upstash REST، مما يسمح بفهرسة بيانات فعالة وعمليات استعلام عبر بروتوكولات HTTP/REST، ودعم وظائف البحث المتقدمة من خلال مكتبة @upstash/search."},"useCases":{"en":["Indexing and searching large datasets for relevant information","Upserting new data into existing indexes for real-time updates","Performing simple and advanced searches using query parameters"],"zh":["为大型数据集编制索引并搜索相关信息","将新数据upsert到现有索引中以实现实时更新","使用查询参数执行简单和高级搜索"],"ja":["大規模なデータセットのインデックスを作成して関連情報を検索する","既存のインデックスに新しいデータをupsertしてリアルタイムで更新する","クエリパラメータを使用してシンプルな検索と高度な検索を実行する"],"ko":["대규모 데이터셋을 색인하고 관련 정보를 검색하는 것","기존 색인에 새로운 데이터를 업서트하여 실시간으로 업데이트하는 것","쿼리 매개변수를 사용하여 간단한 검색과 고급 검색을 수행하는 것"],"es":["Indexación y búsqueda de grandes conjuntos de datos para obtener información relevante","Upsert de nuevos datos en índices existentes para actualizaciones en tiempo real","Realización de búsquedas simples y avanzadas utilizando parámetros de consulta"],"fr":["Indexation et recherche de grands ensembles de données pour obtenir des informations pertinentes","Upsert de nouvelles données dans des indexes existants pour des mises à jour en temps réel","Réalisations de recherches simples et avancées en utilisant des paramètres de requête"],"de":["Indexierung und Suche großer Datensätze für relevante Informationen","Upsert neuer Daten in bestehende Indizes für Echtzeit-Aktualisierungen","Durchführung einfacher und erweiterter Suchvorgänge unter Verwendung von Abfrageparametern"],"pt":["Indexação e busca de grandes conjuntos de dados para informações relevantes","Inserção de novos dados em índices existentes para atualizações em tempo real","Realização de buscas simples e avançadas usando parâmetros de consulta"],"ru":["Индексация и поиск больших наборов данных для получения релевантной информации","Вставка новых данных в существующие индексы для обновлений в реальном времени","Выполнение простых и расширенных поисков с использованием параметров запроса"],"ar":["فهرسة وبحث مجموعات بيانات كبيرة للحصول على معلومات ذات صلة","إدراج بيانات جديدة في فهارس موجودة للتحديثات في الوقت الفعلي","إجراء عمليات بحث بسيطة ومتقدمة باستخدام معاملات الاستعلام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Upstash Search REST URL and token for authentication","Dependent on the @upstash/search library for functionality","Limited to HTTP/REST based interactions"],"zh":["需要Upstash Search REST URL和令牌进行身份验证","依赖@upstash/search库进行功能实现","仅限于基于HTTP/REST的交互"],"ja":["認証にUpstash Search REST URLとトークンが必要","機能に@upstash/searchライブラリに依存","HTTP/RESTベースのインタラクションに限定"],"ko":["인증을 위해 Upstash Search REST URL과 토큰이 필요","@upstash/search 라이브러리에 의존하여 기능을 구현","HTTP/REST 기반의 상호작용으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere URL y token de autenticación de Upstash Search REST","Dependiente de la biblioteca @upstash/search para la funcionalidad","Limitado a interacciones basadas en HTTP/REST"],"fr":["Nécessite l''URL et le jeton d''authentification de l''API REST Upstash Search","Dépend de la bibliothèque @upstash/search pour la fonctionnalité","Limité aux interactions basées sur HTTP/REST"],"de":["Benötigt Upstash-Such-REST-URL und -Token für die Authentifizierung","Abhängig von der Bibliothek @upstash/search für die Funktionalität","Begrenzt auf HTTP/REST-basierte Interaktionen"],"pt":["Requer URL e token de autenticação da Upstash Search REST","Dependente da biblioteca @upstash/search para funcionalidade","Limitado a interações baseadas em HTTP/REST"],"ru":["Требуется URL и токен аутентификации Upstash Search REST","Зависит от библиотеки @upstash/search для функциональности","Ограничен взаимодействиями на основе HTTP/REST"],"ar":["يتطلب عنوان URL ورمز مصادقة Upstash Search REST","يعتمد على مكتبة @upstash/search للوظائف","محدود بالتفاعلات القائمة على HTTP/REST"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7f68061661f3a02d7dc7d4c3d9f620275d45093ff14e6fe5fb45bfcbce8b2cef","qualityScore":28}');
