하고 사용할 수 있습니다","es":"La inyección de dependencias en Angular permite a los desarrolladores configurar y usar dependencias de manera eficiente","fr":"L''injection de dépendances dans Angular permet aux développeurs de configurer et d''utiliser des dépendances de manière efficace","de":"Die Abhängigkeitsinjektion in Angular ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Abhängigkeiten effizient zu konfigurieren und zu verwenden","pt":"Configure e use injeção de dependência no Angular v20+ com inject() e provedores para melhorar a manutenção do código","ru":"Настройте и используйте внедрение зависимостей в Angular v20+ с помощью inject() и провайдеров для улучшения поддержки кода","ar":"اضبط وحقن التبعية في Angular v20+ مع inject() ومقدمي الخدمات لتحسين صيانة الكود","en":"Agent Skills for Angular Developers"},"definition":{"en":"Agent Skills for Angular Developers"},"features":{"zh":["使用 inject() 配置依赖注入","使用提供者管理依赖项","支持 Angular v20+","提高代码可维护性","减少代码耦合度"],"ja":["inject() を使用して依存性注入を設定","プロバイダーを使用して依存関係を管理","Angular v20+ をサポート","コードの保守性を向上","コードの結合度を削減"],"ko":["inject()를 사용하여 의존성 주입을 설정","제공자를 사용하여 의존성을 관리","Angular v20+ 지원","코드 유지 보수성 향상","코드 결합도 감소"],"es":["Configuración de la inyección de dependencias con inject()","Uso de proveedores para gestionar dependencias","Inyección de dependencias en componentes y servicios","Compatibilidad con Angular v20+","Mejora de la eficiencia y la escalabilidad de las aplicaciones"],"fr":["Configuration de l''injection de dépendances avec inject()","Utilisation de fournisseurs pour gérer des dépendances","Injection de dépendances dans les composants et les services","Compatibilité avec Angular v20+","Amélioration de l''efficacité et de la scalabilité des applications"],"de":["Konfiguration der Abhängigkeitsinjektion mit inject()","Verwendung von Anbietern zur Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten","Injektion von Abhängigkeiten in Komponenten und Diensten","Kompatibilität mit Angular v20+","Verbesserung der Effizienz und Skalierbarkeit von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Uso de inject() para injeção de dependência","Configuração de provedores para gerenciamento de dependências","Melhoria da manutenção do código com injeção de dependência","Compatibilidade com Angular v20+","Exemplos práticos de uso de inject() e provedores"],"ru":["Использование inject() для внедрения зависимостей","Настройка провайдеров для управления зависимостями","Улучшение поддержки кода с помощью внедрения зависимостей","Совместимость с Angular v20+","Практические примеры использования inject() и провайдеров"],"ar":["استخدام inject() لحقن التبعية","تكوين مقدمي الخدمات لإدارة التبعيات","تحسين صيانة الكود مع حقن التبعية","التوافق مع Angular v20+","أمثلة عملية لاستخدام inject() ومقدمي الخدمات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular 依赖注入","DI","inject()","提供者","Angular v20+","依赖注入模式"],"ja":["Angular DI","依存性注入","inject()","プロバイダー","Angular v20+","依存性注入パターン"],"ko":["Angular 의존성 주입","DI","inject()","제공자","Angular v20+","의존성 주입 패턴"],"es":["inyección de dependencias","angular","inject()","proveedores","componentes","servicios","desarrollo de aplicaciones","eficiencia","escalabilidad"],"fr":["injection de dépendances","angular","inject()","fournisseurs","composants","services","développement d''applications","efficacité","scalabilité"],"de":["abhängigkeitsinjektion","angular","inject()","anbieter","komponenten","dienste","anwendungsentwicklung","effizienz","skalierbarkeit"],"pt":["injeção de dependência angular","angular v20","inject()","provedores","manutenção do código","desenvolvimento de software","programação angular"],"ru":["внедрение зависимостей angular","angular v20","inject()","провайдеры","поддержка кода","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование на angular"],"ar":["حقن التبعية في Angular","Angular v20","inject()","مقدمي الخدمات","صيانة الكود","تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة Angular"]}},"owner":"analogjs","repo":"angular-skills","repoPath":"analogjs/angular-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.667Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"angular-di","description":"Implement dependency injection in Angular v20+ using inject(), injection tokens, and provider configuration. Use for service architecture, providing dependencies at different levels, creating injectable tokens, and managing singleton vs scoped services. Triggers on service creation, configuring providers, using injection tokens, or understanding DI hierarchy.","bodyPreview":"# Angular Dependency Injection\n\nConfigure and use dependency injection in Angular v20+ with `inject()` and providers.\n\n## Basic Injection\n\n### Using inject()\n\nPrefer `inject()` over constructor injection:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { HttpClient } from ''@angular/common/http'';\nimport { User } from ''./user.service'';\n\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-user-list'',\n  template: `...`,\n})\nexport class UserList {\n  // Inject dependencies\n  private http = inject(H","body":"# Angular Dependency Injection\n\nConfigure and use dependency injection in Angular v20+ with `inject()` and providers.\n\n## Basic Injection\n\n### Using inject()\n\nPrefer `inject()` over constructor injection:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { HttpClient } from ''@angular/common/http'';\nimport { User } from ''./user.service'';\n\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-user-list'',\n  template: `...`,\n})\nexport class UserList {\n  // Inject dependencies\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n  private userService = inject(User);\n  \n  // Can use immediately\n  users = this.userService.getUsers();\n}\n```\n\n### Injectable Services\n\n```typescript\nimport { Injectable, inject, signal } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { HttpClient } from ''@angular/common/http'';\n\n@Injectable({\n  providedIn: ''root'', // Singleton at root level\n})\nexport class User {\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n  \n  private users = signal<User[]>([]);\n  readonly users$ = this.users.asReadonly();\n  \n  async loadUsers() {\n    const users = await firstValueFrom(\n      this.http.get<User[]>(''/api/users'')\n    );\n    this.users.set(users);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Provider Scopes\n\n### Root Level (Singleton)\n\n```typescript\n// Recommended: providedIn\n@Injectable({\n  providedIn: ''root'',\n})\nexport class Auth {}\n\n// Alternative: in app.config.ts\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    Auth,\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Component Level (Instance per Component)\n\n```typescript\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-editor'',\n  providers: [EditorState], // New instance for each component\n  template: `...`,\n})\nexport class Editor {\n  private editorState = inject(EditorState);\n}\n```\n\n### Route Level\n\n```typescript\nexport const routes: Routes = [\n  {\n    path: ''admin'',\n    providers: [Admin], // Shared within this route tree\n    children: [\n      { path: '''', component: AdminDashboard },\n      { path: ''users'', component: AdminUsers },\n    ],\n  },\n];\n```\n\n## Injection Tokens\n\n### Creating Tokens\n\n```typescript\nimport { InjectionToken } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n// Simple value token\nexport const API_URL = new InjectionToken<string>(''API_URL'');\n\n// Object token\nexport interface AppConfig {\n  apiUrl: string;\n  features: {\n    darkMode: boolean;\n    analytics: boolean;\n  };\n}\n\nexport const APP_CONFIG = new InjectionToken<AppConfig>(''APP_CONFIG'');\n\n// Token with factory (self-providing)\nexport const WINDOW = new InjectionToken<Window>(''Window'', {\n  providedIn: ''root'',\n  factory: () => window,\n});\n\nexport const LOCAL_STORAGE = new InjectionToken<Storage>(''LocalStorage'', {\n  providedIn: ''root'',\n  factory: () => localStorage,\n});\n```\n\n### Providing Token Values\n\n```typescript\n// app.config.ts\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    { provide: API_URL, useValue: ''https://api.example.com'' },\n    {\n      provide: APP_CONFIG,\n      useValue: {\n        apiUrl: ''https://api.example.com'',\n        features: { darkMode: true, analytics: true },\n      },\n    },\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Injecting Tokens\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class Api {\n  private apiUrl = inject(API_URL);\n  private config = inject(APP_CONFIG);\n  private window = inject(WINDOW);\n  \n  getBaseUrl(): string {\n    return this.apiUrl;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Provider Types\n\n### useClass\n\n```typescript\n// Provide implementation\n{ provide: Logger, useClass: ConsoleLogger }\n\n// Conditional implementation\n{\n  provide: Logger,\n  useClass: environment.production\n    ? ProductionLogger\n    : ConsoleLogger,\n}\n```\n\n### useValue\n\n```typescript\n// Static values\n{ provide: API_URL, useValue: ''https://api.example.com'' }\n\n// Configuration objects\n{ provide: APP_CONFIG, useValue: { theme: ''dark'', language: ''en'' } }\n```\n\n### useFactory\n\n```typescript\n// Factory with dependencies\n{\n  provide: User,\n  useFactory: (http: HttpClient, config: AppConfig) => {\n    return new User(http, config.apiUrl);\n  },\n  deps: [HttpClient, APP_CONFIG],\n}\n\n// Async factory (not recommended - use provideAppInitializer)\n{\n  provide: CONFIG,\n  useFactory: () => fetch(''/config.json'').then(r => r.json()),\n}\n```\n\n### useExisting\n\n```typescript\n// Alias to existing provider\n{ provide: AbstractLogger, useExisting: ConsoleLogger }\n\n// Multiple tokens pointing to same instance\nproviders: [\n  ConsoleLogger,\n  { provide: Logger, useExisting: ConsoleLogger },\n  { provide: ErrorLogger, useExisting: ConsoleLogger },\n]\n```\n\n## Injection Options\n\n### Optional Injection\n\n```typescript\n@Component({...})\nexport class My {\n  // Returns null if not provided\n  private analytics = inject(Analytics, { optional: true });\n  \n  trackEvent(name: string) {\n    this.analytics?.track(name);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Self, SkipSelf, Host\n\n```typescript\n@Component({\n  providers: [Local],\n})\nexport class Parent {\n  // Only look in this component''s injector\n  private local = inject(Local, { self: true });\n}\n\n@Component({...})\nexport class Child {\n  // Skip this component, look in parent\n  private parentService = inject(ParentSvc, { skipSelf: true });\n\n  // Only look up to host component\n  private hostService = inject(Host, { host: true });\n}\n```\n\n## Multi Providers\n\nCollect multiple values for same token:\n\n```typescript\n// Token for multiple validators\nexport const VALIDATORS = new InjectionToken<Validator[]>(''Validators'');\n\n// Provide multiple values\nproviders: [\n  { provide: VALIDATORS, useClass: RequiredValidator, multi: true },\n  { provide: VALIDATORS, useClass: EmailValidator, multi: true },\n  { provide: VALIDATORS, useClass: MinLengthValidator, multi: true },\n]\n\n// Inject as array\n@Injectable()\nexport class Validation {\n  private validators = inject(VALIDATORS); // Validator[]\n  \n  validate(value: string): ValidationError[] {\n    return this.validators\n      .map(v => v.validate(value))\n      .filter(Boolean);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### HTTP Interceptors (Multi Provider)\n\n```typescript\n// Interceptors use multi providers internally\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    provideHttpClient(\n      withInterceptors([\n        authInterceptor,\n        loggingInterceptor,\n        errorInterceptor,\n      ])\n    ),\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n## App Initializers\n\nRun async code before app starts using `provideAppInitializer`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { provideAppInitializer, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\n\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    Config,\n    provideAppInitializer(() => {\n      const configService = inject(Config);\n      return configService.loadConfig();\n    }),\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Multiple Initializers\n\n```typescript\nproviders: [\n  provideAppInitializer(() => {\n    const config = inject(Config);\n    return config.load();\n  }),\n  provideAppInitializer(() => {\n    const auth = inject(Auth);\n    return auth.checkSession();\n  }),\n]\n```\n\n## Environment Injector\n\nCreate injectors programmatically:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createEnvironmentInjector, EnvironmentInjector, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class Plugin {\n  private parentInjector = inject(EnvironmentInjector);\n  \n  loadPlugin(providers: Provider[]): EnvironmentInjector {\n    return createEnvironmentInjector(providers, this.parentInjector);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## runInInjectionContext\n\nRun code with injection context:\n\n```typescript\nimport { runInInjectionContext, EnvironmentInjector, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class Utility {\n  private injector = inject(EnvironmentInjector);\n  \n  executeWithDI<T>(fn: () => T): T {\n    return runInInjectionContext(this.injector, fn);\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage\nutilityService.executeWithDI(() => {\n  const http = inject(HttpClient);\n  // Use http...\n});\n```\n\nFor advanced patterns, see [references/di-patterns.md](references/di-patterns.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:22:10.352Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced Angular dependency injection capabilities with inject() and providers.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Angular 依赖注入功能的前端代理，包括 inject() 和提供者。","ja":"inject() とプロバイダーを使用する Angular での依存注入機能が必要なフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Angular 의존성 주입 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, inject() 및 제공자를 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de inyección de dependencias de Angular con inject() y proveedores.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend qui ont besoin de capacités avancées d''injection de dépendances Angular avec inject() et fournisseurs.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die erweiterte Angular-Abhängigkeitsinjektionsfunktionen mit inject() und Providern benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de injeção de dependência do Angular com inject() e providers.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы расширенные возможности внедрения зависимостей Angular с inject() и providers.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحديث التبعيات في Angular مع inject() و providers."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure and use dependency injection in Angular v20+ with inject() and providers, utilizing libraries like @angular/core and @angular/common/http for efficient component development.","zh":"赋予代理配置和使用 Angular v20+ 中的依赖注入功能，包括 inject() 和提供者，利用 @angular/core 和 @angular/common/http 库进行高效的组件开发。","ja":"エージェントが Angular v20+ で依存注入を構成して使用できるようにすることで、inject() とプロバイダーを使用し、@angular/core と @angular/common/http ライブラリを使用して効率的なコンポーネント開発を行うことができます。","ko":"에이전트가 Angular v20+에서 의존성 주입을 구성 및 사용할 수 있도록 하여 inject() 및 제공자를 사용하고, @angular/core 및 @angular/common/http 라이브러리를 사용하여 효율적인 컴포넌트 개발을 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a configurar y utilizar la inyección de dependencias en Angular v20+ con inject() y proveedores, utilizando bibliotecas como @angular/core y @angular/common/http para un desarrollo de componentes eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer et d''utiliser l''injection de dépendances dans Angular v20+ avec inject() et fournisseurs, en utilisant des bibliothèques comme @angular/core et @angular/common/http pour un développement de composants efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Abhängigkeitsinjektion in Angular v20+ mit inject() und Providern zu konfigurieren und zu verwenden, unter Verwendung von Bibliotheken wie @angular/core und @angular/common/http für eine effiziente Komponentenentwicklung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar e usar a injeção de dependência no Angular v20+ com inject() e providers, utilizando bibliotecas como @angular/core e @angular/common/http para um desenvolvimento de componentes eficiente.","ru":"Позволяет агентам настраивать и использовать внедрение зависимостей в Angular v20+ с inject() и providers, используя библиотеки như @angular/core и @angular/common/http для эффективного развития компонентов.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تكوين واستخدام تحديث التبعيات في Angular v20+ مع inject() و providers، باستخدام مكتبات مثل @angular/core و @angular/common/http من أجل تطوير مكونات فعال."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring providers for HTTP clients","Injecting dependencies with inject()","Optimizing component architecture with dependency injection"],"zh":["为 HTTP 客户端配置提供者","使用 inject() 注入依赖","使用依赖注入优化组件架构"],"ja":["HTTP クライアントのプロバイダーの構成","inject() を使用した依存性の注入","依存性の注入を使用したコンポーネント アーキテクチャの最適化"],"ko":["HTTP 클라이언트를 위한 제공자 구성","inject()를 사용한 의존성 주입","의존성 주입을 사용한 컴포넌트 아키텍처 최적화"],"es":["Configuración de proveedores para clientes HTTP","Inyección de dependencias con inject()","Optimización de la arquitectura de componentes con inyección de dependencias"],"fr":["Configuration des fournisseurs pour les clients HTTP","Injection de dépendances avec inject()","Optimisation de l''architecture de composants avec injection de dépendances"],"de":["Konfiguration von Providern für HTTP-Clients","Injizierung von Abhängigkeiten mit inject()","Optimierung der Komponentenarchitektur mit Abhängigkeitsinjektion"],"pt":["Configurando provedores para clientes HTTP","Injetando dependências com inject()","Otimizando a arquitetura de componentes com injeção de dependência"],"ru":["Настройка провайдеров для HTTP-клиентов","Внедрение зависимостей с inject()","Оптимизация архитектуры компонентов с помощью внедрения зависимостей"],"ar":["تكوين مزودي خدمات للعملاء HTTP","حقن التبعيات مع inject()","تحسين بنية المكونات مع تحديث التبعيات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Angular v20+","Specific to Angular dependency injection"],"zh":["需要 Angular v20+","仅限 Angular 依赖注入"],"ja":["Angular v20+ が必要","Angular での依存注入に限定"],"ko":["Angular v20+ 필요","Angular 의존성 주입에 한정"],"es":["Requiere Angular v20+","Específico para la inyección de dependencias de Angular"],"fr":["Nécessite Angular v20+","Spécifique à l''injection de dépendances Angular"],"de":["Benötigt Angular v20+","Spezifisch für die Abhängigkeitsinjektion von Angular"],"pt":["Exige Angular v20+","Específico para injeção de dependência do Angular"],"ru":["Требует Angular v20+","Спецефичен для внедрения зависимостей Angular"],"ar":["يتطلب Angular v20+","محدد لتحديث التبعيات في Angular"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fd379b252703f563e6d850b54667cc2ee72f41cbe4ded9d26646f04d82db51dc","qualityScore":28}');
