ng von Produktreleases","Koordinierung von Entwicklerteams","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Analyse von Daten und Metriken","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Node.js"],"pt":["Automatização do processo de lançamento de software","Gerenciamento de releases","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Análise de riscos e problemas","Otimização do processo de lançamento"],"ru":["Автоматизация процесса выпуска программного обеспечения","Управление выпусками","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Анализ рисков и проблем","Оптимизация процесса выпуска"],"ar":["ت自動ة proceso de lançamento de software","إدارة الإصدارات","التgetIntegração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","التحليل riskov و problemas","تأملية proceso de lançamento"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Release Manager AI工具","如何使用Release Manager","什么是Release Manager","Release Manager替代品","Release Manager vs Jenkins","Release Manager安装","Release Manager设置指南"],"ja":["Release Manager AIエージェント","Release Managerの使用方法","Release Managerとは","Release Managerの代替","Release Manager vs Jenkins","Release Managerのインストール","Release Managerの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Release Manager AI 에이전트","Release Manager 사용 방법","Release Manager란","Release Manager 대체","Release Manager vs Jenkins","Release Manager 설치","Release Manager 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo utilizar release-manager","qué es release-manager","release-manager alternativa","release-manager vs Jenkins","instalación de release-manager","guía de configuración de release-manager","release-manager y Python","release-manager y CLI"],"fr":["comment utiliser release-manager","qu''est-ce que release-manager","release-manager alternative","release-manager vs Jenkins","installation de release-manager","guide de configuration de release-manager","release-manager et Python","release-manager et CLI"],"de":["wie man release-manager verwendet","was ist release-manager","release-manager alternative","release-manager vs Jenkins","installation von release-manager","handbuch für die konfiguration von release-manager","release-manager und Python","release-manager und CLI"],"pt":["ferramenta de ai para desenvolvedores","gerente de releases","automatização do processo de lançamento de software","integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","análise de riscos e problemas","otimização do processo de lançamento"],"ru":["инструмент ии для разработчиков","ии агенты","автоматизация процесса выпуска программного обеспечения","интеграция с инструментами разработки","анализ рисков и проблем","оптимизация процесса выпуска"],"ar":["أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لل開発","إدارة الإصدارات","ت自動ة proceso de lançamento de software","التgetIntegração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","التحليل riskov و problemas","تأملية proceso de lançamento"]}},"owner":"finos","repo":"morphir","repoPath":"finos/morphir","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.682Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release-manager","description":"Assists with Morphir release management, including pre-release verification, changelog generation, and release coordination. Use when preparing releases, checking release readiness, or managing version bumps.","bodyPreview":"# Release Manager Skill\n\nYou are a release management assistant specialized in Morphir releases. You help ensure releases are properly verified, documented, and coordinated.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n1. **Pre-Release Verification** - Run all checks before releasing\n2. **Changelog Management** - Generate and review changelogs\n3. **Version Management** - Coordinate version bumps\n4. **Release Coordination** - Manage the release workflow\n\n## Pre-Release Verification Checklist\n\nBefore any release, run the fo","body":"# Release Manager Skill\n\nYou are a release management assistant specialized in Morphir releases. You help ensure releases are properly verified, documented, and coordinated.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n1. **Pre-Release Verification** - Run all checks before releasing\n2. **Changelog Management** - Generate and review changelogs\n3. **Version Management** - Coordinate version bumps\n4. **Release Coordination** - Manage the release workflow\n\n## Pre-Release Verification Checklist\n\nBefore any release, run the following verification steps:\n\n### Automated Checks\n\n```bash\n# 1. Run all formatting checks\nmise run fmt-check\n\n# 2. Run all linters\nmise run lint\n\n# 3. Run all tests\nmise run test\n\n# 4. Validate schemas against metaschema\nmise run schema:validate\n\n# 5. Validate documentation examples\nmise run examples:validate\n\n# 6. Validate fixtures\nmise run fixtures:validate\n\n# 7. Verify schema sync (YAML/JSON)\nmise run docs:schema:verify\n\n# 8. Full check pipeline (runs all of the above)\nmise run check\n```\n\n### Manual Verification\n\n- [ ] CHANGELOG.md is updated with all notable changes\n- [ ] Version numbers are consistent across all files\n- [ ] Breaking changes are documented with migration guides\n- [ ] All CI pipelines are green\n- [ ] Documentation site builds successfully\n\n## Release Workflow\n\n### 1. Prepare Release\n\n```bash\n# Ensure all checks pass\nmise run check\n\n# Generate changelog (if using git-cliff)\ngit cliff --unreleased --tag vX.Y.Z > CHANGELOG-next.md\n\n# Review and merge changelog\n```\n\n### 2. Create Release\n\n```bash\n# Create release branch (if applicable)\ngit checkout -b release/vX.Y.Z\n\n# Update version numbers\n# - Cargo.toml\n# - package.json (if applicable)\n# - Any other version files\n\n# Commit version bump\ngit commit -am \"chore: bump version to X.Y.Z\"\n\n# Create tag\ngit tag -a vX.Y.Z -m \"Release vX.Y.Z\"\n\n# Push\ngit push origin release/vX.Y.Z --tags\n```\n\n### 3. Post-Release\n\n- [ ] Verify GitHub release is created\n- [ ] Verify documentation site is updated\n- [ ] Verify npm/cargo packages are published (if applicable)\n- [ ] Announce release in appropriate channels\n\n## CI Integration\n\nThe following checks should be part of CI and must pass before release:\n\n| Check | Task | Required |\n|-------|------|----------|\n| Formatting | `mise run fmt-check` | ✓ |\n| Linting | `mise run lint` | ✓ |\n| Tests | `mise run test` | ✓ |\n| Schema validation | `mise run schema:validate` | ✓ |\n| Example validation | `mise run examples:validate` | ✓ |\n| Fixture validation | `mise run fixtures:validate` | ✓ |\n| Schema sync | `mise run docs:schema:verify` | ✓ |\n\n## Task Reference\n\n| Task | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `mise run check` | Run all checks (formatting, linting, validation) |\n| `mise run fmt` | Format all code |\n| `mise run fmt:rust` | Format Rust code only |\n| `mise run fmt:schema` | Format JSON Schema files only |\n| `mise run lint` | Run all linters |\n| `mise run lint:rust` | Run Clippy only |\n| `mise run lint:schema` | Lint JSON Schema files only |\n| `mise run test` | Run all tests |\n| `mise run schema:validate` | Validate schemas against metaschema |\n| `mise run examples:validate` | Validate doc examples against schemas |\n| `mise run fixtures:validate` | Validate fixture files against schemas |\n| `mise run docs:schema:verify` | Verify YAML/JSON schema sync |\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Schema Validation Failures\n\nIf `schema:validate` fails:\n1. Check the specific error message\n2. Validate the schema file syntax\n3. Ensure the schema follows JSON Schema draft-07/2019-09/2020-12 as appropriate\n\n### Example Validation Failures\n\nIf `examples:validate` fails:\n1. Check which files failed with `mise run examples:validate --verbose`\n2. Ensure `formatVersion` field is present in example files\n3. Verify examples match the schema for their version\n\n### Fixture Validation Failures\n\nIf `fixtures:validate` fails:\n1. Fixtures may need to be refetched: `mise run fixtures:fetch`\n2. Check if fixtures are valid Morphir IR format\n3. Ensure fixtures are in the expected locations:\n   - `.morphir/testing/fixtures/`\n   - `tests/bdd/testdata/morphir-ir/`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:24:36.877Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring streamlined release management workflows, particularly those utilizing Morphir releases.","zh":"适用于需要简化发布管理工作流的开发代理，特别是那些使用Morphir发布的代理。","ja":"Morphirリリースを使用している開発エージェントがストリームライン化されたリリース管理ワークフローを必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"Morphir 릴리즈를 사용하는 개발 에이전트가 스트림라인화된 릴리즈 관리 워크플로를 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren flujos de trabajo de administración de versiones simplificados, particularmente aquellos que utilizan releases de Morphir.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant des flux de travail de gestion de version simplifiés, en particulier ceux utilisant les versions Morphir.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die optimierte Release-Management-Workflows benötigen, insbesondere solche, die Morphir-Veröffentlichungen nutzen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem fluxos de trabalho de gerenciamento de lançamento otimizados, particularmente aqueles que utilizam lançamentos Morphir.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих оптимизированных рабочих процессов управления выпусками, особенно тех, которые используют выпуски Morphir.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب تدفقات عمل إدارة الإصدار المُبسطة، خاصة تلك التي تستخدم إصدارات Morphir."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to coordinate version bumps, manage changelogs, and verify releases through pre-release checks, ensuring seamless release coordination and documentation using Morphir releases.","zh":"赋予代理协调版本升级、管理变更日志、并通过预发布检查验证发布，确保使用Morphir发布的发布协调和文档无缝进行。","ja":"エージェントがバージョンのバンプを調整し、変更ログを管理し、事前リリースチェックを介してリリースを検証することを可能にし、Morphirリリースを使用したリリースの調整とドキュメントをスムーズに行う。","ko":"에이전트가 버전 업그레이드의 조정을 가능하게 하고, 변경 로그를 관리하고, 사전 릴리즈 체크를 통해 릴리즈를 검증하며, Morphir 릴리즈를 사용한 릴리즈 조정과 문서화를 원활하게 진행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes coordinar incrementos de versión, administrar registros de cambios y verificar releases a través de comprobaciones previas a la release, garantizando una coordinación y documentación de release sin problemas utilizando releases de Morphir.","fr":"Permet aux agents de coordonner les increments de version, de gérer les journaux des modifications et de vérifier les versions via des vérifications préalables à la version, assurant une coordination et une documentation de version sans problème en utilisant les versions Morphir.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Versionsnummern zu koordinieren, Änderungsprotokolle zu verwalten und Releases durch vorab-Release-Prüfungen zu überprüfen, um eine reibungslose Release-Koordination und -Dokumentation unter Verwendung von Morphir-Releases sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a coordenar aumentos de versão, gerenciar registros de alterações e verificar lançamentos por meio de verificações pré-lançamento, garantindo uma coordenação de lançamento e documentação sem problemas usando lançamentos Morphir.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью координировать обновления версий, управлять журналами изменений и проверять выпуски посредством предварительных проверок, обеспечивая бесперебойную координацию выпуска и документацию с помощью выпусков Morphir.","ar":"يُمكن العميل من تنسيق ترقيات الإصدار وإدارة سجلات التغييرات والتحقق من الإصدارات من خلال عمليات التحقق قبل الإصدار، مما يضمن تنسيق الإصدار والتوثيق دون مشاكل باستخدام إصدارات Morphir."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pre-release verification checks","Generating and reviewing changelogs for Morphir releases","Coordinating version management and release workflows"],"zh":["自动化预发布验证检查","为Morphir发布生成和审查变更日志","协调版本管理和发布工作流"],"ja":["事前リリースの検証チェックの自動化","Morphirリリースの変更ログの生成とレビュー","バージョン管理とリリースワークフローの調整"],"ko":["사전 릴리즈 검증 체크의 자동화","Morphir 릴리즈의 변경 로그 생성 및 검토","버전 관리 및 릴리즈 워크플로우의 조정"],"es":["Automatizar comprobaciones de verificación previa a la release","Generar y revisar registros de cambios para releases de Morphir","Coordinar la administración de versiones y flujos de trabajo de release"],"fr":["Automatiser les vérifications préalables à la version","Générer et examiner les journaux des modifications pour les versions Morphir","Coordonner la gestion des versions et les flux de travail de version"],"de":["Automatisierung von vorab-Release-Prüfungen","Erstellung und Überprüfung von Änderungsprotokollen für Morphir-Releases","Koordinierung von Versionsverwaltung und Release-Workflows"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de verificação pré-lançamento","Gerar e revisar registros de alterações para lançamentos Morphir","Coordenar gerenciamento de versão e fluxos de trabalho de lançamento"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки предварительной верификации","Генерировать и просматривать журналы изменений для выпусков Morphir","Координировать управление версиями и рабочие процессы выпуска"],"ar":["توفير عمليات التحقق قبل الإصدار","_generar ومراجعة سجلات التغييرات لإصدارات Morphir","تنسيق إدارة الإصدار وعمليات الإصدار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Morphir release environment","Limited to Morphir-specific release management"],"zh":["需要Morphir发布环境","仅限Morphir特定的发布管理"],"ja":["Morphirリリース環境が必要","Morphir専用のリリース管理に限定される"],"ko":["Morphir 릴리즈 환경이 필요","Morphir 전용 릴리즈 관리로 제한"],"es":["Requiere entorno de release de Morphir","Limitado a la administración de releases específica de Morphir"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de version Morphir","Limité à la gestion de versions spécifique à Morphir"],"de":["Benötigt Morphir-Release-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Morphir-spezifische Release-Verwaltung"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de lançamento Morphir","Limitado ao gerenciamento de lançamento específico do Morphir"],"ru":["Требует среды выпуска Morphir","Ограничен управлением выпуском, специфичным для Morphir"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة إصدار Morphir","محدود لإدارة الإصدار الخاصة بـ Morphir"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"26039204c1d9fcf8fdc79e64ca92c93ce16a1164d27ecc006b66c029f21153e5","qualityScore":28}');
